# libretranslate
msgid "(c) Fork-and-port. Highest maintenance cost; last resort. Pick (a) unless upstream already supports (b). This is the single biggest technical risk and should be spiked first."
msgstr "(c) Fork-and-port. Mantentze-kostu handiena; azken baliabidea. Aukeratu (a) upstream-ek jadanik onartzen ez badu (b)Hau da arrisku teknikorik handiena, eta aldez aurretik ikusi beharko litzateke."

