msgid "**Added:** New workstation bundles (*admin*, *admin-network*, *browser*, *design*, *dev-arduino*, *dev-core*, *dev-java*, *dev-php*, *dev-python*, *dev-shell*, *game-compose*, *game-os*, *game-windows*, *office*). Inventory driven *sys-package* role with constructor auto load when *SYS_PACKAGES* is set. New roles *sys-openssl* and *sys-aur-install*. New lookup plugin *command_path*. New variable *SOFTWARE_URL* and updated login banner."
