# libretranslate
msgid "**Addon state is a variant axis.** Optional addons (`required: false`) MUST express their enabled/disabled split through the role's [`meta/variants.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) so CI matrix runs exercise both states, mirroring requirement 025's MCP variant axis. Required addons (`required: true`) are not a variant axis because they are always installed."
msgstr "**Addon egoera ardatz aldagarria da.** Aukerako gehigarriak (`required: false`) Eginkizunaren bidez gaitu/desgaitu egin behar dira. [`meta/variants.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) Beraz, CI matrizeak bi egoera erabiltzen ditu, baldintza ispilatzailea 025MCP aldagarriaren ardatza. Beharrezko gehigarriak (`required: true`) ez dira ardatz aldagarriak, beti instalatuta daudelako."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Admin / role model = both** (operator: \"admin anlegen wenn nicht oidc sonst claim mapping\"), implemented within Semaphore's constraints: (a) a **break-glass local admin** is always seeded via `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` with a dedicated `breakglass` login + dedicated email — reachable via the form only when LDAP is off; (b) when SSO is enabled the role creates the Keycloak administrator as an **external admin** at deploy time (`semaphore user add --admin --external`), so the OIDC callback (matches by email, accepts only external users) elevates that operator to admin. Upstream has no claim→role mapping, so this deploy-time external-admin seed is the \"smallest reconciliation step\"."
msgstr "**Admin/rol modeloa = biak** (eragilea: \"admin anlegen wenn nicht oidc sonst erreklamazioa mapatzea\"), Semafororen mugen barruan ezarrita: (a) a **break-glass local admin** beti hazi da `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` dedikatu batekin `breakglass` saio-hasiera + mezu dedikatua, inprimakiaren bidez hel daitekeena, soilik LDAP desaktibatuta dagoenean; (b) SSO gaituta dagoenean, rolak Keycloak administratzailea sortzen du **Kanpoko admin** deploy time (`semaphore user add --admin --external`)Beraz, OIDC atzeradeia (posta elektronikoz bat dator, kanpoko erabiltzaileak bakarrik onartzen ditu) Eragilea administratzailera igotzen du. Upstream-ek ez du inolako eskakizunik mapatzen, beraz, kanpoko haziaren hedapena da \"adiskidetze-mailarik txikiena\"."

