# libretranslate
msgid "**Automatic pkgmgr Update:** Ensures the package manager is always up-to-date."
msgstr "**Pkgmgr eguneraketa automatikoa:** Pakete-kudeatzailea eguneratuta dagoela ziurtatzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Automatic registration:** The runner container fetches a short-lived GitHub registration token from the API at startup using `RUNNER_API_TOKEN`."
msgstr "**Erregistro automatikoa:** Lasterkariaren edukiontziak iraupen laburreko GitHub-en erregistro-tokena jasotzen du abioko APItik. `RUNNER_API_TOKEN`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Automatic registration:** The runner container fetches a short-lived GitHub registration token from the API at startup using ``RUNNER_API_TOKEN``."
