# libretranslate
msgid "**Control is raw device access plus agent code execution; no robotics middleware is mandated.** Hermes drives the hardware by executing code directly against the granted devices (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video libraries), consistent with its self-exploration. This is the deliberate choice over a ROS2/middleware abstraction: the embodied device is already the trust boundary (there is no microVM here), so the agent runs code on the device itself. A middleware layer MAY be added later per robot but is not required by this role."
msgstr "**Kontrola gailu gordinen atzipena eta agenteen kode-exekuzioa da; ez dago erdi-robotikarik.** Hermesek hardwarea gidatzen du emandako gailuen aurka kodea zuzenean exekutatuz (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video liburutegiak), Bere buruaren esplotazioarekin bat. Hau da ROS baten gaineko erabaki deliberatua.2/middleware abstrakzioa: gailua jadanik konfiantzazko muga da (Ez dago mikroVMrik hemen.)Beraz, agenteak kodea exekutatzen du gailuan bertan. Bigarren mailako geruza bat gehitu daiteke robot bakoitzeko, baina ez da beharrezkoa."

