msgid "**Dependencies**"
msgstr "**Mendekotasunak**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependencies** — the central services and sibling roles it consumes (the `enabled: \"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"` service flags, plus `run_after` and any `meta/main.yml` `dependencies`)."
msgstr "**Mendekotasunak** zerbitzu zentralak eta kontsumitzen dituen funtzioak (eta `enabled: \"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"` zerbitzu-banderak, gehi `run_after` eta `meta/main.yml` `dependencies`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works in conjunction with related roles for comprehensive backup management."
msgstr "**Mendekotasuna integratzea:** Babeskopiaren kudeaketa integralerako zereginekin batera lan egiten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) roles."
msgstr "**Mendekotasuna integratzea:** Lanik gabe lan egiten du [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) eta [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) Rolak."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ roles."
msgstr "**Mendekotasuna integratzea:** Lanik gabe lan egiten du `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ eta `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ Rolak."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Zabaldu iterazioa.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) plan bera birsortzen du `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (Planner funtzio hutsa da, init eta hedapenaren artean partekatua.) eta pakete bat exekutatzen du karpetako. **Txanda bakoitzak bere aldagarri osoa zabaltzen du.** R biribila ostalari garbitik hasten da (Aurreko biribilaren barruan R biribila hasi aurretik garbitzen da, ikusi puntua 5)Beraz, R-ren inguruan dauden ipurtargi guztiak berriro garbitu behar dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Enkriptatutako zerbitzari batean** Instalatu behar duzu Infinito.Nexus enkriptatutako zerbitzari batean, ostalariek azken erabiltzailearen datuak atzitzea saihesteko. Enkriptatutako zerbitzari bat konfiguratzeko gida praktiko baterako, ikus . [Hetzner Arch LUKS biltegia](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Ikasi gehiago [disko enkriptazioa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) Wikipedian.)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."
msgstr "**Deploy** Enkriptatu erronka eta zeharkako mozkina ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."
msgstr "**Deploy** Enkriptatu erronka eta zeharkako mozkina `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deployment and packaging foundations.** A host deployment mode joins Compose and Swarm in the deployment tooling. The former *sys-package*, *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install* roles were replaced by a distribution-independent package registry. Volume metadata now uses one canonical schema, single-file mounts become Swarm configs, and service placement, replica counts, dependencies, addresses and health probes resolve through deployment-aware lookups."
msgstr "**Garraiatzeko eta paketatzeko oinarriak.** Ostalarien hedapen modu batek Compose eta Swarm elkartzen ditu inplementazio-tresnan. Lehengoa *paketea*, *S-aur* eta *sys-aur-install* Paperak pakete-erregistro independente batek ordeztu zituen. Bolumenaren metadatuek eskema kanoniko bat erabiltzen dute, fitxategi bakarreko muntatzeak Swarm konfigurazio bihurtzen dira, eta zerbitzuaren kokapena, erreplika zenbaketak, mendekotasunak, helbideak eta osasun-zundak inplementazio-lanen bidez konpontzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for ``ssh-agent``."
msgstr "**Garatu eta sistematutako erabiltzaile-zerbitzu bat eskaintzen du** zeren ``ssh-agent``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for `ssh-agent`."
msgstr "**Garatu eta sistematutako erabiltzaile-zerbitzu bat eskaintzen du** zeren `ssh-agent`."

