# libretranslate
msgid "**Enforce 2FA and Use a Password Manager** Administrators MUST enforce [2FA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multi-factor_authentication) and SHOULD use a password manager with auto-generated passwords. We recommend [KeePass](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KeePass). The KeePass database can be stored securely in your Nextcloud instance and synchronized between devices."
msgstr "**Enforce 2FA eta Erabili pasahitz-kudeatzailea** Administratzaileek behartu egin behar dute [2FA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multi-factor_authentication) Pasahitz-kudeatzaile bat erabili behar da automatikoki sortutako pasahitzekin. Gomendatzen dizugu [KeePass](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KeePass). KeePass-en datu-basea seguru gorde daiteke Nextcloud instantzian eta gailuen artean sinkroniza daiteke."

