# libretranslate
msgid "**Every MCP implementation ships a Playwright test.** Each role that gains an MCP surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises its MCP surface (a server role's authenticated endpoint, a client role's configured-server list). No MCP role is considered implemented until its Playwright test is present and green."
msgstr "**MCP inplementazio bakoitzak Playwright proba bat bidaltzen du.** MCPren gainazal bat irabazten duen rol bakoitzak Playwright espektro bat gehitu behar du azpian `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` MCPren gainazala lantzen du (zerbitzari-rol bat autentifikatutako amaierako puntua, bezero-rol bat konfiguratutako zerbitzarien zerrenda). Ez da MCPren paperik inplementatzen Playwright proba agertu eta berdea izan arte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every addon ships a Playwright test.** Each addon with a user-facing surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises that addon's behaviour (e.g. an `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login path, a `wp-discourse` round-trip, an enabled Odoo module's UI entry point). Desktop roles (`desk-*`) drive no web surface a Playwright test could exercise and therefore NEVER ship addon specs — the lint forbids spec files under `desk-*` roles. For every web-facing role there is no per-addon exemption: an addon is considered migrated only once its Playwright spec is present and green. Cross-role integration specs (proving two roles are actually connected) run under a dedicated **integration-pair deploy variant** that co-deploys both partner roles, and are added incrementally as each ✅ pair is wired rather than all upfront."
msgstr "**Gehigarri bakoitzak Playwright proba bat bidaltzen du.** Erabiltzaile-azalera duen gehigarri bakoitzak Playwright-eko espektro bat gehitu behar du `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` addon-en portaera hori lantzen du. (adibidez, `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` saio-hasierako bidea, a `wp-discourse` biribila, Odoo moduluko UI sarrera-puntu gaitua). Mahaigainaren funtzioak (`desk-*`) Ez gidatu web-azalera Playwright-eko probak egin ditzakeenik eta, beraz, inoiz ez bidali gehigarrien zehaztapenik -lint-ek espezifikazio-fitxategiak debekatzen ditu azpian `desk-*` Rolak. Webaren funtzio guztietarako ez dago salbuespenik: gehigarri bat migratutzat jotzen da Playwright-eko espektoia agertu eta berdea denean. Cross-role integrazioaren espektroak (bi rol benetan lotuta daudela frogatzen) exekutatu dedikatu baten azpian **integrazio-pair aldaera** bazkideen rolak bateratzen dituela eta bakoitza bezala gehitzen direla. ✅ Parea aurrez aurre jarri beharrean dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in ``.applied.json``, then ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re-pins to this run’s values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. ``custom-secret-id`` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers ``500`` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Aplikazio bakoitzak AppRole biratzen du.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` Korrika ez da exekutatzen ari den instantzia. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` Inbentario bikotearekin saiatzen da, grabatutako bikotera itzultzen da ``.applied.json``, orduan ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` Lasterkari honen balioetara jotzen du berriro eta SecretID zaharra suntsitzen du. Erregistroa azkena da, beraz, aurreko belaunaldia osorik uzten duen pista bat. ``custom-secret-id`` da **ez** idempotent - erantzun ezkutuak berriro idaztea ``500`` -Beraz, trukea balioa aldatu ondoren ezartzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. `tasks/01_init.yml` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in `.applied.json`, then `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re-pins to this run's values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. `custom-secret-id` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers `500` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Aplikazio bakoitzak AppRole biratzen du.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` Korrika ez da exekutatzen ari den instantzia. `tasks/01_init.yml` Inbentario bikotearekin saiatzen da, grabatutako bikotera itzultzen da `.applied.json`, orduan `tasks/06_rotate.yml` Lasterkari honen balioetara jotzen du berriro eta SecretID zaharra suntsitzen du. Erregistroa azkena da, beraz, aurreko belaunaldia osorik uzten duen pista bat. `custom-secret-id` da **ez** idempotent - erantzun ezkutuak berriro idaztea `500` -Beraz, trukea balioa aldatu ondoren ezartzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every mounted volume is discarded**, not only the backed-up ones. A volume declared `backup: false` claims to be disposable; a drill that spares it never tests the claim. If its service cannot rebuild it, the health gate goes red — that is the finding, not a false alarm. The single exception is the data directory of an engine whose dump is about to be replayed: it carries the database and its role, which the deploy creates and the container does not, so wiping it would leave `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` with nothing to connect to and the drill would fail at itself instead of at a defect."
msgstr "**Muntatutako bolumen guztiak baztertu egiten dira**Ez bakarrik babesleak. Adierazitako bolumena `backup: false` Ez omen da erabili behar. Bere zerbitzuak ezin badu berreraiki, osasun-atea gorritzen da, hau da, alarma faltsua. Salbuespen bakarra motor baten datu-direktorioa da, zeinaren iraulia berriro erreproduzituko den: datu-basea eta bere funtzioa ditu, eta hori deployak sortzen du eta edukiontziak ez, beraz, ezabatuz gero, utzi egingo litzateke. `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` Ez dago ezer konektatzeko, eta zulagailuak huts egingo luke akats baten ordez."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every ref:** Role data, categories, bundles, files and TODO markers for the deployed working tree, any branch, tag or commit of core, and every branch or tag of its forks."
msgstr "**Errefus bakoitza:** Rol-datuak, kategoriak, sortak, fitxategiak eta TODO markatzaileak lan-zuhaitz hedatuarentzat, edozein adar, etiketa edo nukleo-betebeharra, eta bere sarderen adar edo etiketa oro."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every release:** The latest commit is the default, each release tag is selectable and built on demand."
