# libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible DB:** Use platform's central MariaDB or app-local DB."
msgstr "**DB malgua:** Erabili plataformaren erdiko MariaDB edo app-local DB."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible DB:** Use platform’s central MariaDB or app-local DB."
msgstr "**DB malgua:** Erabili plataformaren erdiko MariaDB edo app-local DB."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Deployment:** Easily scale and customize using Docker Compose, with configurable settings for networking, storage, and external services."
msgstr "**Garapen malgua:** Docker Compose erabiliz erraz eskalatzea eta pertsonalizatzea, sareko, biltegiko eta kanpoko zerbitzuetarako ezarpen konfiguragarriekin."

