# libretranslate
msgid "**Full Unicode support**: `utf8mb4` is the only MySQL/MariaDB character set that fully implements 4‑byte UTF‑8, allowing storage of emojis, supplementary symbols, and all global scripts without data loss."
msgstr "**Unicode euskarria**: `utf8mb4` MySQL/MariaDB karaktere-multzo bakarra da, guztiz inplementatzen duena. 4‐byte UTF‐8emojiak, sinbolo osagarriak eta script global guztiak datuak galdu gabe gordetzea baimentzen du."

msgid "**Full extraction set:** the `-full` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
