# libretranslate
msgid "**In-container configuration** follows [`svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml`](../../roles/svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml): a shell exec into the container where the credential arrives through a container env var, never through Ansible's process arguments, guarded by `no_log: \"{{ MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS | bool }}\"`."
msgstr "**Incontainer konfigurazioa** ondoren [`svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml`](../../roles/svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml): shell-a edukiontzian exekutatzen da, non kredentziala edukiontzi baten bidez iristen den, inoiz ez Ansibleren prozesuaren argumentuen bidez, zeinak zaintzen dituen. `no_log: \"{{ MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS | bool }}\"`."

