# libretranslate
msgid "**Independent of docker:** Docker owns its own tables and never touches these, so no rule has to be inserted into a chain another component controls. The unit is only enabled, never started or restarted: on Debian its `ExecStop` flushes the entire ruleset, docker's tables included, and the fragments are loaded explicitly anyway."
msgstr "**Docker-ekiko independentea:** Docker bere mahaien jabe da eta ez ditu inoiz ukitzen, beraz, ez da araurik sartu behar kate batean beste osagai-kontrol batzuk. Unitatea gaituta dago, ez da inoiz abiarazi edo berrabiarazi: Debianen berea da `ExecStop` arau-multzo osoa iraultzen du, docker-en mahaiak barne, eta zatiak esplizituki kargatzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Independent of docker:** Docker owns its own tables and never touches these, so no rule has to be inserted into a chain another component controls. The unit is only enabled, never started or restarted: on Debian its ``ExecStop`` flushes the entire ruleset, docker’s tables included, and the fragments are loaded explicitly anyway."
msgstr "**Docker-ekiko independentea:** Docker bere mahaien jabe da eta ez ditu inoiz ukitzen, beraz, ez da araurik sartu behar kate batean beste osagai-kontrol batzuk. Unitatea gaituta dago, ez da inoiz abiarazi edo berrabiarazi: Debianen berea da ``ExecStop`` arau-multzo osoa iraultzen du, docker-en mahaiak barne, eta zatiak esplizituki kargatzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Infinito.Nexus** is an **automated, modular infrastructure framework** built on **Docker**, **Linux**, and **Ansible**, equally suited for cloud services, local server management, and desktop workstations. At its core lies a **web-based desktop with single sign-on**, backed by an **LDAP directory** and **OIDC**, granting **seamless access** to an almost limitless portfolio of self-hosted applications. It fully supports **ActivityPub applications** and is **Fediverse-compatible**, while integrated **monitoring**, **alerting**, **cleanup**, **self-healing**, **automated updates**, and **backup solutions** provide everything an organization needs to run at scale."
msgstr "**Infinito.Nexus** bat da **Azpiegitura modular automatizatuen esparrua** Eraikia **Docker**, **Linux**eta **Ansible**hodei-zerbitzuetarako, zerbitzari lokalen kudeaketarako eta mahaigaineko lan-estazioetarako ere egokia. Bere muinean dago **webean oinarritutako mahaigaina, zeinu bakarrarekin**baten babesarekin **LDAP direktorioa** eta **OIDC**ematea **sarbiderik gabekoa** ia mugarik gabeko aplikazioen zorroan. Erabat onartzen du **ActivityPub aplikazioak** eta **Fediverse-compatible**integratuta dagoen bitartean **monitorizazioa**, **alerta**, **garbiketa**, **auto-errealizazioa**, **Eguneraketa automatikoak**eta **babeskopia-soluzioak** erakunde batek eskalan egin behar duen guztia eskaintzea."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Inline data manipulation:** Filters are designed for inline use in Jinja2 expressions (in templates, tasks, vars, etc.)."
msgstr "**Datuen manipulazioa:** Iragazkiak linean erabiltzeko diseinatuta daude Jinja-n2 adierazpenak (txantiloietan, zereginetan, varretan, etab.)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Inner loop**: the edit-rerun cycle on `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` driven by `make compose-playwright role=<role>`, without a redeploy. On the act-swarm test cluster the equivalent is `make swarm-playwright role=<role>`, which first copies the working-tree's modified files into the node's frozen bootstrap copy (swarm nodes are not bind-mounted like compose)."
msgstr "**Barneko begizta**: edizio-zikloa martxan `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` gidatua `make compose-playwright role=<role>`, gorri-gorririk gabe. Proba-kumuluan baliokidea da `make swarm-playwright role=<role>`, Lan-zuhaitzaren fitxategi eraldatuak nodoaren hondakin izoztuen kopian kopiatzen dituena (nodo pilak ez daude lotuta, konposatu gisa)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Input**"
