# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Karpeta inbentarioak.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) deiak [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), eta horrek karpeta bat sortzen du biribilean `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (edo besterik gabe `<inventory-dir>` biribil bakarra dagoenean)Karpeta bakoitzeko, `build_dev_inventory` Txandakako ordain-ordainketa erabakitzen du eta inbentarioan erreko du. `host_vars` bezala `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` gainjarriak. Inbentarioa aldagarria da diskoan, eta ez da exekuzio-denboraren hautatzailea behar."

