# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO via SSO-proxy sidecar:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI through the project's SSO-proxy sidecar (provided by `web-app-keycloak`) for OIDC-authenticated entry."
msgstr "**Jatorrizko OIDC SSO SSO-proxy sidecar bidez:** FusionDirectory webgunea UI proiektuaren SSO-proxy sidecar bidez (emandakoa `web-app-keycloak`) OIDC-authenticated sarrerarako."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO via SSO-proxy sidecar:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI through the project’s SSO-proxy sidecar (provided by ``web-app-keycloak``) for OIDC-authenticated entry."
