# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the ``oic-auth`` plugin, configured by JCasC at boot."
msgstr "**Jatorrizko OIDC SSO:** Autentifikatu erabiltzaileak Keycloak-en aurka ``oic-auth`` Plugina, JCasC-k abiarazia."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the `oic-auth` plugin, configured by JCasC at boot."
