# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC flavor** (`services.sso.flavor: oidc`), not the oauth2-proxy gate: OpenBao speaks OIDC itself, so it follows [`web-app-semaphore`](../../roles/web-app-semaphore/) rather than [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."
msgstr "**OIDC zapore natiboa** (`services.sso.flavor: oidc`), Ez oauth2-proxy gate: OpenBao-k OIDC bera hitz egiten du. [`web-app-semaphore`](../../roles/web-app-semaphore/) ordez, [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native Prometheus metrics** via the `services.prometheus.native_metrics` + `templates/prometheus.yml.j2` contract already used by [`web-app-gitea`](../../roles/web-app-gitea/templates/prometheus.yml.j2), scraped on the internal container port over the role-local docker network."
msgstr "**Jatorrizkoa Prometheus metrika** bidez `services.prometheus.native_metrics` + `templates/prometheus.yml.j2` kontratua jadanik erabilita [`web-app-gitea`](../../roles/web-app-gitea/templates/prometheus.yml.j2), barneko edukiontziaren atakan, docker sare lokalaren gainean."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native in all editions** (incl. Raw): LDAP \"connections\" sync users, contact groups, roles."
msgstr "**Bertakoa edizio guztietan** (Ink. Raw): LDAP \"connections\" sinkronizatu erabiltzaileak, kontaktu taldeak, rolak."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the ``sso`` service flag. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the ``administrator`` profile via the backend PREPL (``enable-prepl-server``) in ``tasks/main.yml`` — ``create-profile`` for a fresh profile, ``update-profile`` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Jatorrizkoa** lokaleko e-posta/pasahitzaren saioa *off* behin OIDC saio-hasierako bidea da (SSO), *-* bestela, hortik dator ``sso`` Zerbitzuaren bandera. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` errendatzea ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` horren arabera (ez da JS injekziorik behar. Penpot-ek pasahitzaren forma desgaitzen du.). Jatorrizko saioa hasten denean, rolak pasahitz lokal bat ezartzen du. ``administrator`` profila PREPL motorraren bidez (``enable-prepl-server``) barruan ``tasks/main.yml`` - ``create-profile`` profil berri baterako, ``update-profile`` Pasahitza ezartzeko saio federatu batek sortu zuenean; bota-trapa OIDC-ren azpian dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the `sso` service flag. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the `administrator` profile via the backend PREPL (`enable-prepl-server`) in `tasks/main.yml` — `create-profile` for a fresh profile, `update-profile` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Jatorrizkoa** lokaleko e-posta/pasahitzaren saioa *off* behin OIDC saio-hasierako bidea da (SSO), *-* bestela, hortik dator `sso` Zerbitzuaren bandera. `PENPOT_FLAGS` errendatzea `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` horren arabera (ez da JS injekziorik behar. Penpot-ek pasahitzaren forma desgaitzen du.). Jatorrizko saioa hasten denean, rolak pasahitz lokal bat ezartzen du. `administrator` profila PREPL motorraren bidez (`enable-prepl-server`) barruan `tasks/main.yml` - `create-profile` profil berri baterako, `update-profile` Pasahitza ezartzeko saio federatu batek sortu zuenean; bota-trapa OIDC-ren azpian dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Navigate to Pixelfed Directory:** Once inside the container, navigate to the Pixelfed directory. This is typically the root directory where Pixelfed is installed."
msgstr "**Pixelfed direktoriora nabigatu:** Behin edukiontziaren barruan, joan Pixelfed direktoriora. Pixelfed instalatuta dagoen erroko direktorioa da normalean."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Nested Docker state does not survive a teardown locally, but does in CI.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` is the named volume `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) and a host path (`/mnt/docker`) on GitHub. `compose down -v` removes a named volume and cannot remove a bind mount, so every workspace track starts on a clean inner daemon locally while CI carries the previous track's containers into the next one. Defects that need a container, network, or bind source to outlive a teardown cannot reproduce under act."
msgstr "**Habiaratutako Docker estatuak ez du bizirik irauten, baina bai CI-n.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` izeneko bolumena da `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) eta ostalariaren bide-izena (`/mnt/docker`) GitHub-en. `compose down -v` izendatutako bolumen bat kentzen du eta ezin du muntai lotu bat kendu, beraz laneko areako pista guztiak barneko daemon garbi batean hasten dira, eta CIk aurreko pistaren edukiontziak hurrengora eramaten ditu. Edukiontzi, sare edo iturburu bat behar duten desinfekzioak ezin dira erreproduzitu ekintzapean."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Nested keys.** Both flat and nested credential keys are accepted, so e.g. `recaptcha.key` and `recaptcha.secret` remain nested."
msgstr "**Giltza habiaratuak.** kredentzial-gako lauak eta habiaratuak onartzen dira, adibidez. `recaptcha.key` eta `recaptcha.secret` Habian geratu."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Network Configuration**: Includes setup of a dedicated Docker network for MariaDB."
msgstr "**Sareko konfigurazioa**: Docker sare bat MariaDBrako konfiguratzea."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Network bridges are addons.** Appservice / network bridges (e.g. the Matrix `mautrix` bridges to WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) are addons declared under `meta/addons/` with `mechanism: bridge`, one file per bridged network. Each bridge owns its credentials in [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) and is `required: false` and disabled by default. The role's former bridge declarations (e.g. `web-app-matrix`'s `vars/bridges.yml`) are absorbed into `meta/addons/`."
msgstr "**Sareko zubiak osagarriak dira.** Appservice / sareko zubiak (adibidez, Matrix `mautrix` WhatsApp, Telegram, Seinalea, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) gehigarriak adierazten dira `meta/addons/` honekin: `mechanism: bridge`, fitxategi bat sare zubidun bakoitzeko. Zubi bakoitzak bere kredentzialak ditu. [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) eta `required: false` eta lehenespenez desgaituta. Rolaren aurreko zubi-adierazpenak (Adibidez: `web-app-matrix`da `vars/bridges.yml`) sartzen dira `meta/addons/`."

# libretranslate
