# libretranslate
msgid "**Own STUN/TURN:** When ``web-svc-coturn`` is part of the deployment, WebRTC uses it with time-limited HMAC credentials instead of a third-party STUN server."
msgstr "**Bere izarra:** Noiz ``web-svc-coturn`` hedapenaren parte da, WebRTCk denbora mugatuko HMAC kredentzialekin erabiltzen du STUN zerbitzari baten ordez."

