# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent model store:** A named volume mounted at `/root/.lmstudio` keeps downloaded models and server settings across redeploys."
msgstr "**Modelo-denda iraunkorra:** Izendun bolumena muntatuta `/root/.lmstudio` deskargatutako ereduak eta zerbitzariaren ezarpenak gordetzen ditu redeploys-en bidez."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent model store:** A named volume mounted at ``/root/.lmstudio`` keeps downloaded models and server settings across redeploys."
