# libretranslate
msgid "**Raspberry Pi is a real deploy target.** Agent images MUST publish an `arm64` manifest so a Pi-class node can pull them, and the agents MUST schedule across at least two labelled worker nodes. This is arch coverage, not arch exclusivity: the same images keep running on the amd64 nodes that CI and the lab use, so the requirement is that every architecture a node may have is published, never that a deploy is pinned to one."
msgstr "**Raspberry Pi benetako helburu bat da.** Agenteen irudiek argitaratu egin behar dute `arm64` Pi klaseko nodo batek tira egin diezaien, eta agenteek gutxienez bi nodo markatu behar dituzte. Hau arkuaren estaldura da, ez esklusibitatea, irudi berak amdean jarraitzen dute.64 CIk eta labak erabiltzen duten nodoak, beraz, beharrezkoa da nodo bat argitara daitekeen arkitektura oro, inoiz ez deploy bat bat bati itsatsia egotea."

