# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` with ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in ``trusted_proxies``. In swarm the hub joins the proxy’s own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub’s, and trusting only the hub’s subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Alderantzizko proxy-aren fidagarritasuna:** A errendatzea ``configuration.yaml`` honekin: ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, eta proiektu osoko CIDR fidagarrien zerrenda ``trusted_proxies``. Multzoan, hub-a proxy-aren gainjarri egiten da, beraz, birbidalitako eskaera sare horretatik dator, eta ez hub-aren azpisareak bakarrik egiten duela konfiantza. Home Assistant HTTP bidez eskaera guztiei erantzun 400."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` with `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in `trusted_proxies`. In swarm the hub joins the proxy's own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub's, and trusting only the hub's subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Alderantzizko proxy-aren fidagarritasuna:** A errendatzea `configuration.yaml` honekin: `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, eta proiektu osoko CIDR fidagarrien zerrenda `trusted_proxies`. Multzoan, hub-a proxy-aren gainjarri egiten da, beraz, birbidalitako eskaera sare horretatik dator, eta ez hub-aren azpisareaz bakarrik fidatuz. Home Assistant HTTP bidez eskaera guztiei erantzun 400."

