# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO authentication:** Access is protected by Keycloak via oauth2-proxy."
msgstr "**SSO autentifikazioa:** Sarbidea Keycloak-ek babesten du oauth bidez2-proxy."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO flavor is `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NOT native OIDC — because Checkmk Raw has no OIDC. The oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and passes `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk's site Apache trusts it via `auth_by_http_header`. This mirrors [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)'s header-SSO bridge (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."
msgstr "**SSO zaporea da `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), Ez da jatorrizko OIDC, Checkmk Raw-ek ez duelako OIDCrik. oauth2-proxy-ak Keycloak-en aurka autentifikatzen du eta pasatzen da. `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk-en webgunea Apachek konfiantza ematen dio. `auth_by_http_header`. Ispilu hau [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)Goiburuko zubia (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAPeko goiburuaren fidagarritasuna)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` drives ``/sso/key/generate`` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**Biraketaren proba:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` unitate ``/sso/key/generate`` Keycloak-en saio-hasierako inprimakiaren bidez, eta UIa ez da bere pasahitz-atera itzultzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** `test-oidc-login.js` drives `/sso/key/generate` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**Biraketaren proba:** `test-oidc-login.js` unitate `/sso/key/generate` Keycloak-en saio-hasierako inprimakiaren bidez, eta UIa ez da bere pasahitz-atera itzultzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy."
msgstr "**SSO Keycloak-en bidez:** Automatikoki konfiguratua lehen aldiz erabiltzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted `Remote-Email` header (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); an `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script (`files/hooks.js`, adapted from [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n's own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO oauth bidez2-Probisio automatikoarekin proxy-a:** V1 sarbide osoa Keycloak OIDC bezero partekatuaren bidez (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty-k identitate autentifikatua n-ra bideratzen du8n fidagarri gisa `Remote-Email` goiburua (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script-a (`files/hooks.js`, egokitua [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) irakurri goiburu hori, n lokal bat automatikoki aurreikusi8n erabiltzailea lehen saioan eta gaiak n8n-ren saio-cookiea - beraz, Keycloak erabiltzaile bakoitza zuzenean sartzen da lan-fluxuen editorean, segundorik gabe, n8n-local saio-hasierako urratsa."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted ``Remote-Email`` header (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); an ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script (``files/hooks.js``, adapted from `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n’s own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO oauth bidez2-Probisio automatikoarekin proxy-a:** V1 sarbide osoa Keycloak OIDC bezero partekatuaren bidez (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty-k identitate autentifikatua n-ra bideratzen du8n fidagarri gisa ``Remote-Email`` goiburua (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script-a (``files/hooks.js``, egokitua `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) irakurri goiburu hori, n lokal bat automatikoki aurreikusi8n erabiltzailea lehen saioan eta gaiak n8n-ren saio-cookiea - beraz, Keycloak erabiltzaile bakoitza zuzenean sartzen da lan-fluxuen editorean, segundorik gabe, n8n-local saio-hasierako urratsa."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall's SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to `/saml/acs` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak's realm descriptor by [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a `.onion` issuer is unresolvable directly. `/auth` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** SuiteCRM-en SAML saioa da Keycloak-en aurka (`sso.flavor: saml` barruan [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))Ez da proxy bat aurrean. Jaso gabeko eskaerak Symfony suebakiaren SAML sarrera-puntua jo du, Keycloak-era birbideratzen duena; baieztapena itzultzen da `/saml/acs` eta benetako SuiteCRM saioa ezartzen du, beraz aplikazioak bere UI autentifikatua errendatzen du, baita bere kontrola ere. Kontuak lehen saio-hasieran sortzen dira baieztapenetik (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`)eta IdP sinatze-ziurtagiria Keycloak-en erresumako descriptor-etik irakurtzen da [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) hasieran, Tor SOCKS proxyaren gainean jaulkitzailea tipula denean, zeren eta `.onion` jaulkitzailea ez da zuzenean konpongarri. `/auth` Lokaleko atseden-sakelako saio-hasiera gisa gera daiteke."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM’s own SAML login against Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** SuiteCRM-en SAML saioa da Keycloak-en aurka (``sso.flavor: saml`` barruan ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` Lokaleko atseden-sakelako saio-hasiera gisa gera daiteke."

