msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**"
msgstr "**SSO zubia:**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**   When the oauth2-proxy SSO flavor is active, Snipe-IT's native `loginViaRemoteUser()` is enabled via the `Setting` model (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`). nginx gates `/login` through oauth2-proxy/Keycloak and injects the verified `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header, which Snipe-IT matches against `users.username` (the user must pre-exist and be activated — sync them via LDAP) to mint a native `snipeit_session`. Visitors without a matching activated user silently fall through to the normal login form (no error). The password/LDAP login form stays available as a fallback (`login_common_disabled = 0`), and the in-app logout is redirected to the central OIDC end-session URL."
msgstr "**SSO zubia:** oauth2-proxy SSO zaporea aktibo dago, Snipe-IT bertakoa da. `loginViaRemoteUser()` gaitua dago bidez `Setting` modeloa (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`)nginx ateak `/login` oauth bidez2-proxy/Keycloak eta injektatu egiaztatua `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` goiburua, Snipe-IT-ekin bat datorrena `users.username` (Erabiltzaileak aurre-existitu eta aktibatu egin behar ditu, LDAP bidez sinkronizatu.) natibo bat mintzeko `snipeit_session`. Erabiltzaile aktibaturik gabeko bisitariak isilean sartzen dira saio-hasierako forma normalera (errorerik ez). Pasahitza/LDAP-en saio-hasieraren inprimakia eskuragarri dago atzeraldi gisa (`login_common_disabled = 0`)eta sarrera-irteera OIDCren erdiko saio amaierako URLra birbideratua dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-header SSO bridge:** Establishes the owner session from the oauth2-proxy identity (see below)."
msgstr "**SSO zubia:** Jabearen saioa ezartzen du oauth-etik2-proxy identitatea (Ikusi behean)."

