msgstr "**Eremuko baliabideak:** Ezarri hemen `Include → All zones` (Edo zure ingurunerako behar diren eremu zehatzetara mugatu.)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Hermes agentea](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT)Autoostagarriarekin `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` Motorrak eta edukiontziaren gogortzea. Webeko arbel ofiziala bidaltzen du **OIDC auto-ostatua** auth (SSO plataformara egokitzen da)delegatuek lan egiten dute **subagente isolatuak**memoria iraunkorra du, antolaketa, ikusmen-sarearen nabigazioa eta MCP euskarria (**bezeroa V.0.2.0, zerbitzaritik v0.6.0**). `web-app-hermes`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Atebidearen webeko arbela (portu lehenetsia `18789`) gehi CLI/TUI, arakatzailearen kontrola, fitxategi-sistemaren harea-kutxa, memoria iraunkorra, trebetasunak/pluginak eta jatorrizko MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, bezeroa eta zerbitzaria). `web-app-openclaw`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** Ezarrita dagoenean (edo `full_cycle=true` - `make compose-deploy`), itzulkinak bi bider exekutatzen du: lehenik sinkronizazio erregularra pasatzen da, gero bigarren pasaldia berehala. `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` gainjartzen host_var, SAME aldaeren karpeta aurrean, hurrengo txandara joan aurretik. Beraz, bi pasabideak beti leku berean daude, asinkronoak ez du nahi gabe ostalari bati erasotzen, aurreko txandako aldaerek atzean utzitakoa."

# libretranslate
