# libretranslate
msgid "**dual-family providers** — the one real remaining design gap. On a CI onion node, tor-enabled providers (e.g. mastodon) are onion-exclusive: their domain list contains only the `.onion` canonical, no clearnet sibling. The family-alignment resolver (`utils/tls_common.py:align_domain_to_consumer`, wired into `plugins/lookup/tls.py`) correctly bails in that case, so a clearnet-pinned consumer still receives an onion URL it can neither resolve nor reach. First hard evidence: `web-app-fediwall` variant 2 (tor=false) renders `microblog.<onion>` into `wall-config.json.servers`; the clearnet browser (no SOCKS) times out waiting for mastodon wall items (`test-walls-surface-posts.js:24`, deterministic across retries). The same class is expected to keep `web-app-bigbluebutton`, `web-app-nextcloud`, `web-app-opentalk` and `web-app-jitsi` red (clearnet-pinned apps whose peer refs — OIDC/cdn/matomo/logout — resolve onion-primary). Fix direction: providers must publish BOTH families (clearnet sibling alongside the onion canonical) so the resolver has something to align to; includes re-applying the deferred `KC_HOSTNAME` onion-gate for Keycloak that was dropped from the earlier bundle because it is only needed once dual-family exists."
msgstr "**Familia bikoitzeko hornitzaileak** - geratzen den diseinu-hutsune bakarra. CI onion nodo batean, tor-enabled hornitzaileak (adibidez, mastodon) onion-exclusive dira: domeinu-zerrendak bakarrik dauka `.onion` kanonikoa da, ez dago koxkarik. Familia-lerrokatzeen ebazlea (`utils/tls_common.py:align_domain_to_consumer`, Hariztatutakoa `plugins/lookup/tls.py`) Kasu horretan, fidantza zuzena da, beraz, kontsumitzaile garbi batek onion URL bat jasotzen du, eta ezin du ez ebatzi ez lortu. Lehenengo froga gogorrak: `web-app-fediwall` aldaera 2 (tor=false) errendatzea `microblog.<onion>` sartu `wall-config.json.servers`; clearnet arakatzailea (ez SOCKS) garaiak horma-elementu mastodonoen zain (`test-walls-surface-posts.js:24`, determinista erretretetan zehar)Klase bera mantentzea espero da `web-app-bigbluebutton`, `web-app-nextcloud`, `web-app-opentalk` eta `web-app-jitsi` gorria (aplikazio gardenak, zeinen parekoak errefraktatzen dituen... OIDC/cdn/matomo/logout - Onion-primary ebazpena)Norabide finkoa: hornitzaileek bi familiak argitaratu behar dituzte (onion canonical-aren ondoan) Beraz, ebazpenak zerbait du lerrokatzeko; atzera botatakoan berriro aplikatzea barne. `KC_HOSTNAME` Keycloak-eko tipula-atea, aurreko sortatik bota zena, familia bikoitza existitzen denean bakarrik behar delako."

