msgid "A declared value that is a ``{start, end}`` mapping renders as ``start-end`` on both sides, so a relay range needs no special term."
msgstr "Balio deklaratua da ``{start, end}`` mapatzea errendatzea honela ``start-end`` bi aldeetan, beraz, errelebo-barrutiak ez du termino berezirik behar."

# libretranslate
msgid "A dedicated disk mounted straight onto `/var/lib/docker` needs no special layout: baudolo carves its snapshot **inside** the subject, as `<data root>/.baudolo-<tag>`, so source and destination are always on the same filesystem. Placing it beside the subject would fail with `EXDEV` exactly on that layout, since the parent directory then belongs to a different filesystem."
msgstr "Disko dedikatua zuzenean muntatuta `/var/lib/docker` diseinu berezirik ez du behar: baudolok bere argazkiak egiten ditu **barruan** gaia, honela `<data root>/.baudolo-<tag>`, Beraz, jatorria eta helburua fitxategi-sistema berean daude beti. Gaiaren ondoan jartzeak huts egingo luke. `EXDEV` diseinu horretan, direktorio gurasoa beste fitxategi-sistema batekoa baita."

