# libretranslate
msgid "A deploy job is titled ``<mode glyph><tor glyph><distro glyph><filesystem glyph><architecture glyph><display name> <variant>`` with an optional trailing ⭐ for a priority row. The middle is resolved through the display-name codec rather than matched as a raw role id: job names carry display names, so a regex over ``web-app-…`` silently matched nothing and every failure went unreported."
msgstr "Lan bat du izenburu. ``<mode glyph><tor glyph><distro glyph><filesystem glyph><architecture glyph><display name> <variant>`` . aukerakoa lehentasun-errenkada baterako. Erdia pantaila-izeneko kodeken bidez ebazten da, paper gordinaren ID gisa bat etorri ordez: lan-izenek bistaratze-izenak dituzte, beraz, berrgex bat baino gehiago. ``web-app-…`` Isil-isilik ez zegoen ezer, eta porrot guztiak ez ziren kontuan hartu."

# libretranslate
msgid "A deploy job title carries the whole row it deployed -- role, variant, mode, onion state, distro, filesystem, architecture -- and :mod:`utils.github.variant.selection` is the grammar that writes it back down."
msgstr "Lan-titulu zabal batek hedatutako errenkada osoa darama: papera, aldaera, modua, tipula-egoera, distroa, fitxategi-sistema, arkitektura... :mod:`utils.github.variant.selection` Gramatika horrek atzera idazten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "A deploy with zero or more than one manager fails at inventory-validation time, never at runtime."
msgstr "Kudeatzaile batek baino gehiagok huts egiten dute inbentarioaren balio-denboran, inoiz ez exekuzio-denboran."

# libretranslate
msgid "A deployment that keeps the shipped `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` serves names under `infinito.localhost`. Those exist in no zone, so a task that reaches the deployment's own domain from the host depends on the `myhostname` NSS module, which maps any `*.localhost` name to loopback per RFC 6761."
msgstr "Hedatua mantentzen duen hedapena `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` izenen azpian `infinito.localhost`. Lekurik ez dago, beraz, ostalariaren domeinura iristen den zeregina ostalariaren araberakoa da. `myhostname` NSS modulua, edozein mapa egiten duena `*.localhost` RFC-eko atzeradeia 6761."

# libretranslate
msgid "A deployment that keeps the shipped ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` serves names under ``infinito.localhost``. Those exist in no zone, so a task that reaches the deployment’s own domain from the host depends on the ``myhostname`` NSS module, which maps any ``*.localhost`` name to loopback per RFC 6761."
msgstr "Hedatua mantentzen duen hedapena ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` izenen azpian ``infinito.localhost``. Horiek ez dira zona batean, beraz, ostalariaren hedapen-domeinura iristen den zeregina araberakoa da. ``myhostname`` NSS modulua, edozein mapa egiten duena ``*.localhost`` RFC-eko atzeradeia 6761."

# libretranslate
msgid "A detailed documentation for the use and administration of Nextcloud on Infinito.Nexus you will find [here](docs/README.md)."
msgstr "Nextcloud erabiltzeko eta administratzeko dokumentazio zehatza Infinito.Nexus aurkituko duzu [hemen](docs/README.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "A detailed documentation for the use and administration of Nextcloud on Infinito.Nexus you will find `here <docs/README.md>`__."
msgstr "Nextcloud erabiltzeko eta administratzeko dokumentazio zehatza Infinito.Nexus aurkituko duzu `here <docs/README.md>`__."

# libretranslate
msgid "A digital administration and documentation platform for structured organizations."
msgstr "Administrazio digitala eta erakunde egituratuentzako dokumentazio-plataforma."

# libretranslate
msgid "A distro ships the interpreter and its extensions as separate packages, so a present ``php`` binary says nothing about them and ``ensure_command_present`` returns early on one. The extension is therefore probed against ``php -m``."
msgstr "Distro batek interpretea eta bere hedapenak pakete bereizi gisa bidaltzen ditu. ``php`` bitarrak ez du ezer esaten haietaz eta ``ensure_command_present`` Goiz itzultzen da. Hedapena, beraz, aurkakoa da. ``php -m``."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST NOT act as a manual index, table of contents, or page inventory."
msgstr "Doktore bat `README.md` Ez da eskuzko indizea, eduki-taula edo orrialdeen inbentario gisa jokatu behar."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST NOT duplicate navigation that Sphinx already provides."
msgstr "Doktore bat `README.md` Ez da bikoizketarik egin behar Sphinxek dagoeneko eskaintzen duena."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST NOT list the `.md` or `.rst` files in the directory."
msgstr "Doktore bat `README.md` Ez da zerrendatu behar `.md` edo `.rst` direktorioko fitxategiak."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST describe the audience, subject area, or boundary of the documentation in that directory when that context helps readers."
msgstr "Doktore bat `README.md` Direktorio horretako dokumentazioaren audientzia, gaia edo muga deskribatu behar da testuinguru horrek irakurleei laguntzen dienean."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST explain what kind of documentation lives in that directory and what scope that documentation covers. It MUST help readers understand the subject area and boundary of the folder without replacing the documentation pages themselves."
msgstr "Doktore bat `README.md` Direktorio horretan zein dokumentazio mota bizi den azaldu behar da, eta dokumentazioaren zein esparrutan. Irakurleei karpetako gaia eta muga ulertzen lagundu behar die, dokumentazio-orriak berak aldatu gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST stay short and scope-focused."
msgstr "Doktore bat `README.md` Laburra izan behar du eta esparrua zaindu."

# libretranslate
msgid "A documented blocker when none of the above can preserve the application's authorization boundary."
msgstr "Blokeatzaile dokumentatua, goian aipatutako inork ezin duenean aplikazioaren baimen-muga gorde."

# libretranslate
msgid "A failing pre-state snapshot aborts the deploy (no `suppress_flush`): no update proceeds without a successful backup of the state it is about to change. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` is never started at deploy time (no device present); it stays plug-triggered via its `.mount` unit."
msgstr "Egoeraren aurreko argazki huts batek hedapena abortatzen du (ez `suppress_flush`): Ez da eguneraketarik aurrera egiten, egoera aldatu egingo da. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` ez da inoiz irekitzen denbora (ez dago gailurik); entxufatzen jarraitzen du bere bidez `.mount` Unitatea."

# libretranslate
msgid "A failure whose root cause is container runtime state (config, plugin, user binding, env) is by definition reproducible-there and does NOT qualify for the post-deploy-state exception."
msgstr "Hutsegite bat, zeinaren erroa edukiontziaren exekuzio-denboraren egoera den. (konfigurazioa, plugina, erabiltzailearen lotura, env) definizioz aldagarria da, eta ez du baldintzapeko salbuespenik."

# libretranslate
msgid "A fallback MUST stay inside the permitted set, and a run whose whole permitted set is unservable MUST fail rather than leave it. The job title and the artifact name carry the kind the matrix assigned; the step summary carries the effective one."
msgstr "Atzerapen batek baimendutako multzoaren barruan egon behar du, eta korrika batek, zeinaren multzo osoa behaezina den, huts egin behar duen utzi baino. Lan-tituluak eta gauzatze-izenak matrizearen mota daramate; urratsen laburpenak eraginkorra da."

# libretranslate
msgid "A fallback is reported, never silent. The job title and artifact name carry the kind the matrix *assigned*, while [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) writes the *effective* filesystem and the reason into the step summary. When a run has to prove a filesystem-dependent path, read the summary rather than the title, or name the kind on the run to make it a demand. The snapshot mode of `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is the case that matters: it only engages on btrfs and zfs."
msgstr "Atzerapen baten berri ematen da, inoiz ez isilik. Lan-tituluak eta objektu-izenak matrizea eramaten dute *esleituta*bitartean [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) idazten du *eraginkorra* fitxategi-sistema eta urratsen laburpenaren arrazoia. Exekutatu batek fitxategi-sistemaren mendeko bide bat frogatu behar duenean, irakurri laburpena, tituluaren ordez, edo exekutatutakoaren izena eskaera egiteko. Kameraren modua `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` Kontua da btrfak eta zfak bakarrik lotzen dituela."

# libretranslate
msgid "A federated and community-driven platform for discussion, media sharing, and social networking."
msgstr "Plataforma federatu eta komunitarioa eztabaidarako, komunikabideak partekatzeko eta sare sozialerako."

msgid "A filesystem row states the kind the matrix *assigned*. A deploy may fall back from it when the host kernel cannot serve it (``scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh``) and the title does not record that, so read that axis as a preference ranking and prove the kind separately before pinning it."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "A final `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` run has completed with the spec passing against the freshly provisioned stack. Inner-loop passes alone do NOT satisfy this gate."
msgstr "Amaiera `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` lasterka amaitu da hornitu berri den pilaren kontra doan espeziarekin. Inner-loop bakarrik pasatzen da eta ez du ate hau betetzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "A flag is ``true`` only when the addon is both ``enabled`` AND ``required``. Optional addons (``required: false``) are intentionally skipped by the spec suite — they are a variant axis, not a guaranteed surface — so their gate flag is ``false`` even when enabled."
msgstr "Bandera bat da ``true`` Gehigarria biak direnean bakarrik. ``enabled`` ETA ``required``. Aukerako gehigarriak (``required: false``) Espektroak nahita saltatzen ditu, ardatz aldagarri bat dira, ez azalera bermatua, beraz, ate-ertza da ``false`` gaituta dagoenean ere."

# libretranslate
msgid "A fork PR triggers a `pull_request_target` run that builds and mirrors any new images needed by the fork, authenticating to GHCR with the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN`."
msgstr "Sardexka batek PR bat abiarazten du `pull_request_target` exekutatu, sardexkak behar dituen irudi berriak eraiki eta ispilatzen dituena, GHCR-ra autentifikatzen duena lan bakoitzeko. `GITHUB_TOKEN`."

msgid "A fourth variant was built first and then withdrawn: `tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_limit.py` caps a role at three, on the stated ground that variants exercise dynamic-flag polarities rather than enumerate features, and the `# nocheck: variant-limit` escape would have been a suppression bought to keep a design that fits in three anyway."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "A fragment can only ever be stricter than the host already is. In nftables an ``accept`` terminates its own base chain and nothing more: the packet still traverses every other chain at that hook, and a ``drop`` in any of them wins. A rule that has to overrule a policy someone else set, such as the ``DROP`` docker installs on forwarded packets, does not belong in a fragment at all; it belongs in the chain that carries that policy."
msgstr "Zati bat beti izan daiteke ostalariak baino zorrotzago. nftables batean ``accept`` bere oinarrizko katea amaitzen du, eta ez beste ezer: paketeak beste kate guztiak zeharkatzen ditu kako horretan, eta ``drop`` Haietako edozeinek irabazten du. Beste norbaitek ezarritako politika gainditu behar duen araua, adibidez ``DROP`` Docker-a aurrerantz dauden paketeetan instalatzen da, ez da zati batean sartzen; politika hori daraman katean dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "A fragment can only ever be stricter than the host already is. In nftables an `accept` terminates its own base chain and nothing more: the packet still traverses every other chain at that hook, and a `drop` in any of them wins. A rule that has to overrule a policy someone else set, such as the `DROP` docker installs on forwarded packets, does not belong in a fragment at all; it belongs in the chain that carries that policy."
msgstr "Zati bat beti izan daiteke ostalariak baino zorrotzago. nftables batean `accept` bere oinarrizko katea amaitzen du, eta ez beste ezer: paketeak beste kate guztiak zeharkatzen ditu kako horretan, eta `drop` Haietako edozeinek irabazten du. Beste norbaitek ezarritako politika gainditu behar duen araua, adibidez `DROP` Docker-a aurrerantz dauden paketeetan instalatzen da, ez da zati batean sartzen; politika hori daraman katean dago."

