msgid "A handful of variables are documented next to their consumer because they cannot have a static default:"
msgstr "Aldagai sorta bat kontsumitzailearen ondoan dokumentatuta dago, ezin baitute lehenetsi estatikorik izan:"

# libretranslate
msgid "A handler MAY import stdlib, [parser.py](../parser.py), [runtime.py](../runtime.py), and any repo module whose own import closure is stdlib-only. The whole closure MUST import and run on the bare bootstrap python, before any dependency is installed. `utils.cache.files` and [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) qualify; `utils.cache.yaml` does not, because it imports PyYAML. Read SPOT files with `utils.cache.files.read_text` plus `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` or a stdlib line parse. `load_block` accepts block mappings, block lists and string scalars only, and raises `BootstrapYamlError` on everything else, so a SPOT file read this way MUST stay inside that subset. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) enforces this by running the generator with every non-stdlib import blocked."
msgstr "Kudeatzaile batek stdlib inportatu dezake, [parser.py](../parser.py), [runtime.py](../runtime.py), eta inportazioa ixten duen edozein modulu estdlib-only da. Itxiera osoak inportatu eta exekutatu behar du bottrap python hutsa, edozein mendekotasun instalatu aurretik. `utils.cache.files` eta [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) kalifikatu; `utils.cache.yaml` Ez, PyYAML inportatzen duelako. Irakurri SPOT fitxategiak `utils.cache.files.read_text` plus `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` edo lerro-analisi bat. `load_block` bloke-mapak, bloke-zerrendak eta kate-eskalak bakarrik onartzen ditu, eta goratzen du `BootstrapYamlError` Beste gauza guztietan, beraz, SPOT fitxategi batek honela irakurtzen badu, azpimultzo horretan egon behar du. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) hau behartzen du sorgailua exekutatuz, ez-subjektu guztiak blokeatuta."

# libretranslate
msgid "A handler MUST NOT import another handler. Cross-handler data flows through `eb.get(...)` / `eb.set(...)` only."
msgstr "Kudeatzaileak ez du beste kudeatzailerik inportatu behar. Crosshandler datu-fluxuak `eb.get(...)` / `eb.set(...)` Bakarrik."

# libretranslate
msgid "A handler MUST NOT import from [writer.py](../writer.py) or [builder.py](../builder.py) at runtime. The `EnvBuilder` and `BuildContext` types MAY be referenced under `TYPE_CHECKING` for annotations only."
msgstr "Kudeatzaileak ez du inportatu behar [writer.py](../writer.py) edo [builder.py](../builder.py) exekuzio-denboran. The `EnvBuilder` eta `BuildContext` Azpian aipatuko diren motak `TYPE_CHECKING` Oharpenetarako bakarrik."

# libretranslate
