# libretranslate
msgid "Admission is not declared here. A client marks itself once, in its own ``meta/services.yml`` self-entry, as ``mcp_consumer: true``; a provider deviates by carrying ``mcp_consumer: false`` on that client's entry in its own ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` resolves the pair."
msgstr "Hemen ez da onartzen. Bezero batek bere burua behin markatzen du, bere baitan ``meta/services.yml`` auto-sarrera gisa ``mcp_consumer: true``; hornitzaile batek garraiatuz desbideratzen du ``mcp_consumer: false`` bezero horrek bere sarrera propioan ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` Bikotea konpontzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "Admission lives in `meta/services.yml`, not here. A client sets `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` in its own role; a provider refuses one by setting `mcp_consumer: false` on that client's entry. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) requires every provider to carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated entry for every declared client, so a round plans provider and client together."
msgstr "Onarpena bizitzan `meta/services.yml`, Hemen ez. Bezero multzo bat `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` bere eginkizunean; hornitzaile batek uko egiten dio bat ezartzeari `mcp_consumer: false` bezero horren sarreran. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) hornitzaile bakoitzak bat eramatea eskatzen du `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-Bezero deklaratu bakoitzeko sarrera murriztua, beraz, plan-hornitzailea eta bezeroa elkarrekin."

