msgid "Allows an image reference whose tag names a Debian release by codename. Reserved for an upstream that publishes no numeric tag; the marker MUST name which upstream, because a codename pin can never be raised by the updater."
msgstr "Irudi-erreferentzia bat onartzen du, zeinaren etiketek Debian-en argitalpena kode-izenez izendatzen duten. Zenbakizko etiketarik argitaratzen ez duen korronte baterako erreserbatua; markatzaileak izena eman behar du gora, eguneraketak ezin baitu kode-izenik jaso."

# libretranslate
msgid "Allows an untyped `container inspect` under `roles/`. Default path: pin `--type container`, because a role's overlay network carries the same entity name as its main container, so an untyped inspect can resolve the network and report `map has no entry for key \"State\"`. Use the typed subcommand (`container volume inspect` etc.) when the target genuinely is not a container."
msgstr "Baimendu ez-mota bat `container inspect` azpian `roles/`. Bide lehenetsia: pin `--type container`, Funtzio baten gainjarritako sareak edukiontzi nagusiaren izen bera duelako, beraz, ez-motatutako ikuskapen batek sarea konpondu eta salatu dezake. `map has no entry for key \"State\"`. Erabili typed subcommand (`container volume inspect` e.a.) helburua ez denean edukiontzi bat."

