# libretranslate
msgid "An addon that needs install/enable/configure logic beyond the generic `config:` payload MUST place it in `roles/<role>/tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`, mirroring the `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` file-root convention."
msgstr "Behar duen gehigarri bat install/enable/configure logika orokorraz harago `config:` kargak jarri behar du `roles/<role>/tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`, ispiluak `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` File-root konbentzioa."

# libretranslate
msgid "An addon under `meta/addons/` MAY declare an `incompatible_plugins` list in its `config:`. [01_install.yml](./01_install.yml) runs `occ app:disable` for every listed plugin before the install attempt. This guarantees that mutually exclusive integrations such as the OIDC entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) and the document-editing surfaces (`onlyoffice`, `richdocuments`, `fileslibreofficeedit`) cannot accidentally coexist on the same instance."
msgstr "Azpian addon bat `meta/addons/` Deklarazioa `incompatible_plugins` zerrenda bere baitan `config:`. [01install.yml](./01_install.yml) lasterketak `occ app:disable` zerrendatutako plugin bakoitzeko, instalatzeko saiakera baino lehen. Horrek bermatzen du elkarrekiko integrazio esklusiboak, hala nola OIDC sarrera-puntuak. (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) eta dokumentuak editatzeko gainazalak (`onlyoffice`, `richdocuments`, `fileslibreofficeedit`) Ezin da kasu berean koexistitu."

