# libretranslate
msgid "An app that needs an extra mapper MUST add it through a per-client scope. See [nextcloud.json.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/import/scopes/nextcloud.json.j2) for the precedent: a dedicated scope holds the Nextcloud-specific UID and quota mappers and is attached only to the Nextcloud client."
msgstr "Mapper gehigarri bat behar duen aplikazio batek bezero-esparru baten bidez gehitu behar du. Ikusi [nextcloud.json.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/import/scopes/nextcloud.json.j2) aurrekaria: eremu dedikatu batek Nextclouden berariazko UIDa eta quota mapatzaileak ditu eta Nextcloud bezeroari bakarrik atxikia dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application SHOULD opt in to `axis: domain` only when its authorisation model is genuinely per-tenant and the tenant axis is the canonical domain. Typical consumer: WordPress Multisite. Applications whose authorisation is one global user set (Nextcloud, Gitea, Keycloak itself) MUST keep `axis: none`."
msgstr "Aplikazio bat aukeratu behar da `axis: domain` Soilik bere baimen-eredua benetan iraunkorra denean eta ardatza domeinu kanonikoa denean. Ohiko kontsumitzailea: WordPress Multisite. Baimena duten aplikazioak erabiltzaile-multzo orokor bat dira (Nextcloud, Gitea, Keycloak bera) Mantendu egin behar da `axis: none`."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application id is expanded to the service key(s) that role provides; every other token is kept verbatim. Order-preserving, de-duplicated. Used wherever the operator supplies service references (``disable``, include/prune closures) so both spellings resolve identically."
msgstr "Aplikazio-identifikazio bat zerbitzu-gakora zabaltzen da(s) Rol horrek ematen du, beste edozein token literal mantentzen da. Ordena gordea, deduzitua. Eragileak zerbitzu-erreferentziak eskaintzen dituen lekuan erabiltzen da (``disable``, Sartu/leheneratu itxierak) Beraz, bi letrek berdin ebatziko dute."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application that authenticates its own API with a bearer MUST expose that path through the SSO ACL whitelist. The proxy cannot validate an application bearer, so a fully gated vhost answers an API call with an identity-provider redirect, which a client following redirects reads as a successful 200."
msgstr "API propioa autentifikatzen duen aplikazio batek bide hori erakutsi behar du SSO ACL zerrenda zuriaren bidez. Proxy-ak ezin du aplikazio-eramaile bat baliozkotu, beraz, vhost-ak API dei bati erantzuten dio identitate-hornitzailearen birbideratze batekin, eta bezeroak birbideraketa arrakastatsu gisa irakurtzen du. 200."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application whose registration rejects the shell-safe alphabet states that in its own meta/users.yml rather than carrying a second credential beside the account it already owns."
msgstr "Shell-safe alfabetoa ukatzen duen aplikazio batek adierazten du bere baitan meta/users.yml Bigarren kredentzial bat bere kontutik hartu ordez."

