# libretranslate
msgid "Ansible forks a fresh worker process for every task. The in-process cache inside `get_merged_applications` therefore never survives from one task to the next, and every task that touches the lookup would render the full tree again (about 16 to 23 seconds per task on a CI runner, measured on the workspace jobs)."
msgstr "Langile-prozesu berri bat sar daiteke zeregin bakoitzerako. Prozesu barruko cachea `get_merged_applications` beraz, ez da inoiz lan batetik bestera bizirik aterako, eta bilaketa ukitzen duen zeregin orok berriro zuhaitz osoa bihurtuko luke. (buruz 16 - 23 segundoak CIko korrikalari baten atazako, laneko arean neurtuta)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Ansible forks a fresh worker process per task, so the in-process `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. The constructor stage renders once and parks the payload plus its cache key in the host fact named by `APPLICATIONS_RENDERED_FACT`; every later worker inherits that fact at fork time and `get_merged_applications` serves it instead of rendering. Ansible-free at import time like the rest of the package."
msgstr "Langile-prozesu berri bat sar daiteke zeregin bakoitzean, beraz, prozesua `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` hutsik hasten da langile guztietan. Konstruktorearen agertokia behin errendatzen da eta karga gehi bere cache-gakoa aurkitzen du ostalariak izendatutako egitatean `APPLICATIONS_RENDERED_FACT`; geroko langile guztiek jasotzen dute egitate hori sardexka garaian eta `get_merged_applications` errendatzearen ordez balio du. Ezin da inportatu denbora gainerako paketea bezala."

