# libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Ez da hemen deskargatzen txotxongilo-arakatzailea. (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) beraz, ``install-lint`` Mantendu sandbox-safe. mmdc-ek arakatzaile bat besterik ez du behar RENDER-erako. ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` eskariaren xedapenak (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) Errendatu aurretik. Arakatzaileak zip gisa erabiltzen du, beraz, ``unzip`` Hemen ziurtatua dago (Txotxongilo-erauzleak behar du, bestela bertsio huts bat uzten du eta mmdc-ek arakatzailea falta dela jakinarazten du.). Instalazio huts batek abisatzen du abortatu ordez ``install-lint``Beraz, npm/browser sarbiderik gabeko harea-kaxek gainerako tresna-katea lortzen dute."

