# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. The dashboard’s entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side ``oidc.js`` bundle, and ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` in ``vars/main.yml`` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Bi Playwright pertsona autentifikatuak blokeatuta daude aldi berean ``services.sso.enabled`` Gezurra da. Arbelaren Keycloak integrazio osoa arakatzailearen alboa da ``oidc.js`` sorta, eta ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` barruan ``vars/main.yml`` SSO gaituta dagoenean bakarrik bidaltzen du fitxategia, eta SSOk orrialdetik kanpo ez du saio-hasierako estekarik edo kontrolik ematen."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. Without SSO, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` skips the ``auth_by_http_header`` snippet, so the OMD site falls back to its own login form."
msgstr "Bi Playwright pertsona autentifikatuak blokeatuta daude aldi berean ``services.sso.enabled`` Gezurra da. SSO gabe, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` jauziak ``auth_by_http_header`` mozkina, beraz, OMD gunea bere saio-hasierako formara itzultzen da."

