# libretranslate
msgid "Cached keyed on (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). A read issued while the applications render is in progress sees the unrendered tree, whose service flags are still Jinja strings; its map is cached under its own key so the render's own call sites reuse it without it ever being served as the finished map. The tor flags are rendered before they are read (``_resolved_flag``), so that mid-render map carries the same onion domains the finished one does."
msgstr "Cachean gakotuta (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). Errendatzen ari den bitartean, irakurritako zuhaitz ez-berritua ikusten da, zeinaren zerbitzu-banderak oraindik Jinja kateak diren; bere mapa bere gako propioaren azpian gordetzen da, errendatzailearen dei-guneek hura berrerabili ahal izateko, mapa amaitu gisa zerbitzatu gabe. Tor banderak errendatzen dira irakurri aurretik (``_resolved_flag``)Beraz, erdi-errendimenduko mapak onio-domeinu berberak ditu amaitutakoak."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached value: the **list of documents** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` returns for that file. Single-document YAML files cache as a 1-element list, so a callsite that asks for the single doc (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) and a callsite that asks for the multi-doc list (``load_yaml_all``) share **the same parse**. The same list / dict instances are returned to every caller, so callers that mutate the result MUST `copy.deepcopy()` it first. Treat the value as read-only."
msgstr "Gordetako balioa: **Dokumentuen zerrenda** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` fitxategi horretara itzultzen da. Dokumentu bakarreko YAML fitxategiak cache gisa 1-elementuen zerrenda, beraz, dei bat doc bakarra eskatzen duena (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) eta dei bat, dokteen zerrenda eskatzen duena (``load_yaml_all``) Partekatu **analisi bera**. Zerrenda/dict instantzia berberak dei-egile guztiei itzultzen zaizkie, beraz, emaitza aldatzen duten deiek emaitza aldatu behar dute. `copy.deepcopy()` Lehenik. Tratatu balioa irakurtzeko soilik balitz bezala."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached: repeated calls for the same *role_dir* reuse the first parse. Pass an absolute path so the cache key is stable across callers that resolve relative paths differently."
msgstr "Cachean: dei errepikatuak *role_dir* Berrerabili lehen analisia. Bide-izen absolutua igaro, cache-gakoa egonkorra izan dadin bide-izen erlatiboak beste modu batera ebazten dituzten dei-egileen artean."

