# libretranslate
msgid "Clients do not read the server list directly. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) computes the intersection of the provider's admitted clients, resolved by `derive_allowed_consumers` in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), with the calling client's `supported_transports` and `supported_auths`, resolves each provider's declared credential, and returns:"
msgstr "Bezeroek ez dute zerbitzariaren zerrenda zuzenean irakurtzen. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) Hornitzailearen onartutako bezeroen ebakidura kalkulatzen du, honek ebatzita `derive_allowed_consumers` barruan [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), bezeroaren deiarekin `supported_transports` eta `supported_auths`, Hornitzaile bakoitzaren kredentziala ebazten du, eta itzultzen du:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in `sys-token-store`. Its `auth_subject` is `administrator`, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Bezeroek Giteako sarbide pertsonalaren token bat aurkezten dute honela: `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. tokena administratzailearen kontura bidaltzen da eta bertan gordetzen da. `sys-token-store`. `auth_subject` da `administrator`, Beraz, MCPk administratzaile-eskubideekin egiten du lasterka, erabiltzaileak eskatu ordez."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in ``sys-token-store``. Its ``auth_subject`` is ``administrator``, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Bezeroek Giteako sarbide pertsonalaren token bat aurkezten dute honela: ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. tokena administratzailearen kontura bidaltzen da eta bertan gordetzen da. ``sys-token-store``. ``auth_subject`` da ``administrator``, Beraz, MCPk administratzaile-eskubideekin egiten du lasterka, erabiltzaileak eskatu ordez."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in `sys-token-store` under the `administrator` user, not in the role's `credentials:` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Bezeroek iraupen luzeko sarbide-tokena aurkezten dute honela: `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. tokena banan-banan zulatzen da eta barruan mantentzen da. `sys-token-store` azpian `administrator` erabiltzailea, ez rolean `credentials:` blokea. Autentifikatu gabeko eskaera bati erantzuten dio 404: Etxeko laguntzaileak ez du amaierako puntua erakusten."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in ``sys-token-store`` under the ``administrator`` user, not in the role’s ``credentials:`` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Bezeroek iraupen luzeko sarbide-tokena aurkezten dute honela: ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. tokena banan-banan zulatzen da eta barruan mantentzen da. ``sys-token-store`` azpian ``administrator`` erabiltzailea, ez rolean ``credentials:`` blokea. Autentifikatu gabeko eskaera bati erantzuten dio 404: Etxeko laguntzaileak ez du amaierako puntua erakusten."

