# libretranslate
msgid "Consumers that must name a model (`web-app-moodle`, `web-app-matrix`) read `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, which picks the first non-embedding preload model of `svc-ai-ollama` and mirrors the branch order of the gateway's own `config.yaml.j2`. The consumer resolves that branch from `lookup('deployment').inventory`, every group the round's inventory populates, read from the play-wide `groups` magic var. `.running` is wrong here: a targeted `apps=` round sets it to the whitelist, and `svc-ai-ollama` is pulled in as a dependency rather than named on the command line, so both backend branches fall through to the `openrouter/auto` vendor default. The gateway then answers `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` with HTTP 400 and no consumer can complete a prompt. `.groups` is wrong for the mirror-image reason: it carries `group_names`, which is host-scoped, so on a multi-host round a worker that hosts neither the gateway nor a backend resolves an empty model while the manager resolves the right one."
msgstr "Eredu bat izendatu behar duten kontsumitzaileak (`web-app-moodle`, `web-app-matrix`) irakurri `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, lehen karga ez-betegarriaren modeloa hautatzen duena `svc-ai-ollama` eta atebidearen adar-ordena islatzen du `config.yaml.j2`. kontsumitzaileak erabakitzen du adar hori `lookup('deployment').inventory`, Talde bakoitzak bere inbentarioa betetzen du, joko osoan irakurria. `groups` var magikoa. `.running` gaizki dago hemen: helburu bat `apps=` biribilak zerrenda zurira eramaten du, eta `svc-ai-ollama` aginte-lerroan izendatu ordez, dependentzia gisa hartzen da, beraz, bi euskarri-adarrak igaro egiten dira. `openrouter/auto` Saltzaile lehenetsia. Atezainak erantzuten du `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` HTTP 400 eta kontsumitzaileak ezin du ezer eskatu. `.groups` ispilu-irudiaren arrazoia okerra da: eramaten du `group_names`, Ostalari-skopioa da, beraz, ostatu anitzeko langile baten inguruan, ez ate-aterik ez motorrik ez duena eredu huts bat ebazten, kudeatzaileak eskuinekoa erabakitzen duen bitartean."

# libretranslate
