# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Cross-service zundak (Biberrek prometeoan ukatu zuen, biberrek matomoari uko egin zion.) Ez dira biber per-rolearen parte. Hornitzailearen espeziean bizi dira. (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), hornitzailearen gainetik behin parametrizatuta `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Agerian. Arbelerako, agertoki parametrodun ordezkariak `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, Fitxaren ikusgaitasuna / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" OSPOT bateko baieztapenak."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Cross-service zundak ez dira administratzaile per-rolearen parte. Marratxoen eskuragarritasunaren jabea da `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, gorputz pertargeta delegatzen duena `runDashboardCardScenario` Laguntzailea `dashboard-card-flow.js` (fitxa ikusgai → klik kargak `#main iframe` → goiburua \"Tab\" botoia arakatzailearen fitxa berrian kapsulatzen da). Babesle hori arma-mekanikarako SPOT da; kontsumitzaile-espezieek ez dute baieztapen horietako bat ere bete behar. Prometheus admin-reach eta scrape parity-aren jabetza dira `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach eta aztarnariaren presentziaren jabea da `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Hornitzaile bakoitzak baieztapena parametronatzen du bere gainean `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Agerian."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Cross-service azaleko baieztapenak (taulako fitxa irisgarritasuna, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) hornitzailearen zehaztapenaren jabe dira. Hornitzaile bakoitzak bere baieztapena parametronatzen du `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifestua, bidez errea `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Kontsumitzaileen rolek ez dute proba hauek bikoiztu behar."

