# libretranslate
msgid "Deploys one chunk of the sweep. Every matrix row is a single `role#variant` carrying the deploy mode, onion state, distro and filesystem the rotation assigned it: `swarm` rows get a simulated 3-node DinD cluster with an NFS server plus a drain/reschedule state-survival assertion, `compose` and `host` rows run the single-node drill. When `whitelist` is empty, the discover job derives one from the branch's diff vs `origin/main`; see the \"Diff-driven app selection\" subsection in [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). A row marked 📖 -- the role's smallest variant, see [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- replays the role README's `### Production` block on the same runner once the deploy has released it."
msgstr "Kendu zati bat. Matrize errenkada bakoitza bakarra da `role#variant` deploy modua, tipula-egoera, distroa eta fitxategi-sistema eramateak esleitzen zion biraketa: `swarm` errenkadak simulatu egiten dira 3-node DinD klusterra, NFS zerbitzari batekin eta egoera-subjekturako baieztapena, `compose` eta `host` errenkadak agindu bakarreko zulagailua exekutatzen du. Noiz `whitelist` hutsik dago, aurkibidea adarreko difasetik dator `origin/main`; ikusi \"Diff-driven aplikazioen hautapena\" azpiatala [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). Lerro bat markatua 📖 - Rolaren aldaerarik txikiena, ikusi [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- READMEren papera errepikatzen du `### Production` lasterkari berean blokea, behin zabaldu ondoren."

