# libretranslate
msgid "Disable/prune path: `provides: litellm_ui` makes `expand_service_tokens('web-app-litellm')` expand to `services.litellm_ui.*`, so disabling the UI role does not clear its `services.litellm` consumer contract; the gateway stays force-loaded until that flag is flipped manually or the expander learns about redirected consumer contracts."
msgstr "Desgaitu/lehendu bidea: `provides: litellm_ui` egiten du `expand_service_tokens('web-app-litellm')` zabaldu `services.litellm_ui.*`, Beraz, UIren papera desgaitzeak ez du argi uzten. `services.litellm` Kontsumo-kontratua; atebidea kargatu egiten da bandera eskuz irauli arte edo zabaltzaileak birbideraturiko kontsumo-kontratuei buruz ikasten duen arte."

# libretranslate
msgid "Disabled the *email* service in the *web-app-pihole* role by pinning *services.email* to a static *enabled: false* / *shared: false* with the matching *dynamic-flag* and *email* nocheck suppressions, removing the now-static email overrides from *meta/variants.yml*, and adding *javascript* true/false variant pins to keep the dynamic-flag matrix-coverage guard green."
msgstr "Desgaituta *e-posta* zerbitzuan *web-app-pihole* papera pinning-aren arabera *services.email* estatiko batera *gaituta: faltsua* / *partekatua: faltsua* bat datorrenarekin *bandera dinamikoa* eta *e-posta* ez dago egiaztatzerik, mezu estatikoak kenduz. *meta/variants.yml*eta gehitu *javascript* benetako/faltezko aldaki-pinak matrize-babesle dinamikoa berdea mantentzeko."

