# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumentuak a `services.matomo.track: false` aukera-irteera `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Rola mantentzen da `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (beraz, kontratua asebeteta geratzen da) baina `roles_with_service('matomo')` hortik jaisten da `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` eta matomo aztarnaria e2kontratua. Fitxategi estatikorako erreserbatua (auto-indizea) eta 301- HTML orririk ez duten zerbitzari zuzenak, merezi dutenak. `_paq` Aztarnaria. Markatzaileari laguntzen dio `track:` Datuen bandera, bilaketa-ohiturak."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumentuak a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` aukera-irteera `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Rola mantentzen da `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (beraz, kontratua asebeteta geratzen da) baina `roles_with_service('prometheus')` hortik jaisten da `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Gordeta. 301-zuzeneko vhost-ak, lua-resty-prometheus-en bidez eskaerarik egiten ez dutenak, beraz, ez dute igortzen. `app=\"<role>\"` etiketatu eta ez dute hondakin-helbururik. Markatzaileari laguntzen dio `scrape:` Datuen bandera, bilaketa-ohiturak."

# libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Dokumentuak `unsafe-*: true` bandera `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. A-rekin parekatu behar dira `Reason:` lerro berean, atsedenik gabe zer hausten den esaten. `unsafe-inline` XSS-k behar duen lineako exekuzioa berriro onartzen du eta `unsafe-eval` katetik kodetu, beraz bandera egiaztatu behar da exekutatzen ari den aplikazioaren aurka, ez beste rol batetik kopiatu."

