# libretranslate
msgid "Easily customize your YOURLS instance through environment variables: set your site URL, admin credentials, and more."
msgstr "Pertsonalizatu erraz YOURLS adibidez ingurune-aldagaien bidez: ezarri zure gunearen URLa, admin kredentzialak eta gehiago."

# libretranslate
msgid "Easily extend this role with:"
