# libretranslate
msgid "Edit `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. You MUST NOT hand-edit the staged copy under `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; the rerunner overwrites it from the repo on each run."
msgstr "Editatu `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Ez duzu eskuz editatu behar eszenatutako kopia azpian `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR/<role>/tests/`; Errebeldeak gainidazten du lasterketa bakoitzeko repo-tik."

