msgid "Entries render **disabled**, and the task enables each one in the same write that carries its grant. An empty ``access_grants`` is not “nobody”: Open WebUI reads it as every administrator, which is wider than the ``mcp`` group. Since ``ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`` makes the env authoritative again on every start, an enabled-but-ungranted entry would hand access to all administrators before the first provisioning run and after any bare container restart. A disabled entry is not served at all, so the fallback is no access rather than too much."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "Entries render **disabled**, and the task enables each one in the same write that carries its grant. An empty `access_grants` is not \"nobody\": Open WebUI reads it as every administrator, which is wider than the `mcp` group. Since `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false` makes the env authoritative again on every start, an enabled-but-ungranted entry would hand access to all administrators before the first provisioning run and after any bare container restart. A disabled entry is not served at all, so the fallback is no access rather than too much."
msgstr "Sarrerak errendatzea **desgaituta**eta atazak aukera ematen dio bakoitzari bere laguntza daraman idazki berean. Hutsik `access_grants` ez da \"nobody\": Open WebUIk administratzaile oro bezala irakurtzen du, zabalagoa dena `mcp` taldea. Noiztik `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false` Inbestidurak hasiera bakoitzean berriro autoritario egiten du, baina ez-ezabatutako sarrera batek administratzaile guztiei sarbidea emango die lehen hornidura burutu aurretik eta edukiontzi hutsa berrabiarazi ondoren. Ezinduen sarrera ez da ezertarako balio, beraz, atzeratzea ez da sarbidetza, gehiegi baino."

