# libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) eta erakutsi nginx sorta GCP Artifact Erregistroko URLak kudeatzeko (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)Une honetan `gcr.io` blob-a tiratzen da `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` barruan [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), Erregistro horien cachea desgaitzen duen konponbidea da. Epe luzerakoa: igo berriro korrontera `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` birbideratze-forma berria ezagutzeko arauak, sardexkan ontzia, puntua `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (edo bere irudi-etiketa) sardexkan, eta jaregin `NO_PROXY` Zeharka."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Fork `pull_request` Korrikalariek beti jasotzen dute irakurtzeko soilik den tokena (GitHub-enforced); Etiketa honek ez du inoiz token edo sekreturik ematen gertaera ez-fidagarriei."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Sardexka nagusiaren sinkronizazioa: uneko biltegiaren fluxua sinkronizatzen du *nagusia* konfiguratutako iturburu-biltegi batetik (lehenetsia *infinito-nexus/core*) CIren esparrua eta aurkikuntza agortu aurretik, beraz, sardexkaren adar batek bere aldaketak bakarrik ikusten ditu oinarri eguneratu baten aurka. Iturburua gaindiezina da, edo zeharkaezina. *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* biltegi-aldagaia, eta sinkronizazio-indarrean idatzitakoa *nagusia*Beraz, biltegi sinkronizatua ez da lan-adar gisa erabili behar. Ikusi [Ekintzak konfiguratzeko erreferentzia](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork, PR, release, or scheduled paths affected:"
msgstr "Sardexka, PR, askatu edo planifikatutako bideek eragina dute:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork-PR CI hardening (follow-up to the 11.1.0 trusted-fork flow): the privileged *pull_request_target* image producer and mirror now set *allow-unsafe-pr-checkout* so *actions/checkout* stops refusing the merged fork ref it had begun rejecting. Untrusted fork builds run without organization secrets — they authenticate to GHCR with the per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* only and mirror Docker Hub anonymously — while the maintainer-trusted path keeps full credentials and builds the raw PR head. The trust switch moved to the *🛡️ Trusted* label. See [the fork-PR pipeline](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) and [the GHCR authentication reference](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."
msgstr "Fork-PR CI gogortzea (Jarraipena 11.1.0 Konfiantzazko sardexka-fluxua): pribilegiatuak *pull_request_target* irudi-ekoizlea eta ispilua orain ezarrita *ez-segurua-pr-checkout* beraz, *ekintzak/egiaztapena* uko egiten hasi zen sardexkaren errefutatzeari. Sardexka ez-fidagarriak erakundeko sekreturik gabe exekutatzen dira, eta GHCR-ra autentifikatzen dute lan bakoitzeko. *GITHUB_TOKEN* Docker Hub-a anonimoki bakarrik eta ispilu gisa soilik, eta bide-izen gordeak kredentzialak betetzen ditu eta PR buru gordina eraikitzen du. Fidagarritasuna aldatu egin zen. *🛡️ Fidatua* etiketa. Ikusi [sardexka-PR kanalizazioa](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) eta [GHCR autentifikazio-erreferentzia](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."

