# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Input (env): ``APP_ID``. Optional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (JSON ``{app_id: variant_index}``, set per round by the matrix orchestrator) selects the active variant so a variant that pins ``services.*`` flags to ``false`` prunes those providers from the closure instead of the provision step pulling them in from the variant-free base config. In-process callers that already hold the round map pass it as ``derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)``; the env var is read only when that argument is omitted."
msgstr "Sarrera (env): ``APP_ID``. Aukerakoa ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (JSON ``{app_id: variant_index}``, Matrize-orkestratzaileak biribildurik) aldagarri aktiboa hautatzen du, pintzen duen aldaera bat ``services.*`` banderak ``false`` Zerbitzu-urratsaren ordez, hornitzaile horiek ixten ditu aldagarririk gabeko oinarri-konfiguraziotik tiraka. Prozesuko dei-egileek, mapa borobila jadanik mantentzen dutenak, honela pasatzen dute: ``derive_includes(app_id, variants=...)``; env var-a soilik irakurtzen da argumentu hori falta denean."

# libretranslate
