# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "Sarrerak"

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` (the SPOT for the deployment domain; defined in ``default.env`` and exported by ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh``; the development inventory reads the same env var for the play's ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``), ``HOSTS_ENTRY_IP`` (optional; address the domains map to, default ``127.0.0.1``)."
msgstr "Sarrerak (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` (hedapenaren domeinurako SPOT; hemen definituta: ``default.env`` eta esportatuta ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh``; garapenaren inbentarioak var bera irakurtzen du antzezlanerako. ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``), ``HOSTS_ENTRY_IP`` (aukerakoa; helbide honetara zuzendu, lehenespenez ``127.0.0.1``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INV_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/inv/devices.yml``). Optional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (consumed by ``derive_includes``)."
msgstr "Sarrerak (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INV_PATH`` (lehenetsia ``/tmp/inv/devices.yml``)Aukerakoa ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (kontsumitua ``derive_includes``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``INV_DIR`` — inventory dir holding ``host_vars/*.yml`` (default ``/tmp/inv``)."
msgstr "Sarrerak (env): ``INV_DIR`` - Inbentarioen direktorioa gordeta ``host_vars/*.yml`` (lehenetsia ``/tmp/inv``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``). A second ed25519 keypair is generated at ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (SPOT: default.env) and its public half lands in ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` so the DR drill's backup host can pull over the ``user-backup`` ssh-wrapper. The ``applications`` block written into the extras file carries the ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source device paths, which is all the DR drill reads back from it. The deploy-facing overrides, including ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (derived per round from ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``), are baked by the matrix orchestrator into the provisioner's host_vars merge (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), NOT into the extras file: extra-vars replace the whole inventory ``applications`` dict and would strip every generated credential. ``users`` carries the same hazard for the same reason, and its authorized_keys travel the same merge channel. The deploy-facing twin ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` therefore carries everything except ``applications`` and ``users``."
msgstr "Sarrerak (env): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (lehenetsia ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (lehenetsia ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``)Bigarren ed. bat25519 keypair sortzen da ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (SPOT: default.env) eta bere lur erdia ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` beraz, DR zulagailuaren babeskopia-ostalariak gainetik tira dezake ``user-backup`` ssh-wrapper. The ``applications`` estra-fitxategian idatzitako blokeak eramaten du ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source gailuen bideak, DR zulagailu guztiek bertatik irakurtzen dutena. Desploy-facing overrides, barne ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (biribilaren arabera ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``)matrize-orkestratzaileak erreko ditu hornigailuaren barruan host_vars batu (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), NOT estras fitxategian: var gehigarriek inbentario osoa ordezten dute ``applications`` diktatu eta sortutako kredentzial guztiak kenduko lituzke. ``users`` arrisku bera dauka arrazoi beragatik, eta bere authorized_keys Bidaiatu fusio-kanal bera. Biki deploy-facing ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` dena eramaten du, dena izan ezik. ``applications`` eta ``users``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Inputs come from the merged application config (``services.<key>.image`` and ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` and ``version=`` keyword overrides bypass those values for ad-hoc references (e.g. side-car init containers that do not appear in the services map)."
msgstr "Batutako aplikazioaren konfiguraziotik datoz sarrerak (``services.<key>.image`` eta ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` eta ``version=`` gako-hitzak gainidatzi egiten ditu erreferentzia ad-hocentzat balio horiek (adibidez, zerbitzu-mapan agertzen ez diren albo-autoko edukiontziak)."

