msgid "Inputs 🔧"
msgstr "Sarrerak 🔧"

# libretranslate
msgid "Inside a play the process boundary is the task: Ansible forks a fresh worker per task, so `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. `get_merged_applications` therefore also accepts the play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parked once by the constructor stage) and serves it when the key matches. See [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the contract."
msgstr "Obra baten barruan prozesuaren muga dago: lan bakoitzeko langile berri bat sar daiteke, beraz, `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` hutsik hasten da langile guztietan. `get_merged_applications` horregatik, play-scoped garraiatzailea ere onartzen du `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache tekla, behin konstruktorearen agertokian aparkatuta) Eta gakoa bat datorrenean balio du. Ikusi [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) kontratuarengatik."

