# libretranslate
msgid "It hooks `http_api_curl` rather than `http_request_args` because the args array cannot express a proxy: WordPress core's `WP_HTTP_Proxy` hardcodes `CURLPROXY_HTTP`, so SOCKS5 is reachable only on the raw cURL handle. Without it, libcurl refuses an `.onion` host at name resolution under [RFC 7686](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7686) — before `/etc/hosts`, `extra_hosts` or DNS is consulted — and the token exchange fails with cURL error 6, which WordPress surfaces as `wp-login.php?login-error=http_request_failed`."
msgstr "It hooks `http_api_curl` ordez, `http_request_args` args array-ak ezin duelako proxy bat adierazi: WordPress-en core-a `WP_HTTP_Proxy` kode gogorrak `CURLPROXY_HTTP`, Beraz, SOCKS5 URL gordinaren heldulekura bakarrik iristen da. Hori gabe, libcurlek uko egiten dio bati `.onion` ostalari izen bereizmenean [RFC 7686](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7686) lehenago `/etc/hosts`, `extra_hosts` edo DNSa kontsultatua dago eta token-trukeak huts egiten du URL-aren errorearekin 6WordPress-en azalak `wp-login.php?login-error=http_request_failed`."

