# libretranslate
msgid "Only one swarm cluster fits per worktree: the lab subnet is pinned to the worktree slot (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` in `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), so a second cluster in the same worktree fails at network creation with `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`. `swarm-zombie` therefore reclaims whatever holds that subnet before it starts (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`), so a cluster kept with `keep=true` survives only until the next swarm run in the same worktree. Inspect a kept cluster before starting the next run. Parallel clusters need separate worktrees (`make worktree-up`), which carry distinct lab octets and are left untouched by the reclaim; `make swarm-clean` is the deliberate exception that clears every worktree's clusters."
msgstr "Kumulu pila bat baino ez da egokitzen lan-zuhaitzeko azpisarera. (`INFINITO_SWARM_LAB_SUBNET` barruan `scripts/system/worktree/up.sh`), Beraz, bigarren kluster batek huts egiten du sareko sorkuntzan. `invalid pool request: Pool overlaps`. `swarm-zombie` Beraz, hasi aurretik azpisare hori daukan guztia birjartzen du. (`utils/clean/lab_subnet.sh`)beraz, klusterrarekin `keep=true` Lan-zuhaitz berean hurrengo tropelak korrika egin arte bakarrik irauten du bizirik. Aztertu gordetako kluster bat hurrengo saioa hasi aurretik. Kumulu paraleloek lan-zuhaitz bereiziak behar dituzte (`make worktree-up`)Laborategiko oktets ezberdinak eramaten dituztenak, eta errelaimak ukitu gabe uzten dituztenak; `make swarm-clean` salbuespena da lan-zuhaitzaren kluster guztiak garbitzen dituena."

# libretranslate
msgid "Only return to `mode=reinstall` when you have concrete evidence that the inventory or the host stack itself is broken (for example DNS or network failures during the deploy)."
msgstr "Itzuli hona `mode=reinstall` inbentarioa edo ostalariaren pila bera hondatuta dagoela froga zehatzak dituzunean (adibidez, DNS edo sareko hutsegiteak zabaltzean)."

