# libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Sistema eragileko paketeen kudeatzaileak, adibidez [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) eta [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) Instalatutako softwarea sinkronizatuta mantentzen du bere upstream banaketa biltegiekin. Komando-azal desberdineko itsasontzi bakoitza, baina guztiek helburu bera dute: indizea freskatu eta ostalariko pakete guztiak eguneratu."

# libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as `apt <https://wiki.debian.org/Apt>`__, `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman>`__ and `dnf <https://dnf.readthedocs.io/>`__ keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Sistema eragileko paketeen kudeatzaileak, adibidez `apt <https://wiki.debian.org/Apt>`__, `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman>`__ eta `dnf <https://dnf.readthedocs.io/>`__ Instalatutako softwarea sinkronizatuta mantentzen du bere upstream banaketa biltegiekin. Komando-azal desberdineko itsasontzi bakoitza, baina guztiek helburu bera dute: indizea freskatu eta ostalariko pakete guztiak eguneratu."

