# libretranslate
msgid "Operator-confirmed: keep this PR focused on the role itself. No `meta/services.yml::<app>.backup.pre_backup_hook` field is introduced here; central MariaDB + role volume snapshots are the v1 backup story."
msgstr "Operadoreak baieztatu du: mantendu PR hau paperean zentratuta. Ez `meta/services.yml::<app>.backup.pre_backup_hook` eremua hemen sartzen da; erdiko MariaDB + paperaren bolumenaren argazkiak v dira1 babeskopiaren historia."

# libretranslate
