# libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux, this role ensures secure SSL/TLS certificate generation with minimal manual intervention. It supports both ``webroot`` and ``DNS-01`` validation methods, providing flexibility based on your infrastructure needs."
msgstr "Archlinux-entzat optimizatua, funtzio honek SSL/TLS ziurtagirien sorrera ziurtatzen du, esku-hartze minimoarekin. Biak onartzen ditu ``webroot`` eta ``DNS-01`` Balidazio-metodoak, zure azpiegitura-beharretan oinarritutako malgutasuna eskainiz."

