# libretranslate
msgid "Owns `_APPLICATIONS_DEFAULTS_CACHE`, `_VARIANTS_CACHE`, and `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE`. Public API: `get_application_defaults`, `get_variants`, `get_merged_applications`. Strictly ansible-free at import time so the GitHub Actions runner-host CLI path (`cli.administration.deploy.development.init` -> `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` -> `get_variants`) keeps working without ansible installed."
msgstr "Norberarenak `_APPLICATIONS_DEFAULTS_CACHE`, `_VARIANTS_CACHE`, eta `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE`. API publikoa: `get_application_defaults`, `get_variants`, `get_merged_applications`. Inportazio-denboran guztiz anexionatu gabe, GitHub Ekintzak txapeldun CLI bidea (`cli.administration.deploy.development.init` -> `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` -> `get_variants`) lanean jarraitzen du instalatu gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "Owns `_MERGED_DOMAINS_CACHE`. Public API: `get_merged_domains`. The domain map is intentionally derived from the applications view rather than living in a parallel top-level overrides path. Per-app domain declarations live in `applications.<app>.domains` and flow through the regular applications-merge pipeline."
msgstr "Norberarenak `_MERGED_DOMAINS_CACHE`. API publikoa: `get_merged_domains`. Domeinu-mapa nahita aplikazioen ikuspegitik dator, goi-mailako bide paraleloan bizi beharrean. Per-app domeinu-adierazpenak bizi dira `applications.<app>.domains` eta aplikazioen ohiko hodia zeharkatzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "Owns `_USERS_DEFAULTS_CACHE` and `_MERGED_USERS_CACHE`. Public API: `get_user_defaults`, `get_merged_users`. The Ansible-facing `users` lookup plugin consumes `get_merged_users` directly from this module (`from utils.cache.users import get_merged_users`)."
msgstr "Norberarenak `_USERS_DEFAULTS_CACHE` eta `_MERGED_USERS_CACHE`. API publikoa: `get_user_defaults`, `get_merged_users`. Ansible-facing `users` Bilaketa-pluginak kontsumitzen du `get_merged_users` zuzenean modulu honetatik (`from utils.cache.users import get_merged_users`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Owns the mirror path formula for both the provider that writes the copies and the registry probes that read them."
msgstr "Ispilu-bidearen formularen jabea da kopia eta erregistro-zundak idazten dituen hornitzailearentzat."

# libretranslate
msgid "Owns the package-level `_reset_cache_for_tests()` orchestrator that clears every cache plus the shared fingerprint memo in one call."
