# libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning fills a missing credential and leaves an existing one alone. That keeps a redeploy stable, and it also means no deploy ever runs against a secret that moved: every pass reads the value the first pass wrote. Dropping the generated values and regenerating them between two deploy passes turns the second pass into a test of the update path, where each role has to push its new secret into the application and the database it already created."
msgstr "Behin-behinekoak falta den kredentzial bat betetzen du eta existitzen den bakarra uzten du. Horrek egonkor mantentzen du, eta horrek esan nahi du ez dela inoiz mugitzen den sekretu baten aurka ibiliko: pase bakoitzak irakurtzen du lehen pasarteak idatzitako balioa. Sortutako balioak baztertuz eta bi deplizioren artean birsortuz, bigarren aukera eguneratze-bidearen proba bihurtzen da, non rol bakoitzak bere sekretu berria aplikaziora eta sortu duen datu-basera bultzatu behar duen."

# libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host that cannot reach PyPI must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/sql.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Xedea ahaleginik onena da: PyPIra iritsi ezin den ostalariak ez du ate osoa hutsik egin behar. scripts/lint/sql.sh Salto egiten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host that cannot reach the npm registry must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/css.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Behin-behinekoa ahaleginik onena da: npm erregistrora iritsi ezin den ostalariak ezin du ate osoa huts egin. scripts/lint/css.sh Salto egiten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host without PHP, or one that cannot install it, must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/php.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Xedea ahaleginik onena da: PHPrik gabeko ostalariak, edo instalatu ezin duenak, ezin du ate osoa huts egin. scripts/lint/php.sh Salto egiten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning is best effort: a host without Ruby, or one that cannot install it, must not fail the whole gate. scripts/lint/ruby.sh skips loudly instead."
msgstr "Xedea ahaleginik onena da: anfitrioi batek, Rubyrik gabe, edo instalatu ezin duenak, ezin du ate osoa hutsik egin. scripts/lint/ruby.sh Salto egiten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning runs in ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: it copies the plugin into the code volume, runs ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, enables ``enablewebservices``, appends ``mcp`` to ``webserviceprotocols``, creates the ``infinito_mcp`` external service, attaches the read-only functions, mints the permanent token and stores it under ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``."
msgstr "Behin-behineko exekuzioak ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: Plugina kode-bolumenean kopiatzen du, exekutatzen du ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, gaitu ``enablewebservices``, eranskinak ``mcp`` - ``webserviceprotocols``, sortzen du ``infinito_mcp`` kanpoko zerbitzuak, irakurtzeko soilik diren funtzioak erantsi, token iraunkorra moztu eta azpian gordetzen du ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning runs in `tasks/utils/mcp.yml`: it copies the plugin into the code volume, runs `admin/cli/upgrade.php`, enables `enablewebservices`, appends `mcp` to `webserviceprotocols`, creates the `infinito_mcp` external service, attaches the read-only functions, mints the permanent token and stores it under `users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']`."
msgstr "Behin-behineko exekuzioak `tasks/utils/mcp.yml`: Plugina kode-bolumenean kopiatzen du, exekutatzen du `admin/cli/upgrade.php`, gaitu `enablewebservices`, eranskinak `mcp` - `webserviceprotocols`, sortzen du `infinito_mcp` kanpoko zerbitzuak, irakurtzeko soilik diren funtzioak erantsi, token iraunkorra moztu eta azpian gordetzen du `users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']`."

# libretranslate
