# libretranslate
msgid "Pure function — reads role metadata via cached YAML helpers and emits ``PlanEntry`` tuples; no filesystem side effects. The include set per round is resolved by the ``CombinedResolver`` (see ``.legacy_resolver``): each role contributes its own pulled-in providers and the include is the union. A service-key is therefore pulled in as soon as ANY role in the round-aware closure says it should be (literal ``True`` OR the ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, both accepted by ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); if EVERY role marks it ``False`` it stays out of the include."
msgstr "Funtzio hutsa - rol metadatuak irakurtzen ditu cache bidez YAML laguntzaileak eta igortzen ditu ``PlanEntry`` tuples; fitxategi-sistemako bigarren mailako efekturik ez. Txanda bakoitzean ezarritakoa ebazten du ``CombinedResolver`` (Ikusi ``.legacy_resolver``): rol bakoitzak bere hornitzaileei laguntzen die, eta horien batura da. Zerbitzu-gako bat, beraz, itxituran edozein rolk esaten duenean izan behar duela (literala ``True`` Edo ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja forma, biak onartuak ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); rol bakoitzak markatzen badu ``False`` Ez da sartzen."

