msgid "Re-routing an alias is a one-line edit to `roles/svc-ai-litellm/templates/config.yaml.j2` followed by `make compose-deploy apps=svc-ai-litellm`; confirm no consumer redeploy is needed by prompting a consumer afterwards without redeploying it."
msgstr "Alias bat birbideratzea lerro bakarreko edizioa da `roles/svc-ai-litellm/templates/config.yaml.j2` ondoren `make compose-deploy apps=svc-ai-litellm`; baieztatu kontsumitzaileak ez duela erreleborik behar kontsumitzaile bati galdetuz gero, berriro ireki gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "Re-run `infinito administration deploy dedicated ...` against the same inventory file."
msgstr "Berriro exekutatu `infinito administration deploy dedicated ...` inbentario-fitxategi beraren aurka."

# libretranslate
msgid "Re-run `infinito administration inventory provision ...` to refresh the inventory file and included app list."
msgstr "Berriro exekutatu `infinito administration inventory provision ...` Inbentarioaren fitxategia freskatzeko eta aplikazioen zerrenda sartzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "Re-run after an inventory change when the running stack state SHOULD be preserved."
msgstr "Inbentario-aldaketa baten ondoren exekutatu berriro, pila-egoera gorde behar denean."

# libretranslate
msgid "Re-run the specific failing target first (`make test-unit`, `make lint-ansible`, …), then the full `make quality-high` before declaring the gate green: a fix that breaks a neighbouring target is not a fix."
msgstr "Exekutatu berriro huts egiteko helburu zehatza lehenik (`make test-unit`, `make lint-ansible`,...), Orduan, bete-betea `make quality-high` Atea berde deklaratu aurretik: auzoko helburu bat hausten duen finka bat ez da konponketa bat."

# libretranslate
msgid "Re-run the workflow after any permission or visibility changes."
msgstr "Berriro exekutatu lan-fluxua, edozein baimen edo ikusgaitasun-aldaketen ondoren."

# libretranslate
msgid "Re-uses ``dedicated.command.parse_args`` verbatim, then rewrites ``args.id`` via the swarm closure between parse and dispatch."
msgstr "Berrerabili ``dedicated.command.parse_args`` hitzez hitz, gero berridatzi ``args.id`` analizatze eta bidalketen arteko itxiduraren bidez."

# libretranslate
msgid "Reach the endpoint by hand with:"
msgstr "Heldu amaiera-puntua eskutik:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Reachability (:func:`manifest_exists`) distinguishes three outcomes: ``True`` (tag present), ``False`` (registry answered 404 — tag absent), and ``None`` (indeterminate: network error, auth wall, rate limit) so callers can fail on a genuinely broken pin without flaking on a slow or private registry."
msgstr "Heldutasuna (:func:`manifest_exists`) Hiru emaitza bereizten ditu: ``True`` (gaur), ``False`` (erregistroak erantzun du 404 etiketa falta da)eta ``None`` (indeterminatua: sareko errorea, hegoaldeko horma, tasa-muga) Beraz, dei-egileek huts egin dezakete orratz benetan hautsi batean, erregistro motel edo pribaturik gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "Reachability, not syntax"
msgstr "Heldugarritasuna, ez sintaxia"

# libretranslate
msgid "Reaching a tool server is a distinct grant from using the application, carried by the provider's `mcp` RBAC role. `mcp` is application-scoped: it is granted through `application_roles`, never through the unscoped `roles` list, so granting it on one application grants it nowhere else."
msgstr "Tresna-zerbitzari batera iristea laguntza desberdina da, hornitzailearen aplikazioak gidatua. `mcp` RBACen papera. `mcp` aplikazio-skopioa da: honen bidez ematen da `application_roles`, Inoiz ez deskontsektutik `roles` zerrenda, beraz, aplikazio batean emateak ez du beste inon ematen."

# libretranslate
msgid "React to play/task events (logging, reporting, notifications)."
msgstr "Jokatzeko/zereginak egiteko erreakzionatu (erregistratu, jakinarazi, jakinarazpenak)."

