msgid "Replaces the tip commit instead of adding one. The agent cannot see whether the operator committed on top in the meantime (a release commit, a signed commit), so an amend can rewrite a commit it never authored and detach its tags and signature; on a pushed tip it forces a force-push. Follow-up changes land as a new commit."
