# libretranslate
msgid "SeaweedFS is the shared S3 object store. A role becomes a consumer by declaring a `seaweedfs` service in `meta/services.yml`, wiring its app config from `lookup('objstore', application_id, ...)` (bucket / access_key / secret_key / url / region), and shipping a gated `files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`. See `web-app-mastodon`, `web-app-pixelfed`, and `web-app-nextcloud` for the reference pattern. SeaweedFS S3 requires **path-style addressing** and the internal `http://` endpoint."
msgstr "SeaweedFS partekatua da S3 objektuen biltegia. Rol bat kontsumitzaile bihurtzen da, bat deklaratuz `seaweedfs` zerbitzua `meta/services.yml`, aplikazioa konfiguratuz `lookup('objstore', application_id, ...)` (kuboa access_key / secret_key / url / eskualdea)eta bidalketak `files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`. `web-app-mastodon`, `web-app-pixelfed`, eta `web-app-nextcloud` erreferentzia-ereduarentzat. SeaweedFS S3 eskakizunak **bide-estiloko helbideratzea** eta barnekoa `http://` amaierako puntua."

