# libretranslate
msgid "Security: resolved all 80 open CodeQL/code-scanning alerts and added recurrence guards. Broke an unsafe import cycle in *cli/administration/deploy/development* via a leaf *env.py*; hardened *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (cookie prototype-pollution guard, log sanitisation, HTML-escaped exceptions, ReDoS-bounded handle regex) and *web-app-baserow* SSO open-redirect handling; required TLS ≥ 1.2 in network diagnose probes; validated *actionlint* tar members against path traversal; rewrote *decidim*/*apt-purge* regexes to avoid catastrophic backtracking; anchored six Playwright URL regexes and pinned *crs-k/stale-branches* to a SHA. Guards: an *import-linter* contract, a lint requiring justified bandit *noqa*, and ruff *BLE001* as a ratchet."
msgstr "Segurtasuna: dena konponduta 80 ireki CodeQL/code-scanning alertak eta errepikatutako zaindariak. Inportatzeko ziklo seguru bat hautsi du *cli/administration/deploy/development* hosto baten bidez *env.py*; gogortua *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (cookie-en prototipo-zerbitzuen zaindaria, egunkari-osasuna, HTMLtik ihes egindako salbuespenak, ReDoS-rekin loturiko heldulekua) eta *web-app-baserow* SSO zeharkako kudeaketa; TLS ≥ behar da 1.2 sareko diagnostiko probetan; baliozkotua *actionlint* bide-bazterraren aurkako tar-tar kideak; berridatzita *decidim*/*apt-purge* regexeak atzeko segimendu katastrofikoak saihesteko; sei Playwright URL erregex ainguratu eta pinned *crs-k/stale-branches* SHA batean. Guardiak: *Inportatzailea* kontratua, benit justifikatua eskatzen duen lints bat *noqa*eta ruff *BLE001* Arratoi bat bezala."

# libretranslate
msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, which is only safe because the app port is bound to `127.0.0.1` and every request traverses the oauth2-proxy that overwrites `X-Forwarded-*`. The `X-Auth-Request-*` / `Remote-User` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through `web-svc-logout` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks' own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr "Segurtasuna: identitate-goiburuak baldintzarik gabe fidagarriak dira, eta hori segurua da aplikazioaren atakari lotuta dagoelako. `127.0.0.1` eta eskaera bakoitzak oauth zeharkatzen du2- gainidazten duen proxy-a `X-Forwarded-*`. The `X-Auth-Request-*` / `Remote-User` aldakiak nahita ez ikusi egiten dira, beraz, bezero batek ezin du beste identitate bat injektatu. Saioa amaitu behar da `web-svc-logout` / oauth2-proxy sign-out, ez Postmarks-en saioa amaitzeko esteka, proxy-goiburuak hurrengo eskaeraren saioa berrezartzen duelako."

# libretranslate
msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, which is only safe because the app port is bound to ``127.0.0.1`` and every request traverses the oauth2-proxy that overwrites ``X-Forwarded-*``. The ``X-Auth-Request-*`` / ``Remote-User`` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through ``web-svc-logout`` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks’ own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr "Segurtasuna: identitate-goiburuak baldintzarik gabe fidagarriak dira, eta hori segurua da aplikazioaren atakari lotuta dagoelako. ``127.0.0.1`` eta eskaera bakoitzak oauth zeharkatzen du2- gainidazten duen proxy-a ``X-Forwarded-*``. The ``X-Auth-Request-*`` / ``Remote-User`` aldakiak nahita ez ikusi egiten dira, beraz, bezero batek ezin du beste identitate bat injektatu. Saioa amaitu behar da ``web-svc-logout`` / oauth2-proxy sign-out, ez Postmarks-en saioa amaitzeko esteka, proxy-goiburuak hurrengo eskaeraren saioa berrezartzen duelako."

