# libretranslate
msgid "Swap size is a **fixed constant**, not a \"free space minus buffer\" calculation. An earlier version took ~99 GB on a 145 GB root partition, leaving so little headroom that later Docker layer writes (Playwright test image pull) failed with `no space left on device`. A fixed cap is large enough to absorb the peertube spike and small enough that Docker layer writes keep succeeding throughout the 30+ min deploy."
msgstr "Swap tamaina bat da **konstante finkoa**ez a \"leku librea minus bufferra\" Kalkulua. Aurreko bertsio batek hartu zuen ~99 GB a 145 GB erroko partizioa, hain gela txikia utziz gero Docker geruzak idazten du (Playwright probako irudia tira) huts egin du `no space left on device`. Kaputxa finko bat aski handia da parekoaren punta xurgatzeko eta Docker-en geruzak arrakasta izaten jarraitzeko. 30-Bai."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swap step MUST run **after** `actions/checkout` because the script lives inside the repo."
msgstr "Trukatze-urratsak lasterka egin behar du **ondoren** `actions/checkout` Zeren gidoia repo barruan bizi baita."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swap step MUST run **before** any `make compose-up` / container build step so the expanded swap is active when heavy-allocation work begins."
msgstr "Trukatze-urratsak lasterka egin behar du **lehenago** edozein `make compose-up` / edukiontzia eraikitzeko urratsa, swap hedatua aktibo egon dadin esleipen astuna hasten denean."

# libretranslate
