# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Swarm modua - `<stack>_<service_key>`, nola parekatzen den Docker Swarm izendatu zerbitzu guztiak eta nola `container service ps` onartzen ditu. Pila-izena hortik dator ``application_id`` bidez ``get_entity_name`` iragazkia, ispiluak nola ``docker stack deploy`` Idatzi pilaren izena ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Swarm modua - exekutatzen ari den zereginaren edukiontzi-identifikazioa ebazten duen shell-a, exekuzio-denboran, adibidez. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarmek zerbitzu guztiak izendatzen ditu ``<stack>_<key>`` eta ez du bat datorren aurrizkirik onartzen; laguntzaileak STACKetik sortzen du izen hori. SERVICE_KEY args. Azpigeruzak ebazpena ematen du exekuzio-uneraino, ID zaharkitua eta analisi-denbora-hutsunea saihestuz, balio ebatzi bat itzuliz vars-resolution orduan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - the same reference, prefixed with the in-cluster registry host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) when ``swarm.registry.host`` and ``swarm.registry.port`` are set. With no registry configured, swarm falls back to the un-prefixed form."
msgstr "Swarm modua - erreferentzia bera, distira-erregistroaren ostalariarekin aurrez aurre: (Adibidez: ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) Noiz ``swarm.registry.host`` eta ``swarm.registry.port`` Prest daude. Ez dago erregistrorik konfiguratuta, ez dago aurrez aurreko formarik."

