# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm-test only (called by the swarm matrix after provision). In swarm an embedded per-app database (``shared: false``) resolves to a per-app mariadb whose volume is NFS-backed with no placement pin — InnoDB on NFS plus a free-floating task is unsupported (locking, split-brain). Embedded DBs are a compose-only pattern. Flipping every consumer's DB service to ``shared: true`` routes it to the central svc-db-* provider (as the baseline variant does), so no per-app DB is scheduled in swarm."
msgstr "Swarm proba bakarrik (agindu ondoren, matrize-multzoak deitu zuen). In swarm per-app datu-base kapsulatua (``shared: false``) Aplikazio bakoitzeko mariadb bat ebazten du, zeinaren bolumena NFSren babesekoa den, kokapen-pinik gabe — InnoDB in NFS plus doako zeregin bat onartzen da (blokeatzeko, ebakitzeko). DB kapsulatuak eredu konposatu bat besterik ez dira. Kontsumitzailearen DB zerbitzu guztiak irauliz ``shared: true`` Ibilbidea svc-db zentralera* Hornitzailea (oinarrizko aldaerak egiten duen bezala)Beraz, ez dago programatuta aplikazio bakoitzeko DBrik."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm: the device grant renders in compose mode only, matching the cadvisor precedent, because `docker stack deploy` drops `devices`. An embodied device is single-node by definition, so this is consistent rather than a gap, but the swarm path of the agent roles is never exercised with the robot role present."
msgstr "Swarm: gailua konposatzeko moduan errendatzen da, aurreko kadvisadorearekin bat etorriz, zeren eta `docker stack deploy` tantak `devices`. Gailu borobil bat definizioz kodetuta dago, beraz, hau koherentea da tarte bat baino, baina agenteen rolen bide-multzoa ez da inoiz erabiltzen robotaren funtzioarekin."

