# libretranslate
msgid "Tests MUST live under `tests/unit/`."
msgstr "Probak bizi behar dira `tests/unit/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests MUST simulate real user behaviour by interacting with the rendered UI. Navigating directly to an action endpoint via `page.goto(<endpoint>)` is FORBIDDEN whenever a click target exists on the current surface. The most common offender is logout: a test MUST click a logout button or a logout link rendered by the role, never `page.goto(LOGOUT_URL)`. The same rule applies to login, password change, account deletion, file upload, post submission, and every other user-initiated action."
msgstr "Probak benetako erabiltzailearen portaera simulatu behar dute, errendatutako UIarekin elkarreraginez. Ekintzaren amaiera-puntura zuzenean nabigatzea `page.goto(<endpoint>)` FORBIDDEN da uneko gainazalean klik-helburu bat dagoenean. Delitugilerik arruntena saioa amaitzea da: probak saio-amaierako botoi batean edo rolak emandako konexio itxi batean klik egin behar du, inoiz ez. `page.goto(LOGOUT_URL)`. Arau bera aplikatzen zaio saio-hasierari, pasahitzaren aldaketari, kontua ezabatzeari, fitxategia igotzeari, posta bidaltzeari eta beste edozein ekintzari."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST NOT cover unrelated OAuth2 or OIDC configuration. Generic OAuth2 / OIDC invariants belong one level up under `oauth2_oidc/`. Port and domain checks belong under `tests/integration/ports/` and `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek ez dute zerikusirik OAuthekin2 Edo OIDC konfigurazioa. OAuth generikoa2 / OIDC aldaezinak maila bat beherago daude `oauth2_oidc/`. Ataka eta domeinu-kontrolak daude `tests/integration/ports/` eta `tests/integration/domains/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Ansible module / task usage rules."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek modulu ansiblea edo ataza-erabileraren arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover CLI-level behavior (argument parsing, `--help`, dispatcher). Tests for the libraries that CLIs import MUST live under `tests/unit/` or the relevant topical cluster."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek CLI mailaren portaera bakarrik estali behar dute (argumentuak aztertzea, `--help`, dispatcher). CLIs inportazioa duten liburutegien probak bizi egin behar dira `tests/unit/` edo gaikako klusterra."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Docker-specific semantics (images, tags, compose-service configuration). Generic compose-structure rules MUST live under `tests/integration/compose/`, and backup-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/backups/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak Docker-en berariazko semantika bakarrik estali behar ditu. (irudiak, etiketak, konposaketa-zerbitzuaren konfigurazioa). Konposizio-arau orokorrak bizi behar dira `tests/integration/compose/`, eta babeskopiarekin lotutako txekeak bizi behar dira. `tests/integration/backups/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover GitHub-side CI/CD artefacts (workflows, Dependabot, PR helpers). Tests for local `make` targets, role logic, or non-CI scripts MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek GitHub-en alboan CI/CD artefaktuak bakarrik estali behar dituzte (lan-fluxuak, Dependabot, PR laguntzaileak). Lokaleko probak `make` helburuak, funtzioen logika edo CI ez diren scriptak beste nonbait bizi behar dira. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Jinja-level concerns (template parsing, `{% include %}` resolution, variable reference/definition symmetry). Filter-plugin tests MUST live under `tests/integration/filters/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek Jinja-ren mailako kezkak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. (txantiloien analisia, `{% include %}` bereizmena, erreferentzia aldakorra/definizio simetria). Iragazki-pluginen probak bizi behar dira `tests/integration/filters/`."

msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Jinja2 expression composition rules. Rules that validate where dotted-path targets are declared live in the sibling [`../variables/`](../variables/) directory."
