# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Python source patterns. Dependency declarations MUST live under [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML/Jinja patterns MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek Python iturburu-ereduak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. Mendekotasun-adierazpenek bizi behar dute [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML/Jinja ereduak bizi behar dira [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover SQL-shape rules inside Ansible tasks."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek SQL-formako arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte ataza ansibleen barruan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover SSO configuration invariants. Generic port-uniqueness and port-reference-validity rules MUST live under `tests/integration/ports/`, and domain-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek SSO konfigurazioa aldagarriak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. Port-uniqueness eta port-reference-validity arau orokorrak bizi behar dira `tests/integration/ports/`, eta domeinu-kontrolak bizi behar dira `tests/integration/domains/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `.sh` source patterns. Python rules MUST live under [`python/`](../python/); YAML/Jinja rules MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `.sh` Iturburu-ereduak. Python-en arauak bizi behar dira [`python/`](../python/); YAML/Jinja-ren arauak bizi behar dira [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` content patterns. Python source rules MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."
