# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `application_id` rules (presence, deprecation, prefix-to-role-name consistency). Generic application-role checks (web-app README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` usage) MUST live one level up under [`../`](../)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `application_id` Arauak (presentzia, amortizazioa, aurrizki-izenen koherentzia). Aplikazio-kontrol orokorrak (Web aplikazioa README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` Erabilera) Maila bat beherago bizi behar da [`../`](../)."

