msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `group_vars/` edukia. Rol lokalen, portuen, sareen edo domeinuen erregistrorako probak beren gai-kumuluaren pean bizi behar dira beste nonbait. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/main.yml` presence and field shape. Tests about role dependencies declared in that file (`dependencies:`) MUST live under [`dependencies/`](dependencies/); checks tied to `meta/services.yml` MUST live under [`services/`](services/) (with the ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` checks under [`services/run_after/`](services/run_after/)); checks against `meta/variants.yml` MUST live under [`variants/`](variants/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `meta/main.yml` presentzia eta eremuaren forma. Fitxategi horretan deklaratutako rol-mendekotasunei buruzko probak (`dependencies:`) Azpian bizi behar da [`dependencies/`](dependencies/); txekeak lotuta `meta/services.yml` Azpian bizi behar da [`services/`](services/) (ordenarekin bakarrik `galaxy_info.run_after` azpiko kontrolak [`services/run_after/`](services/run_after/)); aurkako kontrolak `meta/variants.yml` Azpian bizi behar da [`variants/`](variants/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key. Checks tied specifically to `galaxy_info.run_after` (self-references, reference existence, run-after cycles) MUST live under [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Generic structural role checks (folder names, presence of `meta/main.yml`, include target existence) MUST live two levels up under `tests/integration/roles/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `meta/main.yml`da `dependencies:` Giltza. Kontrolak bereziki lotuta `galaxy_info.run_after` (Autoerreferentziak, erreferentzia-izatea, zikloen ondoren exekutatuak) Azpian bizi behar da [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Egiturazko funtzio generikoak egiaztatzen ditu (karpeta-izenak, presentzia `meta/main.yml`Sartu helburu-izatea) Behetik bi maila bizi behar dira `tests/integration/roles/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/services.yml` shape and content. The ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` cluster lives in the [`run_after/`](run_after/) sub-cluster; coverage of `meta/variants.yml` lives one level up in [`../variants/`](../variants/); coverage of `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key lives in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `meta/services.yml` forma eta edukia. Agindua bakarrik `galaxy_info.run_after` klusterra bizi da [`run_after/`](run_after/) azpi-klusterra; estaldura `meta/variants.yml` maila bat gora [`../variants/`](../variants/); estaldura `meta/main.yml`da `dependencies:` gakoa bizi da [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/variants.yml` shape and coverage. Coverage of `meta/services.yml` itself lives in [`../services/`](../services/); coverage of `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key lives in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `meta/variants.yml` Forma eta estaldura. Estaldura `meta/services.yml` Bere baitan bizi da [`../services/`](../services/); estaldura `meta/main.yml`da `dependencies:` gakoa bizi da [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `run_after` semantics. Checks that target the `dependencies:` key MUST live in the sibling [`../../dependencies/`](../../dependencies/) cluster; broader `meta/services.yml` shape checks MUST live one level up in [`../`](../)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `run_after` Semantika. Egiaztatu helburua `dependencies:` Gakoak anaitasunean bizi behar du [`../../dependencies/`](../../dependencies/) klusterra; zabalagoa `meta/services.yml` forma-kontrolak maila bat gora bizi behar du [`../`](../)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `run_once_*` flags and their lifecycle. Tests for generic fact overrides, task includes, or block structure MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira `run_once_*` banderak eta bizi-zikloa. Gertaera generikoen gainidazketak, atazak barne hartzen ditu edo bloke-egiturak beste nonbait bizi behar du. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover action plugins shipped under `plugins/action/` and their retry/error semantics. Tests that validate filter plugins, lookup plugins, or unrelated role logic MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak azpiko ekintza-pluginak bakarrik estali behar ditu `plugins/action/` eta haien semantika okerra. Iragazki-pluginak balioztatzen dituzten probak, bilaketa-pluginak edo logika zerikusirik ez duten funtzioak beste nonbait bizi behar dute. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover application-level role rules. Identity checks tied to the `application_id` variable itself (presence, uniqueness, deprecation, folder-name prefix, ports/domain/run_after/dependency consistency) MUST live under [`id/`](id/). Generic structural role checks MUST live one level up under [`../`](../)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek aplikazio-mailako rol-arauak bakarrik bete behar dituzte. Nortasun-kontrolak lotuta `application_id` aldagai bera (presentzia, bakartasuna, amortizazioa, karpeta-izenen aurrizkia, ports/domain/run_after/dependency Koherentzia) Azpian bizi behar da [`id/`](id/). Egiturazko funtzio generikoak maila bat gora bizi behar du [`../`](../)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover backup-related configuration consistency. Tests that validate unrelated compose structure, port mappings, or runtime behavior MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek babeskopiarekin lotutako konfigurazioaren koherentzia bakarrik estali behar dute. Konposaketa-egitura, portu-mapak edo exekuzio-portaera balioztatzen duten probak beste nonbait bizi behar dira. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover dependency declarations and requirement cross-references. Other Python source patterns MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek mendekotasun-adierazpenak eta eskakizunak gurutzatu behar dituzte. Beste Python iturburu-eredu batzuk bizi behar dira [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover documentation artefacts (`*.md`, README presence) and inline TODO markers. Code-level rules MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/), [`shell/`](../../filesystem/shell/), or [`yaml/`](../yaml/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak dokumentazioaren artefaktuak bakarrik estali behar ditu (`*.md`, IRAKASLEA) eta TODO markatzaileak azpimarratu. Kodeen mailako arauak bizi behar dira [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/), [`shell/`](../../filesystem/shell/), edo [`yaml/`](../yaml/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover domain declarations (structure, uniqueness, reference validity). Tests related to port registration, OIDC redirect URIs, or CSP handling MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek domeinu-adierazpenak bakarrik estali behar dituzte (egitura, berezitasuna, erreferentziaren baliozkotasuna). Portu-erregistroarekin zerikusia duten probak, OIDCk birbideratzeko URIak edo CSP maneiatzeak beste nonbait bizi behar du. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover file-naming and test-discovery contracts. Other Python conventions MUST live under [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak fitxategi-izen eta proba-aurkikuntzako kontratuak bakarrik estali behar ditu. Python-en beste konbentzio batzuek bizi behar dute. [`python/`](../../filesystem/python/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover filter-plugin definition and usage. Action-plugin, lookup-plugin, and template-rendering tests MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak iragazki-pluginaren definizioa eta erabilera bakarrik estali behar ditu. Ekintza-plugin, bilaketa-plugin eta txantiloiak berriro sortzeko probak beste nonbait bizi behar dira. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover handler invocation and naming rules. Tests for task-file includes, run-once flags, or block structure MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak kudeatzaileak deitu eta izendatzeko arauak bakarrik gorde behar ditu. Zeregin-fitxategiko probak banderak edo bloke-egiturak beste nonbait bizi behar du `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover inventory construction and schema-apply logic. Tests for provider resolution at the lookup layer MUST live under [`lookups/`](../lookups/); tests for the CLI wrappers that drive InventoryManager MUST live under [`cli/`](../../meta/cli/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek inbentarioaren eraikuntza eta eskemaren logika bakarrik estali behar dituzte. Bilaketa-geruzan hornitzailearen bereizmen-probak pean bizi behar dira [`lookups/`](../lookups/); Inbentario-Manager gidatzen duten CLI bilgarrietarako probak azpian bizi behar dira [`cli/`](../../meta/cli/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover lookup-plugin behavior (schema validation of `lookup('config', …)` paths, caching semantics, performance smoke). Pure unit tests for a single lookup plugin's return values MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak lookup-plugin portaera bakarrik estali behar du (eskema baliozkotzea `lookup('config', …)` bide-izenak, semantika zorrotza, erredura). Bilatzaile bakarreko balioen unitate hutsak bizi behar du `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover network/DNS/domain literal patterns. Compose- and role-level network structure MUST live under `tests/integration/infrastructure/networks/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik gorde behar dira network/DNS/domain Eredu literalak. Konposatuen eta rolen mailako sarearen egitura bizi behar da `tests/integration/infrastructure/networks/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover password/secret quoting and definition rules. Tests for filter plugins, Jinja syntax, or compose structure MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek pasahitz/sekretu-hitz eta definizio-arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. Iragazki-pluginen, Jinja-ren sintaxiaren edo egituraren probak beste nonbait bizi behar dute. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover prometheus-specific wiring and the prometheus service entry. Broader `meta/services.yml` shape rules MUST live one level up in [`services/`](../); the ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` cluster lives in [`run_after/`](../run_after/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek kableatze prometeo espezifikoa eta zerbitzu prometeoaren sarrera bakarrik estali behar dituzte. Broader `meta/services.yml` forma-arauek maila bat gora bizi behar dute [`services/`](../); ordena bakarrik `galaxy_info.run_after` klusterra bizi da [`run_after/`](../run_after/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover repository settings files (Claude Code config, IDE rule files, agent permission catalogues). Code conventions MUST live elsewhere under `tests/lint/repository/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak biltegi-ezarpenak bakarrik gorde behar ditu (Claude kodea konfigurazioa, IDE arau-fitxategiak, agenteen baimenaren katalogoak). Kodeen konbentzioek beste nonbait bizi behar dute. `tests/lint/repository/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover repository/ref shape rules. Broader `meta/services.yml` invariants live one level up in [`services/`](../)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek biltegiaren/refaren forma-arauak bakarrik gorde behar dituzte. Broader `meta/services.yml` aldaezinak maila bat gorago bizi dira [`services/`](../)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover role-folder and role-name conventions. Per-role structural rules (`meta/`, `tasks/`, `templates/`) MUST live under the sibling clusters [`meta/`](../meta/), [`when/`](../when/), or [`run_once/`](../run_once/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek rol-karpetak eta rol-izenen konbentzioak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. Egitura-arau perroloak (`meta/`, `tasks/`, `templates/`) Kumuluen azpian bizi behar du. [`meta/`](../meta/), [`when/`](../when/), edo [`run_once/`](../run_once/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover role-level structural rules (folder naming, role-name regex). `meta/main.yml` presence and field checks MUST live under [`meta/`](meta/). Dependency-graph checks (self-, circular, unnecessary dependencies, `run_after`) MUST live under [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (and the sibling [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/)). Application-specific role rules (web-app README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` usage, `application_id` identity) MUST live under [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`run_once/`](run_once/). Block-level `when:` hygiene (guard blocks, duplication, size) MUST live under [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target existence MUST live under [`includes/`](includes/). Compose- or handler-specific checks MUST live in their respective topical clusters."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek egitura-arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. (izen-abizenak, izen-abizenak). `meta/main.yml` presentzia eta eremu-kontrolak bizi behar dira [`meta/`](meta/). Mendekotasun-diagramen egiaztaketak (Auto-, zirkular, alferrikako mendekotasunak, `run_after`) Azpian bizi behar da [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (eta [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/))Aplikazioaren rol-arau espezifikoak (Web aplikazioa README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` erabilera, `application_id` Identitatea) Azpian bizi behar da [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` Banderaren bizi-zikloaren egiaztagiriek bizirik iraun behar dute [`run_once/`](run_once/). Bloke maila `when:` higienea (babes-blokeak, bikoizketa, tamaina) Azpian bizi behar da [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` helburu-izatearen azpian bizi behar da [`includes/`](includes/). Kontrol konposatzaileak edo kudeatzaileak beren gai-kumuluetan bizi behar dute."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about block-level `when:` semantics and guard-block shape. `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); rules about `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence MUST live under [`../includes/`](../includes/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek bloke-mailaren arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. `when:` Semantika eta babes-blokearen forma. `run_once_<role>` Banderaren bizi-zikloaren egiaztagiriek bizirik iraun behar dute [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); arauei buruz `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` helburu-izatearen azpian bizi behar da [`../includes/`](../includes/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about how playbooks invoke role groups and how the invokable-paths filter maps to stages. Tests for role-internal `meta/main.yml` MUST live under [`roles/meta/`](../../roles/meta/); tests for include/import target existence MUST live under [`roles/includes/`](../../roles/includes/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek joko-liburuek rol-taldeei nola deitzen dieten eta bideek nola iragazten dituzten mapak agertokietara. Rol-barneko probak `meta/main.yml` Azpian bizi behar da [`roles/meta/`](../../roles/meta/); helburuko probak bizi behar dira [`roles/includes/`](../../roles/includes/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about variable DEFINITION hygiene (uniqueness, naming, override prohibitions). Rules about variable USAGE in Jinja templates MUST live under [`jinja/`](../jinja/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak DEFINITION aldagarriaren higieneari buruzko arauak bakarrik estali behar ditu (bakartasuna, izendapena, gainjarri debekuak). Jinja txantiloietako USAGE aldagaiari buruzko arauak bizi behar dira [`jinja/`](../jinja/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover service-graph consistency rules."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek zerbitzu-grafoen koherentzia-arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover service-registry semantics. Tests for `application_id` identity MUST live under `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`, and generic role-structure rules MUST live under `tests/integration/roles/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek zerbitzu-erregistroen semantika bakarrik estali behar dute. Probak `application_id` Identitatea azpian bizi behar da `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`, eta rol-egituraren arau orokorrak bizi behar dira `tests/integration/roles/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover shell-invocation correctness inside Ansible tasks."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak shell-aren dei-zuzentasuna bakarrik estali behar dute ataza ansibleen barruan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover size/count thresholds on tracked files and folders. Naming, content, and dependency rules MUST live under their respective sibling clusters."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek tamaina/zenbakiak bakarrik estali behar dituzte jarraipeneko fitxategi eta karpetetan. Izen-emateak, edukiak eta mendekotasun-arauak beren antzeko kumuluen pean bizi behar dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover structural rules of `compose.yml.j2` and related compose artefacts. Tests for image versions, backups, or service-registry semantics MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek egiturazko arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. `compose.yml.j2` eta artefaktuak sortzen ditu. Irudi-bertsioak, babeskopiak edo zerbitzu-erregistroen semantikak beste nonbait bizi behar dira. `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover target-existence rules for `include_*` / `import_*` directives. Rules about the block-level `when:` wrapping those includes MUST live under [`../when/`](../when/); rules about `run_once_<role>` flag inclusion MUST live under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek helburu-existentziaren arauak bakarrik estali behar dituzte `include_*` / `import_*` zuzentarauak. Bloke mailari buruzko arauak `when:` biltzen dituztenek bizi behar dute [`../when/`](../when/); arauei buruz `run_once_<role>` Bandera sartzeak azpian bizi behar du [`../run_once/`](../run_once/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the `server.*` sub-tree of `meta/services.yml`. Other top-level invariants live in the sibling [`services/`](../services/) cluster."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako probak bakarrik estali behar dira `server.*` azpizuhaitza `meta/services.yml`. Maila goreneko beste aldaezin batzuk anaitasunean bizi dira [`services/`](../services/) klusterra."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the category hierarchy itself. Tests for `application_id` classification driven by `invokable_paths.py` MUST live under `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek kategoria-hierarkia bakarrik estali behar dute. Probak `application_id` sailkapenaren arabera `invokable_paths.py` Azpian bizi behar da `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the dashboard-scope contract. Playwright env-template / spec parity tests MUST live under [`playwright/`](../playwright/)."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek arbel-skopioaren kontratua bakarrik estali behar dute. Playwright env-template/spec parity probak bizi behar dira [`playwright/`](../playwright/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the four classifications of a single project-wide match stream: literal-app calls (`test_literal_paths.py`), variable-app calls with an existing literal path (`test_variable_paths.py`), `~`-concatenated path expressions (`test_wildcard_paths.py`), and the strict per-role pass for `lookup('config', application_id, …)` calls inside `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`). Pure unit coverage of the lookup plugin's return values MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek proiektu osoko korronte bakar baten lau sailkapenak bakarrik estali behar dituzte: (`test_literal_paths.py`), Aplikazio aldagarriak lehendik dagoen bide literalarekin deitzen du (`test_variable_paths.py`), `~`-bide-adierazpen kateatuak (`test_wildcard_paths.py`)eta per-roleko pasabide zorrotza `lookup('config', application_id, …)` barruan `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`). Bilaketa pluginaren itzulera-balioen unitate-estaldura hutsak azpian bizi behar du `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."

msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the pure-function behaviour of `utils.cert_utils` and `utils.tls_common`. Lookup-plugin integration that depends on these modules MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover variable definition / consumption checks. Four orthogonal scopes live here:"
msgstr "Direktorio honetako testek definizio aldakorrak eta kontsumo-kontrolak bakarrik estali behar dituzte. Lau eremu ortogonalak hemen bizi dira:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests patch collaborators on the submodule that uses them (e.g. ``deploy.cli._run_deploy``), not on this package."
msgstr "Adabaki-laguntzaileak probatzen ditu erabiltzen dituen azpimoduluan (Adibidez: ``deploy.cli._run_deploy``), Ez pakete honetan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests that MUST adjust `sys.path` or load fixtures before importing the module under test."
msgstr "Egokitu behar diren probak `sys.path` edo biltegiak kargatu modulua probapean inportatu aurretik."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests that enforce the `test_*.py` prefix convention and the rule that every `test_*.py` file lives under `tests/` and contains at least one runnable `unittest.TestCase`."
msgstr "Indartzen duten probak `test_*.py` aurrizkien konbentzioa eta arau bakoitza `test_*.py` fitxategiak bizi dira `tests/` eta gutxienez exekuzio bat dauka `unittest.TestCase`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests that only assert that a file contains a string, task name, variable name, or template fragment are not allowed."
msgstr "Fitxategi batek kate bat, zeregin-izena, izen aldakorra edo txantiloi-zati bat duela baieztatzen duten probak ez dira onartzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests that statically analyze Ansible config or task YAML files without exercising runtime boundaries MUST live under `tests/lint/ansible/` instead."
msgstr "Probak: ansible konfigurazioa edo ataza YAML fitxategiak aztertzen dituzte exekuzio-denboraren mugak erabili gabe. `tests/lint/ansible/` Horren ordez."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests that verify real runtime component interactions MUST live under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Denbora errealeko osagaien elkarreraginak egiaztatzen dituzten probak bizi behar dira `tests/integration/`."

