# libretranslate
msgid "The AT Protocol PDS, OAuth identity, and the login-broker sidecar pattern. atmo's \"sign in with Bluesky\" points here. The multi-entity `services.yml` (pds/web/view/broker/api) is the template for atmo's appview + worker-runtime split."
msgstr "AT Protocol PDS, OAuth-en identitatea eta saio-hasiera-broker sidecar eredua. atmo's \"sinatu honekin Bluesky\" Puntuak hemen. Aniztasuna `services.yml` (pds/web/view/broker/api) Atmo-ren aplikazio-txantiloia + langile-denbora zatitzea da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The AT→AP direction has a clean trigger (firehose) and a clean sink (GraphQL). The reverse direction needs an AT identity to write records as, which is unresolved."
msgstr "AT→AP norabideak abiarazle garbia du (firehose) eta harraska garbi bat (GraphQL)Alderantzizko noranzkoak AT identitate bat behar du erregistroak idazteko, ebatzi gabe dagoen moduan."

# libretranslate
msgid "The AUR PKGBUILDs this project consumes carry a checksum on a git source, which makepkg can only reject; integrity rests on the pinned upstream tag fetched over HTTPS."
msgstr "AUR PKGBUILDek proiektu honek git iturburuko kontrol-batur bat eramaten du, eta horrek makillajeak uko egin besterik ezin du egin; osotasuna HTTPS bidez eskuratutako korronte-etiketan dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "The AUR is one origin host with no mirror pool behind it, so a flap there lasts minutes rather than the seconds a pool member needs to rotate out; EXTERNAL_FETCH's ~40s window has been observed losing to a single flap."
msgstr "AUR jatorri bakarreko ostalari bat da, ispilurik ez duena atzean, beraz, txilinak minutuak irauten ditu igerilekuko kide batek bira eman behar dituen segundoak baino; EXTERNAL_FETCH~40Leihoa flap bakar batean galtzen ikusi da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Ansible-level `plugins/` directory (filters, lookups, modules) is a different concept from the application-level `addons` topic. See the [plugins README](../../../../../plugins/README.md) for the distinction."
msgstr "Ansible maila `plugins/` direktorioa (iragazkiak, bilaketak, moduluak) Aplikazio-mailaren beste kontzeptu bat da `addons` gaia. Ikusi [Pluginak README](../../../../../plugins/README.md) bereizketagatik."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Argos package index behind LibreTranslate offers 49 languages paired with English. 47 of them are ISO 639-1 codes; `pb` (Brazilian Portuguese) and `zt` (Traditional Chinese) are not and are out of scope. The remaining ISO languages have no model."
msgstr "Argos paketearen indizea atzean LibreTranslate eskaintzak 49 Hizkuntza ingelesarekin batera. 47 Horietatik ISO dira 639-1 kodeak; `pb` (Brasilgo portugesa) eta `zt` (Txinatar tradizionala) Ez daude eta ez daude. Gainerako ISO hizkuntzek ez dute modelorik."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Bash auto-allow path trusts the OS sandbox to confine commands. A missing or broken sandbox backend would cause auto-allow to approve unconfined commands."
msgstr "Bash auto-allow bideak OS harea-kutxaz fidatzen da komandoz mugatzeko. Hondatutako edo falta den sandbox motor batek auto-baimenik gabeko komandoak onartzea eragingo luke."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Building Blocks 🧱"
msgstr "Eraikuntza-blokeak 🧱"

# libretranslate
msgid "The CA override that bind-mounts ``CA_TRUST.inject_cert_container`` is emitted under three conditions, and anything that reads the mounted file must ask the same three or it will point at a path that was never mounted. The conditions lived as four hand-copied expressions - both `sys-svc-compose` handlers, `sys-svc-compose-ca/vars/main.yml` and the msmtp template - which is one copy per place that can drift."
msgstr "CAk gainditu egin du mendi lotuak ``CA_TRUST.inject_cert_container`` Hiru baldintzatan igortzen da, eta muntatutako fitxategia irakurtzen duen edozerk hiru gauza bera eskatu behar du, edo inoiz muntatu ez den bidea seinalatuko du. Baldintzak lau eskutako adierazpen gisa bizi ziren - biak `sys-svc-compose` kudeatzaileak, `sys-svc-compose-ca/vars/main.yml` eta msmtp txantiloia, leku batetik bestera joan daitekeen kopia bat."

# libretranslate
msgid "The CI deploy matrix turns the role catalogue into deploy jobs. Each row is one `role#variant` selection, and each row must state everything that makes its deployment reproducible, because a red job is only useful if an operator can replay exactly it."
msgstr "CI hedapenaren matrizeak funtzioen katalogoa zabaldu egiten du. Errenkada bakoitza bat da `role#variant` Hautaketa, eta errenkada bakoitzak bere hedapena aldagarri egiten duen guztia adierazi behar du, lan gorri bat soilik erabilgarria baita eragile batek zuzen jokatu ahal badu."

