msgstr "CLI sarrera-puntua bizi da hemen [main .py](lint/__main__.py), hortik deituta [lint.sh](../../scripts/install/lint.sh) bezala `python3 -m utils.install.lint`. [wrapper.sh](../../scripts/install/wrapper.sh) Ibilbideak `make install-lint` ostalaria vs edukiontzia oinarri hartuta `INFINITO_LINT_RUNNER`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The CLI entry point lives at ``cli.meta.env`` (`python -m cli.meta.env` or `make dotenv`). It reads the committed ``default.env``, layers runtime context on top (distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived sizes, sha256 secrets, repo owner/name resolution), and writes the resulting ``.env`` to the repo root."
msgstr "CLI sarrera-puntua bizi da hemen ``cli.meta.env`` (`python -m cli.meta.env` edo `make dotenv`). Konpromisoa irakurtzen du ``default.env``, geruzak exekuzio-denboraren testuingurua goian (distro, GHA/Act banderak, df/meminfo-derived tamainak, sha256 sekretuak, repo jabea/izena bereizmena)eta emaitza idazten du ``.env`` repo errora."

