# libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe site-setup wizard is **bypassed** on first deploy via auto-bootstrap: `bench new-site` with `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` arguments, plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus a post-start API call from the role's `tasks/` to mark the wizard as completed (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). A fresh deploy lands directly on the ERPNext desk."
msgstr "Frappe-setup morroia da **bypassed** hasieran, auto-botottrap bidez: `bench new-site` honekin: `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` argumentuak, gehi `bench install-app erpnext`, gehi hasiera-ondoko bat API Rolaren deia `tasks/` aztia amaituta bezala markatzeko (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`)Lur berri bat zuzenean gainean ERPNext Mahaia."

# libretranslate
