# libretranslate
msgid "The Root CA private key is generated **unencrypted** (automation-friendly). Protect file permissions."
msgstr "Root CA gako pribatua sortzen da **enkriptatu gabe** (Automatika). Babestu fitxategien baimenak."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT declaration with the scope's override merged over it."
msgstr "SPOTen deklarazioak, esparruaren gainjarriarekin, bat egin zuen."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, next to ``modes``: both state what the role CAN do, which is why the deploy matrix narrows a row by them. ``meta/tests.yml`` is the other kind of statement - what CI should skip exercising - and an image that exists for one architecture only is not a testing preference."
msgstr "SPOT da ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, ondoan ``modes``-Biek zer egin dezaketen adierazten dute, eta, horregatik, hedapenaren matrizeak errenkada bat estutzen du. ``meta/tests.yml`` Beste adierazpen mota bat da, CIk ariketa egin beharko lukeena, eta arkitektura baterako existitzen den irudia ez da proba-hobespen bat."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. A missing ``modes`` block, a missing ``<mode>`` entry, or a missing ``enabled`` key all mean the role participates in that mode (default ``True``)."
msgstr "SPOT da ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. Falta den bat ``modes`` blokea, falta den bat ``<mode>`` sarrera edo falta bat ``enabled`` gakoa da rolak modu horretan parte hartzen duela. (lehenetsia ``True``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is parsed with a plain-string line parser instead of PyYAML: the env build runs during bootstrap (make install-system-python) before any Python dependency exists, so this module must stay stdlib-only. Only plain ``KEY: \"value\"`` entries can be read this way; a Jinja expression or a missing key is a hard error."
msgstr "SPOT marra-analizatzaile batekin analizatua dago PyYAMLren ordez: env-a bottrap-ean exekutatzen da. (egin install-system-python) Python-en mendekotasunik egon baino lehen, modulu honek estdlib-only egon behar du. Soilik argia ``KEY: \"value\"`` Sarrerak honela irakur daitezke: Jinja adierazpena edo falta den gakoa errore gogorra da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSE session travels through the shared Redis channel layer, so the stream and the message POST may land on different replicas."
msgstr "SSE saioak elkarrekin bidaiatzen du Redis kanal-geruza, korrontea eta POST mezua erreplika ezberdinetan jar daitezke."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (``sociallogin``) and LDAP (``user_ldap``) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (``sociallogin``) eta LDAP (``user_ldap``) Saio-hasierako azalak OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs-ek estaltzen ditu (Baldintzak 017/018)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (`sociallogin`) and LDAP (`user_ldap`) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (`sociallogin`) eta LDAP (`user_ldap`) Saio-hasierako azalak OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs-ek estaltzen ditu (Baldintzak 017/018)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO back-channel pin, added automatically. On an onion deployment the OIDC endpoints handed to an application are public ``.onion`` authorities. That is right for the browser, which reaches them through Tor, but unroutable for the application's own server-side calls (code-to-token exchange, JWKS, userinfo): a container resolves ``.onion`` through Tor's resolver, not through DNS. Pinning the provider to a reachable address sends those calls over the local network to the proxy that already serves the vhost. Skipped unless the application has SSO enabled and the provider vhost is an ``.onion`` name, so it is a no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "SSO atzeko kanaleko pina automatikoki gehitu zen. Onio-hedapen batean, aplikazio bati emandako OIDC puntuak publikoak dira. ``.onion`` agintariak. Zuzena da Torren bidez iristen den arakatzailearentzat, baina ezin da aplikazioaren zerbitzari-deietarako erabili. (kode-token trukea, JWKS, userinfo): edukiontzi batek ebazten du ``.onion`` Torren erabakitzailearen bidez, ez DNS bidez. Hornitzailea helbide irisgarri batera eramateak dei horiek sare lokaletik bidaltzen dizkio ostalariari zerbitzatzen dion proxyari. Saltatuta aplikazioak SSO gaitu ezean eta hornitzailearen vhost-a ez bada ``.onion`` Izena, beraz, ez da batere argia."

# libretranslate
