msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` pins for *tool*."
msgstr "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` orratzak *tresna*."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` an installer should fetch for *tool*."
msgstr "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` instalatzaileak bila dezala *tresna*."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``API`` mapping as declared in the group_vars SPOT."
msgstr "The ``API`` mapatzea, adierazi bezala group_vars SPOT."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` fallback declared in ``default.env``."
msgstr "The ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` Atzerapena deklaratuta ``default.env``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``Options`` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "The ``Options`` araua da NFSren babeseko bolumenak dituen ostalari-multzo bat bizirik mantentzen duena (Ikusi `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): horrelako bolumena fitxategi-sistema bereizia da, beraz, datuen erroaren argazki batek direktorio huts gisa hartuko luke eta babeskopiak ez luke ezer edukiko. Deklarazioa ez da muntatze-mahaia, docker-ek bolumenak lazily muntatzen dituelako eta azken edukiontzia gelditzen denean desmuntatzen dituelako."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "The ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` aldagaiak paketeen instalazioko zereginak hautatzen ditu (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux edo Fedora/EL). Eginkizuna gidatzen du ``make runner-ci-deploy`` helburua; ikus beheko amaierako gida."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is **not** blocked: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The ``biber`` persona is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and ``biber`` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."
msgstr "The ``administrator`` persona da **ez** blokeatuta: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ hazi natiboak OpenProject kontua zeinaren pasahitza den Keycloak administratzaileak sekretuan gordetzen du bidaia aldaki guztietan. The ``biber`` persona blokeatuta dago bakarrik ``sso: false`` aldagarriak - OpenProject administratzailearekin bakarrik hazi da, eta ``biber`` oauth-aren bidez bakarrik aurreikusia dago2-proxy-header zubia LDAPeko auth-iturburura, aldaki horiek kentzen dituztenak. Bi banderak esplizituki adierazten dira `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` provisions proxied identities with ``create_user(...)`` and no ``is_staff`` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "The ``administrator`` Pertsona ere blokeatuta dago, rol horrek ez baitu inoiz sortzen. BookWyrm Langileen kontua. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` xedapenak, identitate hurbilak eta ``create_user(...)`` eta ez ``is_staff`` bandera, eta ez dago zereginik existitzen den kontu bat sustatzeko, beraz, administratzaileak ez duen kide arrunt bat da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked because Decidim’s admin is a Devise account seeded by ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role’s Playwright env therefore exposes ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` and no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "The ``administrator`` pertsona blokeatuta dagoelako Decidimadmin Devise kontu bat da, honek sortua ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` eta seinaleak posta elektronikoz bidali. Rolaren Playwright env-ak agerian uzten du ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` eta ez ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, Hau da administratzailearen laguntzaile partekatuak irakurtzen duen aldagaia."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` via ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, whose identifier is the ORM ``username`` rather than the e-mail Baserow’s own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "The ``administrator`` persona blokeatuta dago SSO kanpoan dagoen bitartean. Konfigurazio horretan ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` Faltsua da, beraz, zubi fidagarria ez da aktiboa eta kontua Django supererabiltzailea da. ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` bidez ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, identifikatzailea ORM da ``username`` Posta elektronikoa baino BaserowIzen-emate propioa eskatzen du. SSOrekin, goiburuko zubiak saioa hornitzen du eta pertsona exekutatzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` and ``administrator`` Playwright personas are gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. When SSO is off, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. Two reasons:"
msgstr "The ``biber`` eta ``administrator`` Playwright-eko pertsonak lotuta daude ``services.sso.enabled``. SSO kanpoan dagoenean, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``Bi arrazoi:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim’s sign-out is a ``data-method`` link inside the account dropdown, so the role’s own tests navigate to ``/users/sign_out`` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "The ``biber`` pertsona OIDCn sartzen da arazorik gabe; ezin du saioa amaitu. Decidimen zeinua a da ``data-method`` kontuarekin lotura behera, beraz, rol-probak joan egiten dira. ``/users/sign_out`` Botoi batean klik egin ordez, laguntzaile partekatuak aurkituko du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``context_agent`` and ``contextagentmcp`` services in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "The ``context_agent`` eta ``contextagentmcp`` zerbitzuak ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` testuingurua, gaitasun guztiak jaitsita bakarrik irakurria, eta MCPren amaierako puntuko bezero bakarrak ematen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``dashboard`` service in ``meta/services.yml`` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG’s canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role’s contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "The ``dashboard`` zerbitzua ``meta/services.yml`` kontsumitzaileen fitxa bat besterik ez da. MIGDomeinu kanonikoa da; ez du ostalaririk. MIG. Rolaren kontratua erabat betetzen du eskuragarritasunak, domeinu kanonikoak eta eduki motak. ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, gehi pertsona gonbidatua. Pertsona orokorren bide-izena autentifikatua da MIG Gora doan gainazalak ez dauka."

