# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `administrator` persona MUST drive at least one admin-only interaction (admin panel toggle, realm settings change, user-management surface, …). Specs supply this via the `adminInteraction` callback on `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` under the same \"no generic default\" rule."
msgstr "The `administrator` pertsona batek gutxienez administratzaile bakarreko elkarreragina gidatu behar du (admin panelaren txandakatzea, domeinuaren ezarpenak aldatu egiten dira, erabiltzailearen kudeaketaren azalera,...). Specsek hau hornitzen du honen bidez: `adminInteraction` atzeradeia `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` berdinaren azpian \"lehenetsi orokorrik ez\" araua."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is **not** blocked: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The `biber` persona is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and `biber` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."
msgstr "The `administrator` persona da **ez** blokeatuta: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) hazi natiboak OpenProject kontua zeinaren pasahitza den Keycloak administratzaileak sekretuan gordetzen du bidaia aldaki guztietan. The `biber` persona blokeatuta dago bakarrik `sso: false` aldagarriak - OpenProject administratzailearekin bakarrik hazi da, eta `biber` oauth-aren bidez bakarrik aurreikusia dago2-proxy-header zubia LDAPeko auth-iturburura, aldaki horiek kentzen dituztenak. Bi banderak esplizituki adierazten dira [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. `files/sso/header_auth.py` provisions proxied identities with `create_user(...)` and no `is_staff` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "The `administrator` Pertsona ere blokeatuta dago, rol horrek ez baitu inoiz sortzen. BookWyrm Langileen kontua. `files/sso/header_auth.py` xedapenak, identitate hurbilak eta `create_user(...)` eta ez `is_staff` bandera, eta ez dago zereginik existitzen den kontu bat sustatzeko, beraz, administratzaileak ez duen kide arrunt bat da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked because Decidim's admin is a Devise account seeded by `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role's Playwright env therefore exposes `ADMIN_EMAIL` and no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "The `administrator` pertsona blokeatuta dagoelako Decidimadmin Devise kontu bat da, honek sortua `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` eta seinaleak posta elektronikoz bidali. Rolaren Playwright env-ak agerian uzten du `ADMIN_EMAIL` eta ez `ADMIN_USERNAME`, Hau da administratzailearen laguntzaile partekatuak irakurtzen duen aldagaia."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` via `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, whose identifier is the ORM `username` rather than the e-mail Baserow's own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "The `administrator` persona blokeatuta dago SSO kanpoan dagoen bitartean. Konfigurazio horretan `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` Faltsua da, beraz, zubi fidagarria ez da aktiboa eta kontua Django supererabiltzailea da. `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` bidez `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, identifikatzailea ORM da `username` Posta elektronikoa baino Baserow-Bai. SSOrekin, goiburuko zubiak saioa hornitzen du eta pertsona exekutatzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `all` mode honors a per-interpreter stamp at `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (the suffix is the first 8 chars of `sha256(sys.executable)`, so host and container track independently even though `build/` is bind-mounted). Stamp dependencies are [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) and [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Group-targeted invocations always run and never touch the stamp."
msgstr "The `all` Moduak interpretatzailearen zigilu bat ohoratzen du `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (atzizkia lehena da 8 karaktere `sha256(sys.executable)`, Hala ere, ostalariak eta edukiontziak modu independentean jarraitzen dute, nahiz eta `build/` lotuta dago)Estanparen mendekotasunak dira [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) eta [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Talde-deiak beti egiten dira eta ez dute zigilua ukitzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `applications` lookup is the ONLY supported runtime entry point for merged application configuration."
msgstr "The `applications` Bilaketa aplikazio-konfigurazio bateratuaren exekuzio-denboraren sarrera-puntua da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `ask` rules on `docker run*` / `docker build*` / `docker push*` / `docker login*` only catch the outermost invocation. Because the project uses Docker-in-Docker (for example `docker exec <helper-container> docker run ...`), a `docker run` invoked inside an exec'd helper container bypasses the ask-gate. The helper container has its own Docker daemon or a bind-mounted host socket, so the inner `docker run` executes directly."
msgstr "The `ask` arauak `docker run*` / `docker build*` / `docker push*` / `docker login*` Kanpoko deirik berriena bakarrik hartu. Proiektuak Docker-in-Docker erabiltzen duelako (adibidez `docker exec <helper-container> docker run ...`), a `docker run` Exekutatzen duen edukiontzi laguntzaile baten barruan dei egiten du. Laguntza-edukiontziak Docker daemon-a edo ostalari-hargune lotu bat du, beraz, barnekoa `docker run` Zuzenean exekutatzen du."

