msgid "The `rbac_group_path` lookup plugin is the only sanctioned producer of OIDC group paths in this repository. Tests in this directory MUST cover invariants that protect that contract: callsite shape, role declaration consistency, and the ban on inline `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` constructions introduced by requirement 005."
msgstr "The `rbac_group_path` Bilaketa-plugina OIDC taldearen bide-izenen ekoizle zigortu bakarra da biltegi honetan. Direktorio honetako testek kontratu hori babesten duten aldaezinak estali behar dituzte: dei-forma, rol-adierazpenaren koherentzia eta lineako debekua. `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` baldintzapean sartutako eraikuntzak 005."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `redirect_uris` lookup generates `https://<domain>/*` per SSO consumer, which covers the UI and API callbacks but not a localhost one. Machine access goes through AppRole (Decision #2) instead. Documented as a limitation in the README."
msgstr "The `redirect_uris` bilaketak sortzen ditu `https://<domain>/*` SSO kontsumitzailearentzat, UIa estaltzen duena eta API atzeradeiak, baina ez ostalari lokal bat. Makina-sarbidea AppRole-tik igarotzen da (Erabakia2) Horren ordez. READMEren muga gisa dokumentatua."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` flag is retained as belt-and-suspenders. If `Bash(*)` were ever removed, the sandbox auto-allow would still cover the common shapes, but it is no longer the primary gate."
msgstr "The `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` bandera gerriko eta esekitzaile gisa mantentzen da. Baldin eta `Bash(*)` inoiz kenduak izan ziren, harea-kutxak berak ere forma arruntak estaltzen zituen, baina jadanik ez da ate nagusia."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.network` block governs outbound and local connectivity from inside the sandbox."
msgstr "The `sandbox.network` Blokeak kanpoko eta tokiko konektibitatea gobernatzen du harea-kutxaren barrutik."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `scripts/` tree MUST contain executable shell entry points and shell helper files only."
msgstr "The `scripts/` Zuhaitzak shell-aren sarrera-puntu exekutagarriak eta shell-aren laguntza-fitxategiak bakarrik eduki behar ditu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `security-codeql` job runs the CodeQL scan (catalogued in the `Security and linting` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)). A failing scan MUST fail `code-quality-gate` and thereby block all downstream deploy, install, and environment tests."
msgstr "The `security-codeql` lanak CodeQL eskaneatzen du (Katalogoan `Security and linting` taula [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md))Huts egindako eskaneatze batek huts egin behar du `code-quality-gate` eta, horrela, behera doan guztia zabaldu, instalatu eta ingurune-probak blokeatu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-front-inj-logout` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application's HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "The `sys-front-inj-logout` Funtzio ansibleak automatikoki kapsulatzen du JavaScript mozkin arin bat zure web aplikazioaren HTML erantzunetan. Script honek logout estekak, botoiak, formak eta beste elementu batzuk identifikatzen ditu, helburuko URLak gainidazten ditu, eta erabiltzaileak OIDCren amaierako puntu zentral batera birbideratzen direla ziurtatzen du, seinaleztapen-esperientzia bakarra eskainiz."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail-smtp` role configures a **local SMTP relay** using [Postfix](https://www.postfix.org/), listening exclusively on `localhost`.   It is designed to be used as a fallback when no central Mailu instance is available, enabling applications and system services to send email via `localhost:25` without additional configuration."
msgstr "The `sys-svc-mail-smtp` rolak a konfiguratzen du **SMTP errelebo lokala** erabiltzea [Postfix](https://www.postfix.org/), bakarrik entzuten `localhost`. Erorketa gisa erabiltzeko diseinatuta dago, zentralik ez dagoenean. Mailu instantzia erabilgarri dago, aplikazio eta sistemako zerbitzuak posta bidaltzeko aukera ematen du `localhost:25` konfigurazio gehigarririk gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail` role acts as the **central mail orchestration layer** in the Infinito.Nexus stack.   It wires together:"
msgstr "The `sys-svc-mail` rolak bezala jokatzen du **erdiko posta orkestrazio-geruza** barruan Infinito.Nexus pila. Elkarrekin kableatzen du:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-cli` framework runs `files/test/test.sh` sourcing variables from `templates/test.env.j2` after each deploy cycle. Check both the deploy output and the CLI test output before declaring a fix complete."
msgstr "The `test-e2e-cli` framework-ak `files/test/test.sh` aldagaiak sourcing-etik `templates/test.env.j2` ziklo bakoitzaren ondoren. Egiaztatu irteera eta CLI probako irteera, konponketa burutu aurretik."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-playwright` role MUST stage `files/playwright/` recursively (so `addons/` is included) and discover specs recursively."
msgstr "The `test-e2e-playwright` Funtzioa landu behar da `files/playwright/` errekurtsiboki (beraz, `addons/` sartuta dago) eta aurkitu zehaztapenak errekurtsiboki."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-playwright` role discovers Playwright-enabled roles through the presence of `templates/playwright.env.j2`. For each discovered role it:"
msgstr "The `test-e2e-playwright` Rolak Playwright-en rolak aurkitzen ditu, presentziaren bidez `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Aurkitutako rol bakoitzeko:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The `test-workspace` stage runs the workspace workflow listed in the `Infrastructure tests` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "The `test-workspace` fasean laneko arearen fluxua exekutatzen du. `Infrastructure tests` taula [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `test` job runs [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` fans the unit, integration, lint and external suites out in parallel on the runner host. It MUST pass `code-quality-gate`."
msgstr "The `test` lan-jarraibideak [Deitu...test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` Taldea, integrazioa, lint-a eta kanpoko suiteak paraleloan ateratzen dira korrikalariaren ostalarian. Pasa behar du `code-quality-gate`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `tor` input decides what the onion axis is allowed to do at all:"
msgstr "The `tor` Sarrerak erabakitzen du zer egin daitekeen tipularen ardatzean:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The `users` lookup is the ONLY supported runtime entry point for merged user configuration."
msgstr "The `users` Bilaketa erabiltzaile-konfigurazio bateratuaren exekuzio-denboraren sarrera-puntua da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `utils/` tree MUST contain Python helper modules and helper packages only."
msgstr "The `utils/` Zuhaitzak Python laguntza-moduluak eta paketeak bakarrik eduki behar ditu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `vars/main.yml` of the role MUST define the variables referenced in `args:` by reading them from `meta/services.yml` through the `lookup('config', ...)` filter. This keeps `meta/services.yml` as the single source of truth."
msgstr "The `vars/main.yml` Rolaren arabera definitu behar dira aipatutako aldagaiak. `args:` irakurriz `meta/services.yml` bidez `lookup('config', ...)` iragazkia. Honek mantentzen du `meta/services.yml` Egiaren iturri bakarra bezala."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `version:` MUST stay pinned to an exact Playwright version and distro pair such as `v1.59.1-noble`. You MUST NOT switch this to a mutable tag such as `latest`, because mutable upstream tags are more vulnerable to CDN propagation delays and make flaky CI failures much harder to reason about."
msgstr "The `version:` Playwright-en bertsio zehatz bati itsatsi behar zaio eta distro bikoteari, adibidez `v1.59.1-noble`. Ezin duzu hau etiketa aldagarri batera aldatu, adibidez `latest`, CDN hedapenaren atzerapenak ahulagoak direlako eta CIren hutsegiteak askoz zailagoak direlako arrazoitzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `🛡️ Trusted` label flips the build source to the PR head and unlocks the Docker Hub credentials; without it the safe base merge ref is built with no organization secrets. Restrict who may set the label via repository label permissions / branch protection so only maintainers can grant it."
msgstr "The `🛡️ Trusted` etiketak eraikuntza-iturburua PR burura irauli eta Docker Hub-en kredentzialak desblokeatzen ditu; hori gabe oinarri-konbinazio segurua eraikitzen da erakunde-sekreturik gabe. Murriztu nork ezar dezakeen etiketa biltegiaren etiketa-baimenaren edo adar-babesaren bidez, mantentzaileek bakarrik eman ahal izateko."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `🧩 Subset` label must exist in the repository's label set and is applied through the PR labels UI. Both the `pull_request` and `pull_request_target` events carry a `labeled` trigger, so adding it starts a fresh run."
msgstr "The `🧩 Subset` Etiketa biltegiaren etiketa-multzoan egon behar du, eta PR etiketen bidez aplikatu behar da. Biak ala biak `pull_request` eta `pull_request_target` gertakariek eramaten dute `labeled` abiarazle, beraz, gehitu eta lasterbide berri bat hasten da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The access token paired with `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`."
msgstr "Sarbide-tokena parekatuta `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The action masks its own result: the fact is the whole rendered tree with every application's credentials, so it never reaches a log regardless of `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`."
msgstr "Ekintzak bere emaitza maskaratzen du: kontua da errendatutako zuhaitz osoa aplikazio bakoitzaren kredentzialekin, beraz, ez da egunkari batera iristen, edozein dela ere. `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The active window has a default retention of 7 entries. A higher count is fine for short bursts of releases, but the active changelog SHOULD stay short enough that scrolling it is cheap."
msgstr "Leiho aktiboak atxikitze lehenetsia du 7 sarrerak. Goi-kontaketa ona da argitalpen-sorta laburretarako, baina aldaketa aktiboa behar bezain laburra izan behar du korritzea merkea izateko."

# libretranslate
msgid "The actual app deploy runs inside a **sealed throwaway Docker daemon** and is torn down on exit, so the host's own stack is never touched. Several runners can share one host (or coexist with other workloads) safely."
msgstr "Benetako aplikazioa exekutatzen da barruan **Docker daemon-a itxita** eta irteeran behera botatzen da, beraz, ostalariaren pila ez da inoiz ukitzen. Hainbat korrikalarik ostalari bat parteka dezakete (edo beste lan-karga batzuekin batera bizi.) Seguru."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter `digest` pins nothing today. All ten `implementation: adapter` roles carry the identical placeholder `sha256:` followed by sixty-four zeros, the schema only checks that prefix, and nothing outside the tests reads the field: the running image is resolved through `lookup('container_image', …)` from `services.mcp-adapter.image`. The immutable-source guarantee is therefore declared and not in force, so a lint that rejects a placeholder digest MUST land together with real digests rather than before them."
msgstr "Moldatzailea `digest` Gaur ez dago ezer. Hamarrak `implementation: adapter` rolek leku-marka berbera daramate `sha256:` ondoren hirurogei eta lau zero, eskemak aurrizki hori bakarrik egiaztatzen du, eta probatik kanpo ez dago ezer eremua irakurtzen duena: exekutatzen ari den irudia konpontzen da. `lookup('container_image', …)` - `services.mcp-adapter.image`. Beraz, iturri aldaezinen bermea deklaratu egiten da eta ez da indarrean, beraz, leku-marka bat baztertzen duen lint batek digestio errealarekin batera lur hartu behar du aurretik baino."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Moldatzailea da muga hori. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) bederatzi irakurketa-tresnak izendatzen ditu `calendar`, `contacts` eta `files` -Goian dauden hiru kategoriak `is_available` baldintzagabekoa da, beraz, multzoa ez da aldatzen aukerako aplikazioen hedapena. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` zerrenda horretatik kanpoko edozein tresnari uko egiten dio eta markatutako edozein tresnari `mutating` bitartean `mutating_tools_enabled` faltsua da, eta uko egiten dio kontratuari hasiera emateari. `schema_sha256` Ez dator bat fitxategiarekin. Errefusa albo-autoan gertatzen da, beraz, bezero bakoitzak lokalki ematen duena kontuan hartu gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Moldatzailea da muga hori. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` Ez dator bat fitxategiarekin. Errefusa albo-autoan gertatzen da, beraz, bezero bakoitzak lokalki ematen duena kontuan hartu gabe."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter presents `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` to the provider in the header named by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (default `Authorization`), formatted by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (default `Bearer {key}`, where `{key}` is the credential)."
msgstr "Egokitzaileak aurkezten du `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` goiburuko hornitzaileari, honek izendatuta `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (lehenetsia `Authorization`), formateatuta `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (lehenetsia `Bearer {key}`, Non `{key}` kredentziala da)."

