msgstr "Administratzailea atzean dago Keycloak"

# libretranslate
msgid "The admin assertion MUST additionally prove admin authorisation (admin panel, management menu, \"Users\" / \"Settings\" / \"Administration\" link visible in the DOM). A scenario that lands on the same surface as `biber` and stops there MUST NOT claim admin coverage."
msgstr "Administratzailearen baieztapenak administratzailearen baimena ere frogatu behar du. (admin panela, kudeaketa menua, \"Users\" / \"Settings\" / \"Administration\" DOMeko esteka ikusgai). Eszena bat, azalera berean agertzen dena `biber` eta han gelditu behar dira, ez dute administratzailearen estaldura eskatu behar."

# libretranslate
msgid "The administrator is provisioned as an `XWiki.XWikiUsers` object without a `password` property (see [`templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`](./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2)), and every privileged operation of the role authenticates as the built-in `superadmin` with `credentials.superadminpassword`. Neither credential is the Keycloak secret the shared persona helpers submit, and `biber` has no XWiki user page at all — only the administrator page is created ([`tasks/03_administrator.yml`](./tasks/03_administrator.yml)) — while the OIDC group mapping stays commented out in [`templates/xwiki.properties.j2`](./templates/xwiki.properties.j2). [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The Keycloak coupling is instead proven through XWiki's own login action by the addon spec [`files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`](./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js)."
msgstr "Administratzailea hornitzen da `XWiki.XWikiUsers` objekturik gabe `password` jabetza (Ikusi [`templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`](./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2))eta paperaren eragiketa pribilegiatu oro barneratu gisa identifikatzen da `superadmin` honekin: `credentials.superadminpassword`. Ez da kredentziala ere Keycloak pertsona laguntzaile partekatuak bidaltzen ditu, eta `biber` ez du XWiki erabiltzailearen orria sortu da soilik administratzailearen orria ([`tasks/03_administrator.yml`](./tasks/03_administrator.yml)) -OIDC taldearen mapaketa iruzkinduta dagoen bitartean [`templates/xwiki.properties.j2`](./templates/xwiki.properties.j2). [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) beraz, `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The Keycloak Akoplamendua frogatuta dago, ordea. XWikiaddon spec-ek bere saioa hasteko ekintza [`files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`](./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js)."

