# libretranslate
msgid "The behaviour is fail-loud by design. Missing or mistyped secret names MUST surface as a failed workflow run rather than as a PR with an unintended author."
msgstr "Diseinuak huts egiten du. Izen ezkutuak falta edo gaizki idatziak, huts egindako lan-fluxu gisa azaleratu behar dira, eta ez autore arretagabe baten PR gisa."

# libretranslate
msgid "The branch MUST exist and MUST NOT be checked out anywhere else; resolve a collision with `make worktree-prune` or `make worktree-down` first. Pass `base=<dir>` only when the operator names a different parent directory, and then repeat that same `base=` in every later `make worktree-down` call."
msgstr "Adar hori existitu behar da eta ez da beste inon aztertu behar. `make worktree-prune` edo `make worktree-down` Lehenik. Pasatu `base=<dir>` operadoreak beste direktorio guraso bat izendatzen duenean bakarrik, eta ondoren errepikatu gauza bera. `base=` gero `make worktree-down` Deitu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The branch prefix MUST match the detected scope, otherwise the `validate-pr-branch-prefix` job fails."
msgstr "Adar-aurrizkia detektatutako esparruarekin bat dator, bestela `validate-pr-branch-prefix` Lanak huts egiten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The branch prefix MUST match the type of change. The [PR workflow](pull-request.md) uses it to classify the scope and decide which CI pipeline to run."
msgstr "Adar-aurrizkia aldaketa motarekin bat dator. The [PR lan-fluxua](pull-request.md) esparrua sailkatzeko erabiltzen du eta zein hodi exekutatu erabakitzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "The branch-name matcher normally also requires the run's head repository to be the pull request's own. Two cases relax that: a run whose `head_repository` the API omits, and a pull request whose head fork has been deleted, where the event payload carries no head repository either. Both are matched on the branch name alone, because otherwise their runs would keep going forever — and neither field is something a contributor can influence. The ambiguity check above is what makes that safe: it runs whenever a head branch is known, with or without a repository, so a shared branch name still disables the matcher rather than cancelling the wrong pull request."
msgstr "Adar-izenen parekatzeak normalean exekuzioaren buruaren biltegia behar du tira-eskaeraren jabea izateko. Bi kasuk lasaitu egiten dute: `head_repository` eta API Ezeztatu, eta tira-eskaera bat, zeinaren sardexka ezabatua izan den, non gertaeren kargak ez duen biltegirik. Biak bat datoz adar-izenean bakarrik, bestela, beren ibilerak betiko joango lirateke eta eremu bakar batek ere ez du eraginik izango. Goiko anbiguotasun-kontrolak segurua egiten du: buru-adar bat ezagutzen den bakoitzean exekutatzen da, biltegi batekin edo gabe, beraz, adar-izen partekatu batek parekatzea desgaitzen du, okerreko tira-eskaera bertan behera utzi ordez."

# libretranslate
msgid "The bridge activates only when `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` is truthy (derived from `lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')`); otherwise the middleware is a transparent pass-through and the native password form still guards `/admin`."
msgstr "Zubia aktibatzen denean bakarrik `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` egia da (deribatua `lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')`); bestela, erdi-lana pasabide gardena da, eta jatorrizko pasahitzaren formak oraindik gordetzen du. `/admin`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The bridge activates only when ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is truthy (derived from ``lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')``); otherwise the middleware is a transparent pass-through and the native password form still guards ``/admin``."
msgstr "Zubia aktibatzen denean bakarrik ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` egia da (deribatua ``lookup('sso', application_id, 'is_proxy_gated')``); bestela, erdi-lana pasabide gardena da, eta jatorrizko pasahitzaren formak oraindik gordetzen du. ``/admin``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The bridge declaration is one-directional metadata (this role depends on that service). It MUST NOT be used to auto-enable the other role; enablement stays driven by group membership and the existing `run_after` ordering."
msgstr "Zubiaren deklarazioa norabide bakarreko metadatuak dira (funtzio hau zerbitzu horren araberakoa da). Ez da erabili behar beste papera automatikoki onartzeko; gaitua talde-afiliazioak gidatzen du eta existitzen da. `run_after` Agindua."

# libretranslate
msgid "The bridge ships as a **separate component** (own sidecar/role), not inside `web-app-atmo`, gated on `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`."
msgstr "Zubi-ontziak zubi gisa **osagai bereizia** (sidecar/role), Ez barruan `web-app-atmo`, aurrera `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The bridge's database password stays declared in [meta/secrets.yml](../../roles/web-app-matrix/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` and is referenced, never inlined. Each additional network (`whatsapp`, `signal`, `slack`, `facebook`, `instagram`) is its own `mechanism: bridge` addon."
msgstr "Zubiaren datu-basearen pasahitza agerian geratzen da [meta/secrets.yml](../../roles/web-app-matrix/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` eta ez da inoiz azpimarratu. Sare gehigarri bakoitza (`whatsapp`, `signal`, `slack`, `facebook`, `instagram`) berea da `mechanism: bridge` addon."

# libretranslate
msgid "The broader CI debugging workflow is documented in [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). You MUST NOT proceed with partial coverage."
msgstr "CI arazketa-fluxu zabalagoak dokumentatuta daude [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). Ez duzu estaldura partzialik egin behar."

# libretranslate
msgid "The broker MUST receive `X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, and `X-Forwarded-Email` from `oauth2-proxy`. On a user's first authenticated visit the broker calls the PDS `com.atproto.server.createAccount` endpoint with a synthesised app-password, encrypts that password with AES-256-GCM under a key from the project's credentials vault, and caches the ciphertext in the broker's in-process `sessionCache` keyed by Keycloak username. Subsequent visits decrypt the cached password in-broker, exchange it for a PDS session via `com.atproto.server.createSession`, and seed `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` so the social-app finds an authenticated session at boot. A broker restart drops the cache; the next SSO visit triggers a fresh `createAccount` and the previous app-password remains valid in PDS until rotated."
msgstr "Agenteak jaso behar du `X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, eta `X-Forwarded-Email` - `oauth2-proxy`. Erabiltzaile baten lehen bisita autentifikatuan bitartekariak PDS deitzen du `com.atproto.server.createAccount` azken puntua aplikazio-pasahitzarekin, pasahitza enkriptatzen du AES-ekin.256-GCM proiektuaren kredentzialen gangaren gako baten pean, eta brokeraren prozesuko testu zifratua ezkutatzen du. `sessionCache` Giltzaduna Keycloak erabiltzaile-izena. Ondorengo bisitek cachean gordetako pasahitza desenkriptatu egiten dute, PDS saio baterako trukatuz `com.atproto.server.createSession`, eta hazia `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` Beraz, gizarte-aplikazioak autentifikatutako saioa aurkitzen du abioan. Agente bat berrabiarazten da cachean; hurrengo SSO bisitak berri bat sortzen du `createAccount` eta aurreko aplikazioaren pasahitza baliozkoa da PDS-n biratu arte."

# libretranslate
msgid "The broker MUST receive ``X-Forwarded-User``, ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username``, and ``X-Forwarded-Email`` from ``oauth2-proxy``. On a user’s first authenticated visit the broker calls the PDS ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` endpoint with a synthesised app-password, encrypts that password with AES-256-GCM under a key from the project’s credentials vault, and caches the ciphertext in the broker’s in-process ``sessionCache`` keyed by Keycloak username. Subsequent visits decrypt the cached password in-broker, exchange it for a PDS session via ``com.atproto.server.createSession``, and seed ``localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]`` so the social-app finds an authenticated session at boot. A broker restart drops the cache; the next SSO visit triggers a fresh ``createAccount`` and the previous app-password remains valid in PDS until rotated."
msgstr "Agenteak jaso behar du ``X-Forwarded-User``, ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username``, eta ``X-Forwarded-Email`` - ``oauth2-proxy``. Erabiltzaile baten lehen bisita autentifikatuan bitartekariak PDS deitzen du ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` azken puntua aplikazio-pasahitzarekin, pasahitza enkriptatzen du AES-ekin.256-GCM proiektuaren kredentzialen gangaren gako baten azpian, eta brokeraren prozesuko testu zifratua ezkutatzen du. ``sessionCache`` Giltzaduna Keycloak erabiltzaile-izena. Ondorengo bisitek cachean gordetako pasahitza desenkriptatu egiten dute, PDS saio baterako trukatuz ``com.atproto.server.createSession``, eta hazia ``localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]`` Beraz, gizarte-aplikazioak autentifikatutako saioa aurkitzen du abioan. Agente bat berrabiarazten da cachean; hurrengo SSO bisitak berri bat sortzen du ``createAccount`` eta aurreko aplikazioaren pasahitza baliozkoa da PDS-n biratu arte."

