# libretranslate
msgid "The classic failure shape (`DNS [OK]`, `TCP [OK]`, `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) is an __MTU mismatch__, not a TLS-layer bug. Small packets (TCP-SYN, DNS replies) survive; the larger TLS-ServerHello with the certificate chain is dropped silently because the path MTU is below the bridge MTU and ICMP-needs-frag is filtered upstream. When `auth.docker.io` is OK but `ghcr.io` / `registry-1.docker.io` time out, the chain-length difference between hosts (Cloudflare-fronted ≈ small chain, GitHub/AWS ≈ large chain) confirms MTU as the cause rather than a blanket TLS block."
msgstr "Porrot klasikoaren forma (`DNS [OK]`, `TCP [OK]`, `TLS [FAIL] TimeoutError after 8s`) MTU bat da mismatch__, ez TLS-geruzako akats bat. Pakete txikiak (TCP-SYN, DNS erantzunak) bizirik iraun; ziurtagiri-katea duen TLS-ServerHello handiena isil-isilik erortzen da MTU bidea MTU zubiaren azpian dagoelako eta ICMP-en behar-beharrezkoak-frag iragazten direlako. Noiz `auth.docker.io` ondo dago, baina `ghcr.io` / `registry-1.docker.io` denbora libre, ostalarien arteko kate-luzera-diferentzia (Cloudflare-fronted , kate txikia, GitHub/AWS kate handia) MTU baieztatzen du kausa gisa TLS bloke bat baino."

