# libretranslate
msgid "The compose project a container belongs to, empty when it has none."
msgstr "Edukiontzi baten konposaketa-proiektua hutsik dago ez duenean."

# libretranslate
msgid "The compose step runs `compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<app> full_cycle=true variant=0`; the swarm step runs `swarm-zombie app=<app>`, pinned to `variant:0` so a multi-variant app validates one cluster (parity with the compose step, not the full per-variant CI matrix that runs one isolated runner per variant). The cluster is named `<app>-swarm-mgr-01` etc. via the mandatory `SWARM_NAME` (the app id is the default cluster id). Each validated swarm cluster is released afterwards unless you pass `keep=true`."
msgstr "Konposaketa-urratsak aurrera doaz `compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<app> full_cycle=true variant=0`; urrats ugariak jarraitzen du `swarm-zombie app=<app>`, pinned to `variant:0` beraz, aplikazio anitzeko kluster bat balioztatzen du (Konposizio-urratsarekin parekotasuna, ez aldagai bakoitzeko korrikalari bakar bat exekutatzen duen CI matrize osoa). klusterra izendatuta dago `<app>-swarm-mgr-01` e.a. derrigorrezkoa `SWARM_NAME` (aplikazioaren IDa klusterraren ID lehenetsia da)Ondoren, balioetsitako multzo bakoitza askatu egiten da pasatzen ez baduzu. `keep=true`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The compound predicates are the documented call surface — call sites should prefer ``is_proxy_gated`` over manually combining ``enabled`` and ``flavor``. The ``oauth2_*`` fields are the documented way to read the gated upstream config; templates that previously spelled out ``lookup('config', app_id, 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` SHOULD use ``lookup('sso', app_id, 'oauth2_<sub>')`` instead so the Python-side helper and the Ansible-side lookup share one schema."
msgstr "Predika konposatuak dei-azal dokumentatua dira; dei-guneek nahiago lukete ``is_proxy_gated`` eskuz konbinatzea ``enabled`` eta ``flavor``. The ``oauth2_*`` Eremuak dira goi-mailako konfigurazioa irakurtzeko modu dokumentatua; lehendik idatzitako txantiloiak ``lookup('config', app_id, 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` Erabili egin behar da ``lookup('sso', app_id, 'oauth2_<sub>')`` Horren ordez, Python-en aldeko laguntzaileak eta Ansible-ren bilaketak eskema bat partekatzen dute."

# libretranslate
msgid "The concurrency group stays the primary mechanism; it reaps within seconds of a run being created and needs no runner. `entry-cancel-superseded.yml` is the fallback for the case where it does not, and carries no group of its own, because the run holding a group cannot be the run that frees it."
msgstr "Konkurrentzi taldeak lehen mailako mekanismoa izaten jarraitzen du, eta segundo gutxiren buruan exekutatzen da eta ez du korrikalaririk behar. `entry-cancel-superseded.yml` ez duen kasuaren itzulera da, eta ez du talde propiorik, talde bati eusten dion ihesak ezin baitu askatu."

