# libretranslate
msgid "The constructor stage renders once through the [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) action and parks the result together with its cache key in the host fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (the action calls `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`). Every later worker inherits that fact at fork time; `get_merged_applications` serves it whenever the key still matches and renders only when it does not (a changed `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` or `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."
msgstr "Konstruktorearen agertokia behin errendatzen da. [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) ekintza eta emaitza bere cache gakoarekin batera kokatzen du ostalariaren egitatean `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (ekintza-deiak `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`)Geroko langile guztiek jasotzen dute egitate hori sardexka garaian. `get_merged_applications` gakoa oraindik bat datorrenean eta errendatzen ez duenean bakarrik balio du (aldatua `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` edo `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that `/metrics` is reachable at the documented path (where applicable). Prometheus admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer `up=1` verification live in `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only, parameterised over `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."
msgstr "Kontsumitzailearen rolak hori bakarrik baieztatzen du `/metrics` dokumentatutako bidetik irits daiteke (aplikagarria denean). Prometheus admin-reach, biber-en ezeztapena eta perconsumer `up=1` egiaztapena bizi da `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` bakarrik, parametroz gainditua `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that the matomo tracking snippet is in the HTML and that navigation generates the expected `/matomo.php` request (covered by `assertCspInjections` in the persona-helper). Matomo admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer tracker-site registration live in `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only."
msgstr "Kontsumitzailearen rolak baieztatzen du matomoen jarraipen-zatia HTMLan dagoela eta nabigazioak espero zena sortzen duela. `/matomo.php` eskaera (estalita `assertCspInjections` persona-laguntzailean). Matomo admin-reach, biber-en ezeztapena eta perconsumer tracker-site erregistroa bizi dira `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Bakarrik."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role's spec does NOT exercise the dashboard tile. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parameterises one tile-reachability test per consumer over `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and delegates the body to `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` from the sibling `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (tile visibility, click → `#main iframe` embed, header \"Tab\" button → new browser tab). Consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any tile / iframe / tab assertions."
msgstr "Kontsumitzailearen rolaren zehaztapenak ez du taulako fitxarik erabiltzen. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parametrizatzen du teila-erabileraren proba bat kontsumitzailearentzat `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` eta gorputza delegatzen du `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` anaiditik `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (fitxa ikusgai, egin klik → `#main iframe` kapsulatu, goiburua \"Tab\" botoia → arakatzaile-fitxa berria)Kontsumitzaileek ez dute bete behar teila / iframe / tabulaziorik."

