# libretranslate
msgid "The full CSP test surface lives in the same module: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (returns the parsed directive map), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (verifies the optional `<meta http-equiv>` echo is a subset of the response header), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (DOM-side `securitypolicyviolation` capture), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (asserts neither the DOM stream nor `diagnostics.cspRelated` carries a violation), and the `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` constant. Specs MUST require these from `./personas`; inline copies are forbidden and caught at review."
msgstr "CSP probako azalera osoa modulu berean bizi da: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (Analizatutako zuzentarauaren mapa itzultzen du), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (egiaztatu aukerakoa `<meta http-equiv>` echo erantzun-goiburuaren azpimultzoa da), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (DOM-side `securitypolicyviolation` harrapaketa), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (Ez du DOM korrontea edo korrontea baieztatzen `diagnostics.cspRelated` Bortxaketa darama.)eta `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` Etengabe. Espektroek hauek behar dituzte `./personas`; barneko kopiak debekatuta daude eta azterketan harrapatuak."

