msgstr "Instalazio-probako lan-fluxuak zerrendan `Infrastructure tests` taula [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md) paraleloan behin korrika `code-quality-gate` Berdea da. Denak pasa behar dira `test-install-gate`."

