# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) drives it through Shopware's own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` selects how it signs in — through the `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into `.sw-login__content` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Bidaia ez da bertan behera geratu. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) gidatzen du Shopwarehautatzaileak: motor autentifikatuaren baieztapena, gero erabiltzaile-ekintzak martxan jartzea, saioa hasteko inprimakiaren bidez. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` nola agertzen den hautatzen du - bidez `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` hornitzailearen esteka, AdminOpenAuth-ek eransten diona `.sw-login__content` SSO martxan dagoenean, jatorrizko pasahitzaren bidez, desaktibatuta dagoenean. The `guest` persona eta funtzio lokalaren irisgarritasuna, TLS eta HSTS baieztapenak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) drives both personas through Funkwhale's own chain: `/login`, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale's own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when `services.ldap.enabled` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Bidaia ez da bertan behera geratu. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) bi pertsonak zeharkatzen ditu Funkwhalekate propioa: `/login`, Keycloak ibilaldi biribila proxy-aren ateak bide horretan sartzen direnean, orduan FunkwhaleSinadura propioa, baieztapen autentifikatua eta egoera anonimora itzulia. Jauzi egiten da noiz `services.ldap.enabled` faltsua da, pertsona batek ere ez duelako Funkwhale Kontua aldagarri horretan. The `guest` persona eta oinarrizko baieztapenak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

