# libretranslate
msgid "The lid switch is a hardware component on laptops that triggers power state changes (sleep, hibernate, lock) when the lid is closed. On Linux, systemd's `logind` daemon manages lid switch events via `/etc/systemd/logind.conf`. The [`setup-hibernate`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/setup-hibernate) tool provides hibernation support configuration."
msgstr "Taparen kommutadorea ordenagailu eramangarrien hardware osagai bat da, egoera aldatzen duena (lo, hibernatu, blokeatu) Estalkia itxita dagoenean. Linux-en, systemd-en `logind` daemon-aklid kommutadore-gertaerak kudeatzen ditu `/etc/systemd/logind.conf`. The [`setup-hibernate`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/setup-hibernate) Tresnak hibernatzeko euskarriaren konfigurazioa eskaintzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The lid switch is a hardware component on laptops that triggers power state changes (sleep, hibernate, lock) when the lid is closed. On Linux, systemd’s ``logind`` daemon manages lid switch events via ``/etc/systemd/logind.conf``. The ```setup-hibernate`` <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/setup-hibernate>`__ tool provides hibernation support configuration."
msgstr "Taparen kommutadorea ordenagailu eramangarrien hardware osagai bat da, egoera aldatzen duena (lo, hibernatu, blokeatu) Estalkia itxita dagoenean. Linuxen, systemd-en ``logind`` daemon-aklid kommutadore-gertaerak kudeatzen ditu ``/etc/systemd/logind.conf``. The ```setup-hibernate`` <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/setup-hibernate>`Tresnak hibernatzeko euskarriaren konfigurazioa eskaintzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The link that belongs to a credited person lives nowhere but the Credits lines themselves: ``galaxy_info.author`` carries the name without a URL, and ``galaxy_info.company`` names the project owner rather than the role's author, so neither can supply it. This module derives the name -> URL map from the linked mentions already present in the repository, which keeps the README generator and the ``credits-attribution`` lint reading the same source instead of a hand-maintained list."
msgstr "Pertsona kreditatu bati dagokion esteka ez da inon bizi, baizik eta Kredituak bere burua lerrokatzen du: ``galaxy_info.author`` URLrik gabe darama izena, eta ``galaxy_info.company`` Proiektuaren jabea izendatzen du, ez egilearena, ez eta eman ere. Modulu honen izena -> da. Biltegian dauden erreferentzia estekatutako URLen mapa, README sortzailea eta README sortzailea mantentzen dituena ``credits-attribution`` Iturri bera irakurtzen zuen, zerrenda mantenduaren ordez."

# libretranslate
msgid "The lint (`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_info.py`) rejects any other top-level key so the file does not become a dumping ground."
msgstr "The lint (`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_info.py`) Goi-mailako beste edozein gako baztertzen du fitxategia ez dadin zabortegi bihurtu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The lint test in ``tests/lint/repository/settings/test_claude_sorted.py`` requires every hand-curated array to stay ASCII-sorted ascending so diffs stay reviewable and merge conflicts stay minimal. Tools that auto-extend the file (e.g. permission auto-allowlists) tend to append unsorted; this script puts everything back in order."
msgstr "Lint-aren proba ``tests/lint/repository/settings/test_claude_sorted.py`` Eskuko matrize bakoitza eskatzen du ASCII-ren goranzkoa izateko, beraz, diff-ak berrikusiak izaten dira eta bat egiten duten gatazkak minimoak izaten dira. Fitxategia automatikoki zabaltzen duten tresnak (adibidez, auto-allowlisten baimena.) ordenatu gabe erantsi ohi da, script honek dena ordenan jartzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The lint test that fails when a requirement file is fully checked off ([tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_requirements_completeness.py](../../../tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_requirements_completeness.py)) still lives here. It now imports the archive primitives from `pkgmgr.actions.archive`, pulled in via the `dev` extra in [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml)."
msgstr "Betebehar-fitxategi bat erabat desaktibatuta dagoenean huts egiten duen lint proba ([tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_requirements_completeness.py](../../../tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_requirements_completeness.py)) Hemen bizi da oraindik. Artxibo primitiboen inportazioa egiten du orain. `pkgmgr.actions.archive`, Barrura sartu nintzen, `dev` estra estra [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The list below was produced by grepping each `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` for `biber|BIBER`. A role appears under \"missing\" iff it has a Playwright spec, no biber references, AND its policy classification (next column) says one is expected. Each checkbox MUST be closed by reading the spec end to end, deciding whether the role is in scope, and then either adding the biber scenario (and the env keys) OR documenting in the commit message why the role is exempt and removing it from this list."
msgstr "Beheko zerrenda bakoitza birrinduz sortu zen. `roles/<role>/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` zeren `biber|BIBER`. rol bat agertzen da azpian \"missing\" baldin badu Playwright espeziea, erreferentzia biberrik ez, eta bere politiken sailkapena (hurrengo zutabea) bat espero zela dio. Kontrol-lauki bakoitza amaieraraino irakurriz itxi behar da, rolak esparrua ote duen erabakiz, eta ondoren biberaren agertokia gehituz. (eta env gakoak) Edo konpromisoaren mezuan dokumentatzea zergatik dagoen salbuetsita eta zerrendatik kentzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "The list below was produced by grepping each role's `meta/services.yml` for an `ldap` block with `enabled` set to something other than `false`. Each checkbox MUST be closed by reading the spec end to end, deciding whether the role exposes a test-drivable LDAP auth surface, and then either adding the LDAP scenario OR documenting in the commit message why the role is exempt (e.g. the LDAP integration is consumer-side only, with no Playwright- reachable login UI)."
msgstr "Azpiko zerrenda rol bakoitzaren rolak nahastuz sortu zen. `meta/services.yml` batentzat `ldap` blokea `enabled` beste zerbait ezarri `false`. Kontrol-lauki bakoitza itxi egin behar da amaierako puntua irakurriz, eta erabakiko du rolak proba-drivable LDAP auth azalera erakutsiko duen, eta gero LDAP agertokia gehitu edo dokumentu-mezuan zergatik dagoen salbuetsita. (adibidez, LDAPen integrazioa kontsumitzailearen alde bakarrik dago, Playwright-era iristeko moduko saio-hasierarik gabe.)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The list is cut into serial chunks with a hard boundary at the priority/regular seam (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), sized by the run's job and queue budget (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.slots`)."
msgstr "Zerrenda serieko zatietan ebakitzen da, muga gogor batekin, lehentasunaren/erregularraren arabera. (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), exekuzioko lan eta ilararen aurrekontuak tamainatuta (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.slots`)."

