# libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants: as described above, Postmarks' sole native credential is the single shared `ADMIN_KEY` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. `biber` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application's administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks `X-Forwarded-Groups`, so `biber` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Pertsonaren banderak adierazten dira [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` bakarrik blokeatuta dago `sso: false` aldaerak: goian azaldutako moduan, Postmarks'jatorrizko kredentzial bakarra partekatua da' `ADMIN_KEY` pasahitzaren inprimakia, ez dena Keycloak administratzaileak pertsona motak ezkutatzen ditu, beraz, konfiantzazko zubirik gabe ez dago administratzailearen saioa gidatzeko. `biber` aldaki guztietan blokeatuta dago: oauth2-proxy-ak aplikazioaren RBAC taldea eta zubiaren egiaztaketak soilik onartzen ditu `X-Forwarded-Groups`, Horrela `biber` lehen ukatua Postmarks SSOtik kanpo geratzen den kredentzial bakarra ez da erabiltzailearen kontua."

