# libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Funtzioak irudi pertsonalizatu argal bat eraikitzen du ofizialaren gainean Jira Software-irudia, bolumen iraunkorrak ditu, eta aplikazioa alderantzizko proxy-aren atzean erakusten du. Aldagaien kontrola image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM pilaren tamaina automatikoki kentzen zaio RAM ostalariari kapa seguruekin, saihesteko `Xms > Xmx`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Funtzioak irudi pertsonalizatu argal bat eraikitzen du ofizialaren gainean Jira Software-irudia, bolumen iraunkorrak ditu, eta aplikazioa alderantzizko proxy-aren atzean erakusten du. Aldagaien kontrola image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM pilaren tamaina automatikoki kentzen zaio RAM ostalariari kapa seguruekin, saihesteko ``Xms > Xmx``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Funtzioak irudi pertsonalizatu minimo bat eraikitzen du ofizialaren gainean Confluence irudia, bolumen iraunkorrak prestatzen ditu eta aplikazioa alderantzizko proxyaren atzean erakusten du. Konfigurazioa aldagaiek bultzatzen dute (irudia, bertsioa, bolumenak, domeinuak, OIDC). JVM meta-tamaina automatikoki deskargatzen da RAM ostalaritik, kapa seguruekin, saihesteko `Xms > Xmx`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Funtzioak irudi pertsonalizatu minimo bat eraikitzen du ofizialaren gainean Confluence irudia, bolumen iraunkorrak prestatzen ditu eta aplikazioa alderantzizko proxyaren atzean erakusten du. Konfigurazioa aldagaiek bultzatzen dute (irudia, bertsioa, bolumenak, domeinuak, OIDC). JVM meta-tamaina automatikoki deskargatzen da RAM ostalaritik, kapa seguruekin, saihesteko ``Xms > Xmx``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether ``pip`` from ``ansible_python_interpreter`` supports ``--break-system-packages`` and only uses it (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older ``pip`` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Rolak egiaztatzen du ea ``pip`` - ``ansible_python_interpreter`` euskarria ``--break-system-packages`` eta soilik erabiltzen du (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) erabilgarri dagoenean. Honek zahartzaroarekin bateragarria izaten jarraitzen du. ``pip`` bertsioak (adibidez, CentOS/RHEL sistema batzuk.)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether `pip` from `ansible_python_interpreter` supports `--break-system-packages` and only uses it (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older `pip` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Rolak egiaztatzen du ea `pip` - `ansible_python_interpreter` euskarria `--break-system-packages` eta soilik erabiltzen du (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) erabilgarri dagoenean. Honek zahartzaroarekin bateragarria izaten jarraitzen du. `pip` bertsioak (adibidez, CentOS/RHEL sistema batzuk.)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role configures a systemd service and timer which executes the CSP crawler periodically against all NGINX domains."
msgstr "Funtzioak sistematutako zerbitzu eta tenporizadorea konfiguratzen du, CSP crawler aldian behin exekutatzen duena NGINX domeinu guztien aurka."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role configures and deploys a containerized PhpMyAdmin instance using Docker Compose. It optionally integrates with a central database and uses dynamic Ansible variables to support flexible deployments in both production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Eginkizunak edukiontzi bat konfiguratu eta hedatzea PhpMyAdmin erabili Docker ComposeDatu-base zentral batekin integratzen da eta aldagai dinamikoak erabiltzen ditu, bai ekoizpen-inguruneetan bai etxeko inguruneetan hedapen malguak egiteko."

msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as ``http://jupyter:8888`` once it declares ``jupyter`` in its own ``meta/services.yml`` with ``enabled`` and ``shared`` set. ``web-app-openwebui`` ships that flag and sends ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` with it."
msgstr ""

msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as `http://jupyter:8888` once it declares `jupyter` in its own `meta/services.yml` with `enabled` and `shared` set. `web-app-openwebui` ships that flag and sends `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` with it."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single ``registry:2`` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group’s host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resolves to ``compose`` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Rolak bakar bat zabaltzen du ``registry:2`` proxy-aren modua, bere inbentario-taldearen ostalarian. Taldeak normalean ostalari bat izaten duelako (kudeatzailea), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` Erabakiak: ``compose`` paperarentzat; katxerako ostalari anitzeko fan-out-a ez dago v-rako esparrutik kanpo1."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single `registry:2` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group's host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` resolves to `compose` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Rolak bakar bat zabaltzen du `registry:2` adibidez proxy modu tiratua bere inbentario-taldearen ostalarian. Taldeak normalean ostalari bat izaten duelako (kudeatzailea), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` Erabakiak: `compose` paperarentzat; katxerako ostalari anitzeko fan-out-a ez dago v-rako esparrutik kanpo1."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys end-to-end on the project's reference distribution and is covered by **at least** a smoke-level Playwright spec, but neither the deploy nor the spec depth is considered production-grade."
msgstr "Eginkizuna proiektuaren erreferentziazko banaketan amaitzen da, eta estalita dago **gutxienez** Ke-mailako Playwright spec bat, baina ez hedapena eta ez espektro-sakonera ekoizpen-mailatzat jotzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via `SEMAPHORE_*` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak `administrator` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via `semaphore user add --admin --external`; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Rolak Semaphore edukiontzi bakarra hedatzen du (bere ataza kapsulatuarekin) eta plataformara eramaten du, `SEMAPHORE_*` Ingurune-aldagaiak. Konfigurazioko morroia saihestu egiten da hasierako administratzailea errendatutako sekretuetatik ikusita, eta beraz, berriro zabalduko da Semaphore-ko saioa hasteko orrian. SSO gaituta dagoenean, Keycloak `administrator` kanpoko Semaphore admin gisa sortu da deploy-an `semaphore user add --admin --external`; OIDC atzeradeia posta elektronikoz bat dator eta operadorea Semaphore admin gisa sinatzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via ``SEMAPHORE_*`` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak ``administrator`` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Rolak Semaphore edukiontzi bakarra hedatzen du (bere ataza kapsulatuarekin) eta plataformara eramaten du, ``SEMAPHORE_*`` Ingurune-aldagaiak. Konfigurazioko morroia saihestu egiten da hasierako administratzailea errendatutako sekretuetatik ikusita, eta beraz, berriro zabalduko da Semaphore-ko saioa hasteko orrian. SSO gaituta dagoenean, Keycloak ``administrator`` kanpoko Semaphore admin gisa sortu da deploy-an ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; OIDC atzeradeia posta elektronikoz bat dator eta operadorea Semaphore admin gisa sinatzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role directory name is the `application_id`. For example `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` is exposed as `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` as `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, and so on."
msgstr "Funtzio-direktorioaren izena da `application_id`. Adibidez `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` agerian dago `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` bezala `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, eta abar."

