# libretranslate
msgid "The script **prefers `/mnt`** when it is a separate partition (classic `ubuntu-latest` layout with `/dev/sdb` mounted at `/mnt`) and falls back to `/` otherwise. Current public runners no longer expose a separate `/mnt`, so the swapfile lands on `/` and must not starve the root filesystem."
msgstr "Gidoia **nahiago `/mnt`** partizio bat denean (klasikoa `ubuntu-latest` diseinuarekin `/dev/sdb` muntatuta `/mnt`) eta berriro erortzen da `/` bestela. Gaur egungo lasterkari publikoak ez du gehiago bereizterik erakusten. `/mnt`Beraz, swapfile-a bertan dago `/` eta ez du erroko fitxategi-sistema gosez hil behar."

# libretranslate
msgid "The script first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential generation of the live material), then mirrors each present subtree back to its fixed system path (`rsync -a --delete`): `secrets` into `/var/lib/infinito/secrets`, `ca` into `/etc/<domain>/ca`, `acme` into `/etc/letsencrypt`, `certbot` into `/etc/certbot`. `--no-safety-backup` skips the pre-recover unit run. The `node` subtree (ssh host keys + machine-id) is restored only with `--restore-node-identity`, because overwriting the running machine-id / ssh host keys changes the host's identity mid-flight — do it on a fresh host after total loss."
msgstr "Scriptak lehen aldiz irekitzen du paperaren babes-unitate hedatua (material biziaren belaunaldi berri bat), gero, azpizuhaitz bakoitza bere bide finkora itzultzen da (`rsync -a --delete`): `secrets` sartu `/var/lib/infinito/secrets`, `ca` sartu `/etc/<domain>/ca`, `acme` sartu `/etc/letsencrypt`, `certbot` sartu `/etc/certbot`. `--no-safety-backup` Aurre-esteketako unitatea saltatu egiten du. The `node` azpizuhaitza (ssh host gakoak + makina-id) honekin bakarrik berreskuratu da `--restore-node-identity`, exekutatzen ari den makina-id/ssh host gakoak gaindituta ostalariaren identitatea aldatzen duelako, egin ezazu ostalari berri batean erabateko galeraren ondoren."

# libretranslate
msgid "The script first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential generation of the live material), then mirrors each present subtree back to its fixed system path (``rsync -a --delete``): ``secrets`` into ``/var/lib/infinito/secrets``, ``ca`` into ``/etc/<domain>/ca``, ``acme`` into ``/etc/letsencrypt``, ``certbot`` into ``/etc/certbot``. ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the pre-recover unit run. The ``node`` subtree (ssh host keys + machine-id) is restored only with ``--restore-node-identity``, because overwriting the running machine-id / ssh host keys changes the host’s identity mid-flight — do it on a fresh host after total loss."
msgstr "Scriptak lehen aldiz irekitzen du paperaren babes-unitate hedatua (material biziaren belaunaldi berri bat), gero, azpizuhaitz bakoitza bere bide finkora itzultzen da (``rsync -a --delete``): ``secrets`` sartu ``/var/lib/infinito/secrets``, ``ca`` sartu ``/etc/<domain>/ca``, ``acme`` sartu ``/etc/letsencrypt``, ``certbot`` sartu ``/etc/certbot``. ``--no-safety-backup`` Aurre-esteketako unitatea saltatu egiten du. The ``node`` azpizuhaitza (ssh host gakoak + makina-id) honekin bakarrik berreskuratu da ``--restore-node-identity``, exekutatzen ari den makina-id/ssh ostalariaren identitatea aldatzen duelako, egin ezazu ostalari berri batean, erabateko galeraren ondoren."

# libretranslate
msgid "The script must stay free of every shell ``$``: the compose and swarm render paths launder dollars differently (a ``$pid`` reached the container as ``\"\"`` and crash-looped the sidecar on a sh syntax error). The bucket bootstrap therefore polls ``/status`` from a backgrounded subshell while ``exec`` makes the server PID 1; the poll loop dies with the container and readiness is gated by the consumer's bounded wait."
msgstr "Gidoiak shell guztietatik aske egon behar du ``$``: konposatua eta ugaria bide-izenak garbitzeko dolar desberdinak (a ``$pid`` edukiontzira iritsi zen honela ``\"\"`` eta alboko autoa sh sintaxiaren errore batekin kraskatu zuen.). Bota-trapa, beraz, poleak ``/status`` atzeko planoko maskorretik; ``exec`` PID bihurtzen du zerbitzaria 1; polearen begizta edukiontziarekin hiltzen da eta prest dago kontsumitzailearen itxaron mugagabeak."

# libretranslate
msgid "The script opens the LUKS device (interactive passphrase prompt; `--passphrase-stdin` for automation), mounts it, picks the newest device snapshot across every machine hash (a fresh host after total loss has a new machine id), mirrors it into the target (`rsync -a --delete`) and unmounts/closes the device again. No pre-recover service backup runs: the device itself is the backup this role maintains. Afterwards restore individual applications from the backup root with the matching role's `recover.py` (`svc-bkp-volume-2-local` for docker volumes, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local` for NFS exports)."
msgstr "Gidoiak LUKS gailua irekitzen du (Pasaesaldi elkarreragilea: `--passphrase-stdin` automatizaziorako), muntatzen du, gailu berriena aukeratzen du makinaren hash guztietan. (ostalari berri bat, erabateko galeraren ondoren makina ID berria du)helburura islatzen du (`rsync -a --delete`) eta gailua desmuntatu eta ixten du berriro. Ez dago aurrez gordetako zerbitzu-kopiarik: gailua bera da rol honek mantentzen duen babeskopia. Ondoren, leheneratu aplikazio indibidualak babeskopiaren errotik bat datorren paperarekin. `recover.py` (`svc-bkp-volume-2-local` docker bolumenak, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local` NFS esportatzeko)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The script opens the LUKS device (interactive passphrase prompt; ``--passphrase-stdin`` for automation), mounts it, picks the newest device snapshot across every machine hash (a fresh host after total loss has a new machine id), mirrors it into the target (``rsync -a --delete``) and unmounts/closes the device again. No pre-recover service backup runs: the device itself is the backup this role maintains. Afterwards restore individual applications from the backup root with the matching role’s ``recover.py`` (``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` for docker volumes, ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` for NFS exports)."
msgstr "Gidoiak LUKS gailua irekitzen du (Pasaesaldi elkarreragilea: ``--passphrase-stdin`` automatizaziorako), muntatzen du, gailu berriena aukeratzen du makinaren hash guztietan. (ostalari berri bat, erabateko galeraren ondoren makina ID berria du)helburura islatzen du (``rsync -a --delete``) eta gailua desmuntatu eta ixten du berriro. Ez dago aurrez gordetako zerbitzu-kopiarik: gailua bera da rol honek mantentzen duen babeskopia. Ondoren, leheneratu aplikazio indibidualak babeskopiaren errotik bat datorren paperarekin. ``recover.py`` (``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` docker bolumenak, ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` NFS esportatzeko)."

