# libretranslate
msgid "The token store at ``/var/lib/infinito/secrets/tokens.yml`` survives compose+volumes purges. Matrix-deploy variant transitions wipe an app's persistent state but the stale token would otherwise be reused on the next round (for example matomo's API probe in ``sys-front-inj-matomo``, whose token-empty guard never fires while the prior round's token is still present). The purge orchestrator invokes this module to drop the matching ``users.<user>.tokens.<app_id>`` entries alongside the entity-level wipe."
msgstr "Token biltegia ``/var/lib/infinito/secrets/tokens.yml`` bizirik irauten du konposatu+bolumenen purgak. Matrize-erabilerarako trantsizioek aplikazio baten egoera iraunkorra ezabatzen dute, baina token zaharkitua bestela hurrengo txandan berrerabiliko litzateke. (adibidez matomoaren API probe in ``sys-front-inj-matomo``, Haren zaindariak ez du inoiz surik egiten aurreko txandan dagoen bitartean.). Orkestra-zuzendariak moduluari deitzen dio bat-etortzea bertan behera uzteko ``users.<user>.tokens.<app_id>`` entitate-mailako garbigailuaren ondoko sarrerak."

# libretranslate
msgid "The token store is written on `STACK_HOST` while every `lookup('users').tokens` reader executes on the Ansible controller. In compose the two are one machine; in swarm they are not, so a provider that mints and persists its credential still resolves to an empty bearer for every client. The store therefore has to reach the controller as well."
msgstr "Token-dendan idatzita dago `STACK_HOST` bitartean `lookup('users').tokens` Irakurlea kontroladorean exekutatzen da. Konposatzean, biak makina bat dira; ez dira, beraz, hornitzaile bat, bere kredentziala gorde eta mantentzen duena, bezero guztientzat eroale huts bat izaten jarraitzen duena. Dendak ere heldu behar du kontroladorera."

