# libretranslate
msgid "The universal-logout service ([web-svc-logout](../../../../../roles/web-svc-logout/)), when attached to a deployment, injects JavaScript that auto-detects every logout control across the role tree and rewrites it to redirect through Keycloak's end-session endpoint. Persona scenarios therefore do NOT branch on whether universal-logout is active: they always click the role's own logout button. The injected JS handles the redirect when active, the click clears the local session when not, and the post-click assertion (`assertUnauthenticatedLanding`) is identical in both cases."
msgstr "Zerbitzu unibertsala ([web-svc-logout](../../../../../roles/web-svc-logout/))Zabaldutakoan, JavaScript injektatzen du funtzio-zuhaitzaren gaineko kontrol guztiak automatikoki detektatzen dituela eta berriro idazten duela birbideratzeko. KeycloakAmaierako saioa. Pertsonaren agertokiak, beraz, ez dute adarrik jotzen orokor-itxiera aktiboa den ala ez, eta beti klik egiten dute paperaren saioa amaitzeko botoian. JS injektatuak birbideratzea kudeatzen du aktibo dagoenean, klikak lokaleko saioa garbitzen du ez dagoenean, eta post-klikaren baieztapena (`assertUnauthenticatedLanding`) Bi kasuetan berdin da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The upstream `oauth2-proxy` MUST set `X-Forwarded-User` (or `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`) and `X-Forwarded-Email` on every request that reaches the broker. Without `X-Forwarded-User`, the broker returns HTTP 401, there is no anonymous fallback by design."
msgstr "Upstream `oauth2-proxy` Ezarri behar da `X-Forwarded-User` (edo `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`) eta `X-Forwarded-Email` bitartekariarengana iristen den eskaera guztietan. gabe `X-Forwarded-User`Agenteak HTTP itzultzen du 401, Ez dago diseinuz atzeratze anonimorik."

# libretranslate
msgid "The upstream server is stdio-oriented and broadly mutating over a cache several applications share."
msgstr "Upstream zerbitzaria estdio-orientazioa da, eta asko aldatzen da cache batean hainbat aplikaziok partekatzen dutena."

# libretranslate
msgid "The upstream server is stdio-oriented and broadly mutating. Keep `stdio_only_and_shared_cache` unless an isolated instance, prefix-scoped ACL principal, pinned bridge, and exact read-only tool list are supplied. Prefer using Redis as an internal agent-memory backend rather than a user-visible server."
msgstr "Upstream zerbitzaria estdiorantz orientatua dago eta asko aldatzen da. Mantendu `stdio_only_and_shared_cache` Kasu isolatu bat ematen ez bada, ACL-ko aurrizki-eskopiodun nagusia, zubi pinizatua eta irakurtzeko soilik den tresna-zerrenda zehatza ematen da. Hobe da erabiltzea Redis barneko agente-memoria-motor gisa, zerbitzari ikusgai baten ordez."

# libretranslate
msgid "The user is a direct member of the expected group (not only a parent OU)."
msgstr "Erabiltzailea espero zen taldeko kide zuzena da (gurasoa ez ezik)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The user is created idempotently (safe to run multiple times)."
msgstr "Erabiltzailea ahalmenik gabe sortu da (Segurua hainbat aldiz exekutatzeko)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The userland tools are baked into every distro image by [filesystem.sh](../../scripts/install/filesystem.sh); the kernel side comes from the host."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile-landare-tresnak distro-irudi guztietan egosten dira. [filesystem.sh](../../scripts/install/filesystem.sh); nukleoaren aldea ostalaritik dator."

# libretranslate
msgid "The v3 address is ``base32(PUBKEY || CHECKSUM || VERSION)`` where ``CHECKSUM = SHA3-256(\".onion checksum\" || PUBKEY || VERSION)[:2]`` and ``VERSION = 0x03`` (see spec.torproject.org/address-spec). Tor stores the *expanded* ed25519 secret key ``clamp(SHA512(seed)[:32]) || SHA512(seed)[32:]`` in ``hs_ed25519_secret_key``; the public key ``clamp(SHA512(seed)[:32]) * B`` equals the standard ed25519 public key, so it is taken straight from ``cryptography`` without needing scalar multiplication."
msgstr "V3 helbidea ``base32(PUBKEY || CHECKSUM || VERSION)`` nora ``CHECKSUM = SHA3-256(\".onion checksum\" || PUBKEY || VERSION)[:2]`` eta ``VERSION = 0x03`` (Ikusi spec.torproject.org/address-spec)Tor-ek gordetzen du *hedatua* ed25519 ezkutuko gakoa ``clamp(SHA512(seed)[:32]) || SHA512(seed)[32:]`` barruan ``hs_ed25519_secret_key``; gako publikoa ``clamp(SHA512(seed)[:32]) * B`` ed estandarraren berdina da25519 Gako publikoa, beraz, zuzenean hartzen da ``cryptography`` eskalar biderketa beharrik gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "The value a row draws from *pool* this sweep: a plain rotation over the row's global position, so consecutive rows spread across the pool and consecutive sweeps move every row on to the next value."
msgstr "Errenkada batek ateratzen duen balioa *igerilekua* sorta hau: biraketa arrunt bat errenkada globalaren gainean, beraz, elkarren segidako errenkadak igerilekuan zehar zabaldu ziren, eta segidan miaketa batek errenkada guztiak hurrengo baliora eramaten ditu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The value as it now stands in the file, or \"\" when it was removed."
msgstr "Balioa, orain fitxategian dagoen bezala, edo \"\" kendu zutenean."

# libretranslate
msgid "The value can be adjusted or overridden via inventory, group vars, or host vars if needed."
msgstr "Balioa doitu edo gainjarri daiteke inbentarioaren, talde-aldaketen edo ostalari-varren bidez, behar izanez gero."

# libretranslate
msgid "The value is always double-quoted in the output. That makes the emit safe for YAML edge cases like `restart: no` (bare `no` would otherwise parse as a boolean) without burdening the caller with quoting rules."
msgstr "Balioak beti aipu bikoitza du irteeran. Horrela, emisioa segurua da YAML ertzeko kasuetarako. `restart: no` (biluzia `no` bestela boolear gisa analizatuko litzateke) Deitzaileari arau komentagarriak ezarri gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "The value must mirror how the backed-up group is keyed. `all` treats every matched run as one instance — correct for `global-ci-<repo>-<ref_name>`, which spans both `entry-push-latest.yml` and `entry-manual-steer.yml`, so a push must be able to reap a manual sweep. `event` keeps one instance per event name — correct for `pr-ci-<repo>-<event_name>-pr-<number>`. Grouping any finer than the real key spares a run the group would have reaped: per-workflow grouping leaves the manual sweep alive, because it is the newest run of its own workflow."
msgstr "Balioak islatu egin behar du nola ixten den babes-taldea. `all` Bat datozen run guztiak instantzia bakar gisa tratatzen ditu - zuzena `global-ci-<repo>-<ref_name>`, bietan hedatzen dena `entry-push-latest.yml` eta `entry-manual-steer.yml`, Beraz, bultzada batek esku-garbiketa bat jaso ahal izango du. `event` kasu bat mantentzen du gertaera-izen bakoitzeko - zuzena `pr-ci-<repo>-<event_name>-pr-<number>`. Benetako gakoa baino finagoa den edozein taldek lortuko lukeen korrika egiten du: lan-talde bakoitzak eskuzko garbiketa bizirik uzten du, bere lan-fluxu berriena delako."

msgid "The value name, or None when no allowed value cleared *minimum*. None is a real answer: the measurement cannot carry a pin, and the caller leaves that axis to the rotation instead of guessing it."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "The values one axis may draw from this run."
msgstr "Ardatz bateko balioak exekuzio honetatik atera daitezke."

# libretranslate
msgid "The variant of *app* that carries the replay, and the mode it runs in."
msgstr "Aldaera: *app* Horrek erreprodukzioa darama, eta bere modua."

# libretranslate
msgid "The variant only affects inventory generation; the Ansible deploy itself reads `applications.<app>` overrides from the variant-resolved inventory and MUST NOT consult variant data at runtime."
msgstr "Aldaerak inbentarioaren sorrerari bakarrik eragiten dio; Ansible hedapena bera irakurtzen du `applications.<app>` Aldaera konpondutako inbentariotik gainjartzen da eta ez ditu datu aldagarriak kontsultatu behar exekuzio garaian."

# libretranslate
msgid "The variant override is baked as a real boolean into the inventory, so the shared-service auto-include picks it up at build time. Variant 0 therefore pulls `web-app-discourse` into the include set. Variant 1 does not."
msgstr "Aldaera gainjartzea benetako boolear gisa egiten da inbentarioan, eta, beraz, zerbitzu partekatuak eraikitzeko garaian jasotzen du. Aldaera 0 beraz, tirak `web-app-discourse` sarrera-jokoan. Aldaera 1 Ez."

# libretranslate
msgid "The variant that enables the fewest services, as the matrix writes it; the lowest index wins a tie, and ``''`` means none qualifies."
msgstr "Matrizeak idazten duen moduan, zerbitzurik txikienaren aukera ematen duen aldaera; indizeak gorbata bat irabazten du, eta ``''`` Horrek esan nahi du inork ez duela kalifikatzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "The verb folder name expresses the deploy intent. The script name expresses the scope."
msgstr "Karpeta-izen aditzak adierazten du zabaltzeko asmoa. Scriptaren izenak esparrua adierazten du."

# libretranslate
msgid "The version is read from roles/<application_id>/files/package-lock.json, so the URL is always the exact pinned, lockfile-reproducible version."
msgstr "Bertsioa roletatik irakurtzen da/<application_id>/fitxategiak/paketea...lock.json, Beraz, URLa beti da bertsio zehatz eta itxia."

# libretranslate
msgid "The vhost is identified by the ``domains.canonical`` key that carries the domain, which is the same key ``server.status_codes`` uses. A domain that is not canonical, or a key that declares nothing, falls back to the declared ``default``."
msgstr "Ostalaria identifikatu du ``domains.canonical`` domeinua duen gakoa, gako bera dena ``server.status_codes`` erabiltzen du. Ezer adierazten ez duen domeinua, kanonikoa ez den domeinua, deklaratutakora itzultzen da. ``default``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The vocabulary a package plan is written in."
msgstr "Pakete-plan bat idazten den hiztegia."

# libretranslate
msgid "The volume repo contributes a database step after its file steps: the dumps have to land once the volumes are back and while the consumers are still down, which is where the caller has them."
msgstr "Bolumen-errepoak datu-basearen urrats bat ematen du fitxategi-mailaren ondoren: zabortegiek bolumenak itzuli eta kontsumitzaileak oraindik jaisten diren bitartean lehorreratu behar dute."

# libretranslate
msgid "The warning MUST name the role, the addon id, and the failing step so the operator can act without reading raw task output."
msgstr "Abisuak izena eman behar dio paperari, gehigarriaren id-ari eta hutsegite-urratsari, operadoreak lan-irteera gordina irakurri gabe jardun dezan."

# libretranslate
msgid "The wget half stays proxy-aware on purpose: busybox wget rejects ``--proxy=off``, and this flavor exists for images where which tool ships is unknown, so hardening it there would break the very case it covers."
msgstr "Wget erdia proxy-awarean geratzen da nahita: okupatutabox wget-ak baztertu egiten du ``--proxy=off``, eta zapore hau existitzen da tresna-ontziak ezezagunak diren irudientzat, hain gogortuz gero, estaltzen duen kasua bera hautsiko litzateke."

# libretranslate
msgid "The wildcard in the namespace slot collapses 21 mutating verbs across `gh issue/pr/release/repo/ruleset/run/cache/gist/label/project/…` into a single rule per verb. Future namespaces that ship the same verb (e.g. a hypothetical `gh discussion lock`) are caught automatically. Explicit per-namespace lists rot as the `gh` CLI grows."
msgstr "Izen-espazioan dagoen komodina erori egiten da 21 hitz mutatzaileak gurutzatuz `gh issue/pr/release/repo/ruleset/run/cache/gist/label/project/…` arau bakar batean. Hitz bera bidaltzen duten etorkizuneko izenak (adibidez, hipotetikoa. `gh discussion lock`) Automatikoki harrapatzen dira. Izen-espazioko zerrendak usteldu egiten dira `gh` KLI hazten da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The window's start is the floor: with nothing green behind it the answer is the start itself, never the head. Walking back to the head is what made every retrigger redeploy the whole stretch its predecessors had already proven."
msgstr "Leihoaren hasiera zorua da: ezer berderik gabe, erantzuna hasiera bera da, inoiz burua. Burura itzuliz gero, aurrekoek frogatua zuten denbora guztian erretretario guztiak gorritzen ziren."

# libretranslate
msgid "The wiring block sits behind a ``file_exists`` guard on ``extensions/VisualEditorPlus/vendor/autoload.php``, because ``LocalSettings.php`` is rendered before the extensions are installed and ``VisualEditorPlus`` fatals until its composer step has run."
msgstr "Blokea atzean dago ``file_exists`` zaindaria ``extensions/VisualEditorPlus/vendor/autoload.php``, zeren eta ``LocalSettings.php`` luzapenak instalatu aurretik errendatzen da eta ``VisualEditorPlus`` Hilgarriak, konpositorearen urratsek aurrera egin arte."

# libretranslate
msgid "The wiring block sits behind a `file_exists` guard on `extensions/VisualEditorPlus/vendor/autoload.php`, because `LocalSettings.php` is rendered before the extensions are installed and `VisualEditorPlus` fatals until its composer step has run."
msgstr "Blokea atzean dago `file_exists` zaindaria `extensions/VisualEditorPlus/vendor/autoload.php`, zeren eta `LocalSettings.php` luzapenak instalatu aurretik errendatzen da eta `VisualEditorPlus` Hilgarriak, konpositorearen urratsek aurrera egin arte."

# libretranslate
msgid "The wiring that makes this work is purely in the `services` declaration, not in `run_after`:"
msgstr "Lan hau egiten duen kablea bakarrik dago. `services` aitorpena, ez hemen `run_after`:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The workaround used here is the **GitLab OAuth2 provider** (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`), which is generic enough to work with any OIDC-compatible identity provider including Keycloak. This provides true SSO: user accounts are automatically created in Mattermost on first login."
msgstr "Hemen erabilitako konponbidea da **GitLab OAuth2 Hornitzailea** (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`), OIDCrekin bateragarriak diren identitate-hornitzaileekin lan egiteko bezain generikoa da, besteak beste KeycloakHonek egiazko SSO ematen du: erabiltzaile-kontuak automatikoki sortzen dira Mattermost Lehenengo saioan."

# libretranslate
msgid "The workaround used here is the **GitLab OAuth2 provider** (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*``), which is generic enough to work with any OIDC-compatible identity provider including Keycloak. This provides true SSO: user accounts are automatically created in Mattermost on first login."
msgstr "Hemen erabilitako konponbidea da **GitLab OAuth2 Hornitzailea** (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*``), OIDCrekin bateragarriak diren identitate-hornitzaileekin lan egiteko bezain generikoa da, besteak beste KeycloakHonek egiazko SSO ematen du: erabiltzaile-kontuak automatikoki sortzen dira Mattermost Lehenengo saioan."

# libretranslate
msgid "The workflow-driven jobs additionally require the `BOT_APP_CLIENT_ID` and `BOT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` repository secrets, see [secrets.md](secrets.md). Without those secrets, runs fail at the token-minting step and no PR is opened."
msgstr "Lan fluxuak bultzatutako lanek ere eskatzen dute `BOT_APP_CLIENT_ID` eta `BOT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` Biltegiko sekretuak, ikusi [secrets.md](secrets.md). Sekretu horiek gabe, huts egiten du token-minting urratsean, eta ez da publikorik irekitzen."

# libretranslate
msgid "The workload form only changes step 6: a stack that carries services gets `docker stack rm`, a role whose compose renders none gets its compose project stopped on every node. `has_swarm_service` decides by asking the deployed stack. Every other step operates on volumes, the NFS export and the deployed backup units, independent of the orchestrator."
msgstr "Lan kargaren formak urratsa bakarrik aldatzen du 6-Zerbitzuak dituen pila batek jasotzen du `docker stack rm`, Konposatzen ez duen rol batek nodo bakoitzean bere konposaketa-proiektua gelditu du. `has_swarm_service` erabakitzen du hedatutako pila eskatuz. Beste urrats bakoitzak bolumenetan, NFS esportazioan eta babes-unitate hedatuetan funtzionatzen du, orkestra-zuzendariarengandik aparte."

# libretranslate
msgid "The worst entry point (``entry-*.yml``) adds its own jobs to the same run before calling the orchestrator; that overhead is subtracted too."
msgstr "Sarrera-punturik txarrena (``entry-*.yml``) Orkestrari deitu baino lehen, bere lanak gehitzen dizkio; buru hori ere kendu egiten da."

# libretranslate
msgid "The wp-discourse plugin install in [roles/web-app-wordpress/tasks/addons/wp-discourse.yml](../../../roles/web-app-wordpress/tasks/addons/wp-discourse.yml) does `container exec discourse rake api_key:create_master[...]` during the WordPress play. The Discourse container therefore has to exist by the time WordPress runs."
msgstr "Wp-discourse pluginaren instalazioa [roles/web-app-wordpress/tasks/addons/wp-discourse.yml](../../../roles/web-app-wordpress/tasks/addons/wp-discourse.yml) egiten du `container exec discourse rake api_key:create_master[...]` bitartean WordPress Jo. The Discourse Beraz, edukiontziak existitu behar du ordurako. WordPress Korrika."

# libretranslate
msgid "The writable ``secrets.credentials`` node of one application block."
msgstr "Idazgarria ``secrets.credentials`` Aplikazio-bloke bateko nodoa."

# libretranslate
msgid "The writer a handler picks decides how long a value lives. Both kinds are registered in `default.env` and both are visible to the lints; they differ only in whether the generated `.env` remembers what the environment said."
msgstr "Idazleak erabakitzen du zenbat bizi den balio bat. Bi motak erregistratuta daude `default.env` eta biak lintsei ikusgai daude; sortzen diren ala ez, ez dira bereizten. `.env` Gogoratu inguruak zer esan zuen."

msgid "Then dispatch:"
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "Then generate all graphs purely from memory"
msgstr "Orduan sortu grafiko guztiak memoriatik soilik"

# libretranslate
msgid "Then refactor only the roles confirmed by the user."
msgstr "Ondoren, erabiltzaileak baieztatutako rolak bakarrik bir fabrikatzea."

# libretranslate
msgid "Then restart Docker:"
msgstr "Gero berrabiarazi Docker:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Then trigger:"
msgstr "Orduan abiarazlea:"

# libretranslate
msgid "There are known security concerns with Fetchmail as stated in the [German Wikipedia](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fetchmail). If you require Fetchmail functions in the future, consider creating a Docker container for [Getmail](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Getmail) as it is considered more secure."
msgstr "Fetchmail-en segurtasun-neurri ezagunak daude, esan bezala. [Alemaniar Wikipedia](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fetchmail). Etorkizunean Fetchmail funtzioak behar badituzu, kontuan hartu Docker edukiontzi bat sortzea [Getmail](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Getmail) Seguruagotzat jotzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "There is consequently no auth chain for the persona helpers to drive and no admin surface to assert against. The opt-out is permanent, not a rollout gap."
msgstr "Beraz, ez dago auth katerik persona-laguntzaileek gidatzeko eta ez dute administratzaile-azalerarik aurka egiteko. Aukeraketa iraunkorra da, ez hutsunea."

# libretranslate
msgid "There is no standalone `make` target for Playwright. Tests run as part of local deploy flows (e.g. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). For spec-only iteration after the first successful deploy, see [Playwright Spec Loop](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)."
msgstr "Ez dago salbuespenik `make` Playwright-en helburua. Probak tokiko hedapenaren fluxuen zati gisa exekutatzen dira (Adibidez: `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). Espektazio hutsezko iterazioa, lehen ongi hedatu ondoren, ikusi [Playwright Spec Loop](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These are NOT valid exceptions and MUST NOT be invoked:"
msgstr "Ez dira salbuespen baliozkoak eta ez dira deitu behar:"

# libretranslate
msgid "These are deployment-orchestration failures, not playwright-parity failures, and were therefore deferred per the autonomy escape clause (archived req 019)."
msgstr "Hedatze-orchestration hutsegiteak dira, ez dramaturgo-paritatearen hutsegiteak, eta, beraz, autonomiaren ihes-klausularen arabera atzeratu zituzten. (artxibatutako req 019)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These are desktop GNOME Shell extensions with no in-app web surface to drive, so they are exempt from the Playwright requirement (requirement 026, Decision 11)."
msgstr "Hauek mahaigaineko GNOME dira Shell Aplikaziorik gabeko web-azalera duten hedapenak gidatzeko, beraz, Playwright-en eskakizunetik salbuetsita daude. (baldintza 026, Erabakia 11)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These are optional and fail soft: unset means the provider's route is never published, and the deployment falls back to whatever local backend the round deploys. The workflow reads each as `${{ secrets.X || vars.X }}`, so the same name works as a repository variable; see [configuration.md](configuration.md#provider-keys-variable-or-secret-) for why the secret is the better half of that pair."
msgstr "Aukerakoak dira eta ez dira bigunak: hornitzailearen ibilbidea ez da inoiz argitaratzen, eta hedapena hedatzen den edozein euskarri lokalera itzultzen da. Lan-fluxuak bakoitza honela irakurtzen du: `${{ secrets.X || vars.X }}`, Beraz, izen bera biltegi-aldagai gisa funtzionatzen du. [configuration.md](configuration.md#provider-keys-variable-or-secret-) Zergatik da sekretua bikote horren erdia?"

# libretranslate
msgid "These are used only for pulling source images from Docker Hub and are not required for GHCR authentication."
msgstr "Docker Hub-eko iturburu-irudiak ateratzeko bakarrik erabiltzen dira, eta ez dira beharrezkoa GHCR autentifikaziorako."

# libretranslate
msgid "These assets are meant to support confidence, not ceremony. They help the project validate real-world behavior across local development, CI environments, and deployment-oriented smoke tests. The emphasis is on practical feedback: when something breaks, the surrounding test tooling should make the failure easier to understand, easier to reproduce, and easier to clean up. 🚀"
msgstr "Aktibo hauek konfiantzarako dira, ez zeremoniarako. Proiektuak mundu errealeko portaera balioztatzen laguntzen dute garapen lokaleko, CI inguruneetan eta hedapenari zuzendutako ke-proban. Enfasiak iritzi praktikoa du: zerbait hausten denean, inguruko proben tresnak hutsegitea errazago ulertu, erreproduzitzeko eta garbitzeko errazagoa izan behar du. 🚀"

# libretranslate
msgid "These build on the working onion node and are implemented after the web core is verified."
msgstr "Onion nodoan oinarritzen dira eta web nukleoa egiaztatu ondoren inplementatzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "These choices are settled at requirement creation time and bound the implementation. Re-opening any of them MUST be recorded in the implementing PR."
msgstr "Aukera hauek eskakizunen sorrera-denboran finkatzen dira eta inplementazioa mugatzen dute. Haietako bat berriro ireki behar da PR inplementazioan."

# libretranslate
msgid "These decisions were confirmed by the operator before implementation starts and are NOT subject to re-litigation during implementation."
msgstr "Operadoreak erabaki hauek baieztatu zituen inplementazioa hasi aurretik, eta ez dira berriro argitu behar inplementazioan."

# libretranslate
msgid "These have genuine forks and MUST be resolved with the operator before or during implementation. Do not silently pick one and bury it."
msgstr "Benetako sardexkak dituzte eta operadorearekin konpondu behar dira inplementazioaren aurretik edo bitartean. Ez hartu bat eta lurperatu."

# libretranslate
msgid "These operations are unconditionally blocked, regardless of any `allow` entry or sandbox state. They cover destructive patterns whose blast radius is unacceptable even inside the sandbox (`.` is `allowWrite`, so `rm -rf .` would still erase the working tree and `.git/`)."
msgstr "Eragiketa hauek baldintzarik gabe blokeatuta daude, edozein dela ere `allow` sarrera edo sandbox egoera. Eredu suntsitzaileak estaltzen dituzte, zeinaren leherketa-erradioa onartezina baita harea-ontziaren barruan ere. (`.` da `allowWrite`, Horrela `rm -rf .` lan-zuhaitza ezabatuko zuen eta `.git/`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These operations pause and require explicit operator approval before executing, even when sandboxed."
msgstr "Eragiketa horiek eten egiten dira eta operadorearen onarpen esplizitua eskatzen dute exekutatu aurretik, baita harea-ontzian ere."

# libretranslate
msgid "These package definitions are required to bootstrap and run the local development/test environment reliably. 🚀"
msgstr "Paketeen definizio hauek behar dira tokiko garapena/proba ingurunea fidagarritasunez gidatzeko. 🚀"

# libretranslate
msgid "These pages drill into a single workflow rather than enumerate every target. `make help` is the authoritative list of available targets:"
msgstr "Orri hauek lan-fluxu bakarrean zulatzen dira, helburu guztiak zerrendatu beharrean. `make help` helburu erabilgarrien zerrenda autoritarioa da:"

# libretranslate
msgid "These permissions are required for DNS record management, CAA/SPF/DKIM handling, cache purging, and certificate provisioning."
msgstr "Baimen hauek behar dira DNS erregistroak kudeatzeko. CAA/SPF/DKIM kudeaketa, cachea garbitzea eta ziurtagiria ematea."

# libretranslate
msgid "These primitives are entity-keyed. The app-keyed orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) maps app ids to entities and drives them in sequence alongside the token-store wipe in [tokens.py](../../../../utils/cleanup/tokens.py)."
msgstr "Primitibo hauek entitate-gakoetan daude. Aplikazio-gakodun orkestratzailea [apps.sh](../apps.sh) mapen aplikazioa entitateei dagozkie eta sekuentzian gidatzen ditu, token-biltegiko garbiketaren ondoan. [tokens.py](../../../../utils/cleanup/tokens.py)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These principles govern how teams collaborate, plan, and deliver work. For code design principles, see [principles.md](../design/principles.md)."
msgstr "Printzipio hauek agintzen dute taldeek nola lan egiten duten, nola antolatzen duten eta lana ematen duten. Kodeak diseinatzeko printzipioei dagokienez, ikus [principles.md](../design/principles.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These roles remain out of shared MCP discovery. A future exception requires a new requirement with a fixed operation list, dedicated identity, isolation boundary, human approval for mutations, and audit trail."
msgstr "Rol hauek ez dute oraindik MCPren aurkikuntza partekaturik. Etorkizuneko salbuespen batek baldintza berri bat eskatzen du eragiketa-zerrenda finkoarekin, identitate dedikatua, isolamendu-muga, mutazioen giza onarpena eta ikuskapen-bidea."

# libretranslate
msgid "These rules are enforced via branch protection. See [branch.md](artefact/git/branch.md) for the full policy."
msgstr "Arau hauek adar-babesaren bidez betearazten dira. Ikusi [branch.md](artefact/git/branch.md) politika osoarentzat."

# libretranslate
msgid "These rules keep shared role values explicit, reusable, and easy to read."
msgstr "Arau hauek paper partekatuen balioak esplizituak, berrerabilgarriak eta irakurtzeko errazak izaten dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "These scripts are the SPOT for repository identity resolution."
msgstr "Script hauek biltegiaren identitatearen bereizmenaren SPOT dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "These scripts keep PR scope detection, branch-prefix validation, and fork merge-ref resolution together in one place. The `🧩 Subset` label's PR-body parser lives in the `cli.meta.ci.subset_roles` module; the dispatcher [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh) selects between it and the diff resolver. See the \"Subset label\" section in [pipeline.md](../../../../docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Script hauek PR esparruaren detekzioa, adar-aurrizkien balidazioa eta sardexka elkartzen dira leku batean. The `🧩 Subset` Etiketaren gorputzaren analizatzailea bizi da `cli.meta.ci.subset_roles` modulua; bidaltzailea [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh) Bere eta diff-aren artean aukeratzen du. Ikusi \"Azpimultzoaren etiketa\" atal honetan [pipeline.md](../../../../docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These scripts run **on the deployed host**, not on the controller. `test-e2e-cli` renders `templates/test.env.j2` into the environment and calls `test.sh`, which orchestrates the rest. They use `systemctl`, the `container` wrapper and `/etc/machine-id`, so they only make sense where the role actually deployed."
msgstr "Script hauek exekutatzen dira **hedatutako ostalarian**Ez kontroladorearekin. `test-e2e-cli` errendatzea `templates/test.env.j2` ingurunera eta deietara `test.sh`, Besteak orkestratzen dituena. erabiltzen dute `systemctl`, `container` bilgarria eta `/etc/machine-id`, Beraz, papera benetan hedatua dagoen lekuan bakarrik dute zentzua."

# libretranslate
msgid "These scripts run inside the local infinito container and remove container-local state only. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Script hauek tokiko infinito edukiontziaren barruan exekutatzen dira eta edukiontzi lokalaren egoera bakarrik kentzen dute. Laguntza horiei dei egiten dien helburu-indizea lortzeko, ikus [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "These steps are the shared repository workflow and apply regardless of whether you work on Linux, macOS, or Windows with WSL2."
msgstr "Urrats hauek biltegi partekatuaren lan-fluxua dira eta Linux, macOS edo Windows WSLrekin lan egiten duzun ala ez kontuan hartu gabe aplikatzen dira.2."

# libretranslate
msgid "These templates are intended for inclusion in larger NGINX configuration files via Jinja2.   They modularize your configuration by separating HTML, WebSocket, and media proxying, allowing for clear, reusable, and maintainable reverse proxy logic."
msgstr "Txantiloi hauek Jinja bidez NGINX konfigurazio-fitxategi handiagoetan sartzeko asmoa dute.2. Zure konfigurazioa modularizatu egiten dute HTML, WebSocket eta multimedia proxy-ak bereiziz, alderantzizko proxy logika argia, berrerabilgarria eta mantengarria ahalbidetuz."

# libretranslate
msgid "These variables cap the `infinito` container so local runs can reproduce GitHub-hosted runner pressure. Each default is `0`, which Docker interprets as \"unlimited\" and is identical to omitting the key. See [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md) for runner specs and reproduction profiles."
msgstr "Aldagai hauek kapatzen dute `infinito` edukiontzia, tokiko exekuzioek GitHub-en ostatutako korrikalariaren presioa erreproduzitu ahal izateko. Lehenetsi bakoitza `0`, Dockerrek honela interpretatzen du: \"unlimited\" Eta gakoa alde batera uztearen berdina da. Ikusi [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md) Korrikalari eta erreprodukzio-profiletarako."

# libretranslate
msgid "They are also the rows a run must not sample. A priority row is deployed in **every combination it can take** — each variant, in each mode its role offers, and on the modes that carry the onion axis once behind Tor and once on clearnet — all within the same sweep. A 3-variant role offering compose and swarm therefore becomes 3 × 2 × 2 = **12 jobs**, not 3. That is the point of naming a role in `priority`: it is proven everywhere at once instead of over four sweeps."
msgstr "Korrika egin behar ez den errenkadak dira. Lehentasunezko errenkada bat zabaltzen da **hartzen dituen konbinazio guztiak** -aldaera bakoitzak bere eginkizuna eskaintzen du modu bakoitzean, eta tipula-ardatza Torren atzean behin eta behin sare garbian eramaten duten moduetan. A 3-Lan-eskaintza oparoak konposatu eta barreiatu egiten dira. 3 × 2 × 2 = **12 Lanak**Ez, ez 3Hori da rol bat izendatzeko puntua. `priority`: Lau miaketa baino gehiagoren ordez leku guztietan frogatzen da."

msgid "They live apart from the client itself because the generator runs on the bare bootstrap interpreter: importing the client would pull in the language table and with it a YAML parser the generator is not allowed to need."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "They live at ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.{run_after,lifecycle}`` where ``<primary_entity>`` is the value returned by :func:`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` for the role's directory name."
msgstr "Bizi dira ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.{run_after,lifecycle}`` nora ``<primary_entity>`` itzultzen den balioa da :func:`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` Rolaren direktorio-izenerako."

# libretranslate
msgid "They live at ``secrets.credentials``, which is where the roles' own vars and every other consumer address them. Reading the top-level ``credentials`` instead returns nothing for every provider whose ``credential.source`` is ``credentials``, and the deploy then aborts on a secret that was provisioned all along."
msgstr "Bizi dira ``secrets.credentials``, Hemen daude rolak eta beste kontsumitzaile guztiak. Goi-maila irakurtzen ``credentials`` horren ordez ez du ezer ematen hornitzaile guztientzat. ``credential.source`` da ``credentials``Eta gero, zabalkuntzak sekretu batean abortatzen du, beti emana."

# libretranslate
msgid "They must not contain application-specific configuration values."
msgstr "Ez dute aplikazio zehatzen konfigurazio-baliorik eduki behar."

# libretranslate
msgid "They should be listed as Idle in ``github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners``."
msgstr "Idle gisa zerrendatu beharko lirateke. ``github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners``."

# libretranslate
msgid "They should be listed as Idle in `github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners`."
msgstr "Idle gisa zerrendatu beharko lirateke. `github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners`."

# libretranslate
msgid "They travel as `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` and `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` through the workflow `env:` block, the passthrough allowlist in [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), the `infinito` service environment in [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), and land in `API.<provider>.api_key` in the development inventory, whose path is the SPOT behind `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Skipping the compose forwarding makes them resolve to empty inside the container without any error."
msgstr "Bidaiatzen dute `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` eta `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` lan-fluxuaren bidez `env:` blokea, pasabideko sarrera-baimena [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), `infinito` zerbitzuaren ingurunea [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), eta lurra sartu `API.<provider>.api_key` garapen-inbentarioan, zeinaren bidea atzean dagoen SPOT `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Bidalitako konposaketa alde batera utzita, edukiontziaren barruan hutsik egitea erabakitzen dute, inolako errorerik gabe."

# libretranslate
msgid "Thin orchestrator that defines `EnvBuilder`, `BuildContext`, and `build_env()`. Walks the handler registry."
msgstr "Definitzen duen orkestra-zuzendaria `EnvBuilder`, `BuildContext`, eta `build_env()`. Kudeatzailearen erregistroa jarraitzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "Thin orchestrator: each variable's mapping/computation lives in its own module under :mod:`utils.env.handlers`. ``build_env`` walks the ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` registry, letting each handler read/write through an :class:`EnvBuilder`."
msgstr "Orkestratzailea: aldagai bakoitzaren mapaketa/konputazioa bere modulu propioan bizi da. :mod:`utils.env.handlers`. ``build_env`` ibilaldiak ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` erregistro bat, kudeatzaile bakoitzak irakurri/idazten uzten duena :class:`EnvBuilder`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Thin wrapper around the `image` lookup (the SPOT for resolving the ``<registry>/<image>:<version>`` reference). ``container_image`` only adds the ``image: \"...\"`` compose-line wrapping so templates can drop it in as a standalone statement:"
msgstr "Tapoi mehea inguruan `image` bilaketa (ebazteko SPOTa ``<registry>/<image>:<version>`` Erreferentzia). ``container_image`` soilik gehitzen du ``image: \"...\"`` Konposaketa-lerroko bilgarria, txantiloiek instrukzio bakar gisa jar dezaten:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Third render backend (additive)"
msgstr "Hirugarren errendatze-motorra (gehigarria)"

# libretranslate
msgid "This **Infinito.Nexus Presentation** is a tool designed for showcasing the Infinito.Nexus platform to various audiences, including **Administrators**, **Developers**, **End-Users**, **Businesses**, and **Investors**. The presentation leverages **Reveal.js** to create an interactive, engaging, and fully containerized experience that can be easily deployed with Docker."
msgstr "Hau da hau: **Infinito.Nexus Presentation** erakusteko diseinatutako tresna da Infinito.Nexus plataforma hainbat publikorentzat, besteak beste **Administratzaileak**, **Garatzaileak**, **Azken erabiltzaileak**, **Enpresak**eta **Inbertitzaileak**. Aurkezpenaren palanka **Reveal.js** Dockerrekin erraz hedatu daitekeen esperientzia interaktibo, erakargarri eta guztiz edukiontzidun bat sortzea."

# libretranslate
msgid "This 3-node topology (1 manager + 2 workers) is also the minimum exercised by the CI pilot workflow — see [CI: pilot validation workflow](#ci-pilot-validation-workflow). Any host in `svc-swarm-manager` MUST also be in `svc-swarm-node`. A deploy with a host in `svc-swarm-manager` but missing from `svc-swarm-node` MUST fail at inventory-validation time."
msgstr "Hau da hau: 3-node topologia (1 kudeatzailea + 2 langileak) CIren lan-fluxu pilotuak egiten duen gutxienekoa da. [CI: balidazio pilotuko lan-fluxua](#ci-pilot-validation-workflow). Edozein ostalari `svc-swarm-manager` ere sartu behar da `svc-swarm-node`. Ostalari bat duen hedapena `svc-swarm-manager` baina falta da `svc-swarm-node` Asmatzeko garaian huts egin behar da."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the installation and configuration of [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/), a free and open-source tool for automating the deployment of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificates. It also handles the setup of DNS plugins for ACME challenges."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible honek instalazioa eta konfigurazioa automatizatzen ditu [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/), iturburu libre eta irekiko tresna bat hedapena automatizatzeko [Enkriptatu dezagun](https://letsencrypt.org/) ziurtagiriak. DNS pluginen konfigurazioa ere kudeatzen du ACMEren erronkei dagokienez."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the installation and configuration of `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__, a free and open-source tool for automating the deployment of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificates. It also handles the setup of DNS plugins for ACME challenges."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible honek instalazioa eta konfigurazioa automatizatzen ditu `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__, iturburu libre eta irekiko tresna bat hedapena automatizatzeko `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ ziurtagiriak. DNS pluginen konfigurazioa ere kudeatzen du ACMEren erronkei dagokienez."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the integration of Matomo tracking code into NGINX-served websites. It simplifies the process of adding the Matomo analytics tracking script and image tracker to all your web pages served through NGINX."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible horrek automatizatzen du integrazioa Matomo NGINXek behatutako web guneetako kodearen jarraipena. Horrek errazten du gehitzea Matomo NGINXen bidez emandako web-orri guztien jarraipena eta irudi-jarraitzailea."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the validation of [Content Security Policy (CSP)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP) enforcement for all configured domains by crawling them using a [CSP Checker](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker)."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible horrek automatizatzen du balioztatzea [Edukiaren segurtasun-politika (CSP)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP) konfiguratutako domeinu guztien betearazpena erabiliz [CSP Checker](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker)."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the validation of `Content Security Policy (CSP) <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP>`__ enforcement for all configured domains by crawling them using a `CSP Checker <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker>`__."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible horrek automatizatzen du balioztatzea `Content Security Policy (CSP) <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP>`__ konfiguratutako domeinu guztien betearazpena erabiliz `CSP Checker <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker>`__."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automatically restarts Docker Compose configurations with exited or unhealthy containers on Arch Linux systems. It ensures the stability of containerized workloads by recovering from common error conditions like port binding issues."
msgstr "Funtzio hau automatikoki berrabiarazten da Docker Compose Arch Linux-eko sistemetako edukiontzi itxiak edo osasungarriak ez diren konfigurazioak. Lan-karga edukiontziratuen egonkortasuna bermatzen du, errore arruntetatik berreskuratuz, portu-loturako arazoetatik bezala."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures NGINX to perform 301 redirects from one domain to another. It handles SSL certificate retrieval for the source domains and sets up the NGINX configuration to redirect to the specified target domains."
msgstr "Funtzio ansible honek NGINX konfiguratzen du egiteko 301 domeinu batetik bestera birbideratzen da. Iturburuko domeinuetarako SSL ziurtagiria berreskuratzea kudeatzen du eta NGINX konfigurazioa ezartzen du zehaztutako helburuko domeinuetara birbideratzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures the OpenSSH daemon (``sshd``) by deploying a templated ``sshd_config`` file. It applies secure, best-practice settings to harden remote access and reduce the risk of misconfiguration or lockout. Settings include disabling root login, enforcing public-key authentication, and setting appropriate logging levels."
msgstr "Funtzio honek OpenSSH daemon-a konfiguratzen du (``sshd``) txantiloi bat zabaltzean ``sshd_config`` fitxategia. Ezarpen seguru eta egokiak aplikatzen ditu urruneko sarbidea gogortzeko eta gaizki konfiguratzeko edo blokeatzeko arriskua murrizteko. Ezarpenak daude root-aren saioa desgaitzeko, gako publikoaren autentifikazioa behartzeko eta erregistro maila egokiak ezartzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures the OpenSSH daemon (`sshd`) by deploying a templated `sshd_config` file. It applies secure, best-practice settings to harden remote access and reduce the risk of misconfiguration or lockout. Settings include disabling root login, enforcing public-key authentication, and setting appropriate logging levels."
msgstr "Funtzio honek OpenSSH daemon-a konfiguratzen du (`sshd`) txantiloi bat zabaltzean `sshd_config` fitxategia. Ezarpen seguru eta egokiak aplikatzen ditu urruneko sarbidea gogortzeko eta gaizki konfiguratzeko edo blokeatzeko arriskua murrizteko. Ezarpenak daude root-aren saioa desgaitzeko, gako publikoaren autentifikazioa behartzeko eta erregistro maila egokiak ezartzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys **NGINX** as a high-performance [reverse proxy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy) in front of Docker-hosted services.   It provides automatic TLS integration, WebSocket support, and a flexible templating system for per-application configuration."
msgstr "Funtzio hau zabaldu egiten da **NGINX** errendimendu handiko gisa [alderantzizko proxy-a](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy) Docker-ek ostatatutako zerbitzuen aurrean. TLS integrazio automatikoa, WebSocket euskarria eta aplikazio bakoitzeko konfiguraziorako sistema motela eskaintzen ditu."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys **NGINX** as a high-performance `reverse proxy <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy>`__ in front of Docker-hosted services."
msgstr "Funtzio hau zabaldu egiten da **NGINX** errendimendu handiko gisa `reverse proxy <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy>`__ Docker-ek ostatatutako zerbitzuen aurrean."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys Collabora Online (CODE) in Docker to enable real-time, in-browser document editing for Nextcloud. It automates the setup of the Collabora CODE container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network isolation via Docker networks, and environment variable management."
msgstr "Funtzio hau zabaldu egiten da Collabora Online (CODE) Docker-en denbora errealeko eta nabigazio-dokumentuen edizioa gaitzeko Nextcloud. Konfigurazioa automatizatzen du Collabora CODE edukiontzia, NGINX alderantzizko proxy konfigurazioa, sareko isolamendua Docker sareen bidez eta ingurune-aldaketen kudeaketa."

