# libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` applied to every host in the inventory. It holds the shared baseline that every role and every host-specific var can build on top of."
msgstr "Direktorio honek dauka [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` Inbentarioko ostalari guztiei aplikatzen zaie. Oinarri partekatua dauka, rol bakoitzak eta ostalari bakoitzaren var bakoitzak bere gainean eraiki ahal izateko."

# libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the helpers invoked by [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) to bump pinned upstream versions and open a pull request once per day. The helpers are thin wrappers: the image-version and repository-ref bumpers delegate to Python CLIs under [cli/contributing/](../../../cli/contributing/) that scan `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and rewrite version pins in place; the PR-open helper commits, force-pushes the update branch, and creates or refreshes the PR via `gh`. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows other than `🔄 Update versions`; the `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` gate is enforced once, at the workflow's job level, and bypassing it from another caller would create PRs even when auto-updates are intentionally disabled."
msgstr "Direktorio honek laguntzaileak ditu. [cron...update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) kosk egin eta tira-eskaera bat ireki egunero. Laguntzaileak bilgarri meheak dira: irudi-bertsioa eta biltegi-erreferentziak Python CLIs-en esku uzten dituzte. [cli/contributing/](../../../cli/contributing/) eskaneatze hori `roles/*/meta/services.yml` eta bertsio-pinak berridatzi ordez; PR-open-laguntzaileak eguneraketa-adarra behartzen du, eta PRa sortu edo freskatzen du. `gh`. Laguntza-emaileak ez dira deitu behar lan-fluxuetatik. `🔄 Update versions`; `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` atea behin behartuta dago, lan-fluxuaren lan-mailan, eta beste dei-egile batetik igarotzeak PRak sortuko lituzke, nahiz eta automatikoki eguneratzeak nahita desgaituta egon."

# libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the iteration loops agents follow while driving a role end to end: the [Compose Loop](compose.md), the [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), the [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md), the [Workflow Loop](workflow.md), and the cross-mode [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md) gate that runs compose then swarm. Its scope is the mechanics of those loops."
msgstr "Direktorio honek iterazio-begiztaren agenteak jarraitzen ditu rol-amaiera bat amaitzen den bitartean: [Prestatu begizta](compose.md), [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md), [Lan-fluxuaren begizta](workflow.md), eta gurutze-modua [Begizta biribila](roundtrip.md) atea, exekutatzen dena, eta gero ugaria. Bere esparrua begizta horien mekanika da."

