# libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the OS-level sandbox configuration for Claude Code. The relevant keys live under `sandbox` in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). The sandbox is the **primary** containment layer in this project: because the allowlist uses the wildcard `Bash(*)` (with `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` as defence-in-depth), sandbox confinement, not the per-command allowlist, is what bounds the blast radius of Bash. The `allow`/`ask`/`deny` lists described in [settings.md](settings.md) remain in force on top of it as the policy gate."
msgstr "Orrialde honetan Claude Code-ren OS mailako sandbox konfigurazioa azaltzen da. Gako garrantzitsuak azpian bizi dira `sandbox` barruan [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). Harea-kutxa da **Nagusia** proiektu honetan edukitze-geruza: baimen-zerrendak komodina erabiltzen duelako `Bash(*)` (honekin: `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` defentsa sakon gisa)Harea-kutxaren konfinamendua, ez komando bakoitzeko baimen-zerrenda, Baxen leherketa-erradioa mugatzen duena da. The `allow`/`ask`/`deny` zerrenda honetan azaldutakoak [settings.md](settings.md) Indarrean egon behar da, politikaren ate gisa."

