# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); the resulting entry point is `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, relabelled \"SSO with Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, which the shared helper's name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a `/landing` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` eta `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2` mekanismo bera. Mattermost Team Edition-ek ez du jatorrizko OIDC hornitzailerik bidaltzen, beraz, zerrigatzaile papera Keycloak gainean GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` barruan `templates/env.j2`); lortutako sarrera-puntua da `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, berriro etiketatua \"SSOrekin Infinito.Nexus\" Egilea: `templates/javascript.js.j2`, Laguntzaile partekatuaren izen-oinarritutako saio-hasieraren parekoak ez du ezagutzen. V materia11+ a ere zerbitzatzen du `/landing` behin bakarrik garbitzen duten bisitari ez-authentikoei interstitial `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` Nabigazioaren aurretik hazia da, eta laguntzaile partekatuak ez du horretarako teklarik."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same reason. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `sso.shared: false`: MIG serves the pre-rendered Meta Infinite Graph over its own compose stack and has no login surface, no accounts, and no authenticated state at all. Consequently the env file renders no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` or `BIBER_PASSWORD` for the shared helpers to read."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` eta `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2` Arrazoi beragatik. `meta/services.yml` orratzak `sso.enabled: false` eta `sso.shared: false`: MIGk Meta Infinite Graph aurre-berrituari zerbitzatzen dio bere konposaketa-pilan, eta ez du saio-hasierako azalerarik, ez konturik, ez eta autentifikatutako egoerarik ere. Ondorioz, env fitxategiak ez du errendatzen `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` edo `BIBER_PASSWORD` laguntzaileek irakurtzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` in `vars/main.yml`, attached in `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` eta `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2` Bi arrazoi ezberdinengatik. The MinIO Hemen dagoen kontsolaren bertsioak ez du inoiz SSO botoia ematen: `/api/v1/login` Erantzunak `redirectRules: null` Hala ere, identitate-hornitzailea zerbitzariaren alde erregistratuta dago; beraz, ez dago OIDC sarrera-punturik laguntza partekatuaren klik egiteko. Biber blokeatuta dago, bakarra delako MinIO administratzaileak RBAC taldearen bide-izena du (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` barruan `vars/main.yml`, erantsia `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) eta MinIO Ez du autozerbitzuko seinalerik, beraz, biber-ek politikarik gabe mapatzen du eta ez du inolako gainazal autentifikaturik."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The wiki's bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` in `tasks/04_admin.yml` with `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` eta `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2` Bi arrazoi ezberdinengatik. wikiaren burokratikoa eta sop kontu lokala da. `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` barruan `tasks/04_admin.yml` honekin: `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` - role-local `credentials.administrator_password`, Ez, ez da Keycloak ezkutuko pertsona laguntzaileak eramaten du `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` faltsua da, beraz, ez dago jatorrizko formarik pasahitza onartzen duenik. `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` lurrak Keycloak Nortasuna wiki-kontu bereizi batean, sop-eskubiderik ez duena."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: `meta/services.yml` carries no `sso` block (the `keycloak` service declares `provides: sso`) and pins `logout.enabled: false`, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak's only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`, backed by the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`) and not the normal-realm `ADMIN_PASSWORD` the helper types."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` eta `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak SSO eskaintzen du kontsumitu ordez: `meta/services.yml` ez darama `sso` blokea (eta `keycloak` zerbitzuak adierazten du `provides: sso`) eta pinak `logout.enabled: false`, Beraz, URL kanonikoak ez du oauthik.2-proxy atea eta OIDC saio-hasierako esteka pertsona laguntzaile partekatuentzat klik egiteko edo saioa amaitzeko. Administratzailearen pertsona ez dago eskura, zeren eta Keycloakadministratzailearen gainazal bakarra konsol maisua da, eta horrek goi-adminen kontu iraunkorra onartzen du. (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` barruan `vars/main.yml`, rol lokalaren babesarekin `credentials.administrator_password`) eta ez errealismo arrunta `ADMIN_PASSWORD` laguntzaileak."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu's OIDC fork interposes its own `/sso/login` page that carries a local login form next to an `openid-connect/auth` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an `openid-connect/logout` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu's admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), not the `/webmail/` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` eta `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu-ren OIDC-k bere kabuz sartzen du `/sso/login` lokaleko saioa hasteko inprimakia duen orria `openid-connect/auth` esteka, autentifikatutako Roundcube gainazalak, berriz, badu `openid-connect/logout` esteka; laguntzaile partekatua izen irisgarriz bat dator eta ezin ditu biak bereizi, beraz, saioa amaitzeko klik egiten du. Administratzailearen pertsona blokeatuta dago bigarren arrazoi independente batengatik: Mailu-ren administratzaile-azalera Flask-eko aplikazio bereizi bat da. `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), Ez, ez da `/webmail/` OIDCren atzeradeia azaleratu."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo holds no Keycloak client, so the OIDC round-trip the shared helper waits for never happens; the administrator signs in on Matomo's native `index.php?module=Login` form against the local superuser configured in `vars/main.yml`. Biber is blocked for a different reason: the role provisions exactly one Matomo account, that same superuser, and has no per-user provisioning, so biber has no Matomo identity at all."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` eta `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` orratzak `sso.enabled: false` - Matomo ez dauka Keycloak bezeroa, beraz, OIDCk, laguntzaile partekatuak, itxaron egiten du inoiz ez gertatzeko; administratzaileak sinatu egiten du. Matomobertakoa da `index.php?module=Login` hemen konfiguratutako supererabiltzaile lokalaren aurkako inprimakia `vars/main.yml`. Biber beste arrazoi batengatik blokeatuta dago: rol-xedapenek bat egiten dute. Matomo kontu, supererabiltzaile berak, eta ez du erabilerarik, beraz, biber-ek ez du Matomo Identitatea."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/04_oidc.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle-ren gune-administratzaileak sortu du `install_database.php` barruan `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` eta pasabide guztietan lerrokatzen da, bietatik `administrator` erabiltzailea, beraz, jatorrizko formak eta identitate-hornitzaileak sekretu bat dute. SSO aldaeran `tasks/04_oidc.yml` multzoak `alternateloginurl` beraz, `/login/index.php` OIDC pluginaren erreboteak eta berridazketak `mdl_user` errenkada `auth='oidc'`, beraz, ez du inolako formarik onartzen, ezta ezkutukorik ere, SSO-ren aldaerak `meta/variants.yml` Ez dago OIDC katerik ordezteko. Env fitxategi bat rol bakoitzeko errendatzen da, ez aldaki bakoitzeko, beraz, banderak kasu txarrenerako gorde behar du."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` barruan `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX oauth baten atzean dago2-proxy norena `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` barruan `meta/services.yml` Onartu bakarrik `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` eta `roles/web-app-kix/user`; Biber ez da inorena, eta proxy-ak ukatu egiten du lehenago. KIX Edozer gauza ematen du. Aurreko proxy-a KIX saio-hasiera bi fasekoa da: SPAk oraindik bere agente-forma aurkezten du. `/auth` LDAPekin lotzen dena, eta pertsona laguntzaile partekatuak ez du bigarren etaparik. Keycloak Biraketa."

msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` in ``templates/env.j2``); the resulting entry point is ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``, relabelled “SSO with Infinito.Nexus” by ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, which the shared helper’s name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a ``/landing`` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for the same reason. ``meta/services.yml`` pins ``sso.enabled: false`` and ``sso.shared: false``: MIG serves the pre-rendered Meta Infinite Graph over its own compose stack and has no login surface, no accounts, and no authenticated state at all. Consequently the env file renders no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``, ``BIBER_USERNAME`` or ``BIBER_PASSWORD`` for the shared helpers to read."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` eta ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` barruan ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` Arrazoi beragatik. ``meta/services.yml`` orratzak ``sso.enabled: false`` eta ``sso.shared: false``: MIGk Meta Infinite Graph aurre-berrituari zerbitzatzen dio bere konposaketa-pilan, eta ez du saio-hasierako azalerarik, ez konturik, ez eta autentifikatutako egoerarik ere. Ondorioz, env fitxategiak ez du errendatzen ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``, ``BIBER_USERNAME`` edo ``BIBER_PASSWORD`` laguntzaileek irakurtzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — ``/api/v1/login`` answers ``redirectRules: null`` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (``MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME`` in ``vars/main.yml``, attached in ``tasks/02_ldap.yml``) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` eta ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` barruan ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` Bi arrazoi ezberdinengatik. The MinIO Hemen dagoen kontsolaren bertsioak ez du inoiz SSO botoia ematen: ``/api/v1/login`` Erantzunak ``redirectRules: null`` Hala ere, identitate-hornitzailea zerbitzariaren alde erregistratuta dago; beraz, ez dago OIDC sarrera-punturik laguntza partekatuaren klik egiteko. Biber blokeatuta dago, bakarra delako MinIO administratzaileak RBAC taldearen bide-izena du (``MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME`` barruan ``vars/main.yml``, erantsia ``tasks/02_ldap.yml``) eta MinIO Ez du autozerbitzuko seinalerik, beraz, biber-ek politikarik gabe mapatzen du eta ez du inolako gainazal autentifikaturik."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for two different reasons. The wiki’s bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by ``maintenance/run.php createAndPromote`` in ``tasks/04_admin.yml`` with ``MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD`` — the role-local ``credentials.administrator_password``, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``. ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin`` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and ``$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName`` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` eta ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` barruan ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` Bi arrazoi ezberdinengatik. wikiaren burokratikoa eta sop kontu lokala da, honek sortua ``maintenance/run.php createAndPromote`` barruan ``tasks/04_admin.yml`` honekin: ``MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD`` - role-local ``credentials.administrator_password``, Ez, ez da Keycloak ezkutuko pertsona laguntzaileak eramaten du ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``. ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin`` faltsua da, beraz, ez dago jatorrizko formarik pasahitza onartzen duenik. ``$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName`` lurrak Keycloak Nortasuna wiki-kontu bereizi batean, sop-eskubiderik ez duena."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: ``meta/services.yml`` carries no ``sso`` block (the ``keycloak`` service declares ``provides: sso``) and pins ``logout.enabled: false``, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak’s only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME`` / ``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` in ``vars/main.yml``, backed by the role-local ``credentials.administrator_password``) and not the normal-realm ``ADMIN_PASSWORD`` the helper types."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` eta ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` barruan ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Keycloak SSO eskaintzen du kontsumitu ordez: ``meta/services.yml`` ez darama ``sso`` blokea (eta ``keycloak`` zerbitzuak adierazten du ``provides: sso``) eta pinak ``logout.enabled: false``, Beraz, URL kanonikoak ez du oauthik.2-proxy atea eta OIDC saio-hasierako esteka pertsona laguntzaile partekatuentzat klik egiteko edo saioa amaitzeko. Administratzailearen pertsona ez dago eskura, zeren eta Keycloakadministratzaile-azalera bakarra maisu-errealmoa da, goi-adminen kontu iraunkorra onartzen duena. (``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME`` / ``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` barruan ``vars/main.yml``, rol lokalaren babesarekin ``credentials.administrator_password``) eta ez errealismo arrunta ``ADMIN_PASSWORD`` laguntzaileak."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Mailu’s OIDC fork interposes its own ``/sso/login`` page that carries a local login form next to an ``openid-connect/auth`` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an ``openid-connect/logout`` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu’s admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at ``WEB_ADMIN=/admin`` (``templates/env.j2``), not the ``/webmail/`` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` eta ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` barruan ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Mailu-ren OIDC sardexkak bere kabuz gurutzatzen du ``/sso/login`` lokaleko saioa hasteko inprimakia duen orria ``openid-connect/auth`` esteka, autentifikatutako Roundcube gainazalak, berriz, badu ``openid-connect/logout`` esteka; laguntzaile partekatua izen irisgarriz bat dator eta ezin ditu biak bereizi, beraz, saioa amaitzeko klik egiten du. Administratzailearen pertsona blokeatuta dago bigarren arrazoi independente batengatik: Mailu-ren administratzaile-azalera Flask-eko aplikazio bereizi bat da. ``WEB_ADMIN=/admin`` (``templates/env.j2``), Ez, ez da ``/webmail/`` OIDCren atzeradeia azaleratu."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. ``meta/services.yml`` pins ``sso.enabled: false`` — Matomo holds no Keycloak client, so the OIDC round-trip the shared helper waits for never happens; the administrator signs in on Matomo’s native ``index.php?module=Login`` form against the local superuser configured in ``vars/main.yml``. Biber is blocked for a different reason: the role provisions exactly one Matomo account, that same superuser, and has no per-user provisioning, so biber has no Matomo identity at all."
msgstr "Rol honek adierazten du ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` eta ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` barruan ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. ``meta/services.yml`` orratzak ``sso.enabled: false`` - Matomo ez dauka Keycloak bezeroa, beraz, OIDCk, laguntzaile partekatuak, itxaron egiten du inoiz ez gertatzeko; administratzaileak sinatu egiten du. Matomobertakoa da ``index.php?module=Login`` hemen konfiguratutako supererabiltzaile lokalaren aurkako inprimakia ``vars/main.yml``. Biber beste arrazoi batengatik blokeatuta dago: rol-xedapenek bat egiten dute. Matomo kontu, supererabiltzaile berak, eta ez du erabilerarik, beraz, biber-ek ez du Matomo Identitatea."

