# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Funtzio hau zabaltzen da **Shopware 6** erabiltzea **Docker**. Zure biltegiaren instalazioa, migrazioa eta konfigurazioa automatizatzen ditu, erdikoarekin integratzen da **MariaDB** datu-basea. Aukerako osagaiak: **Redis** eta **OpenSearch** errendimendua eta bilaketa gaitasunak hobetzen ditu; **OIDC** administrazioaren motorra integratzen du **Keycloak**Direktorioko kontuek berdin sinatzen dute: Shopwarek ez du admin-LDAP hedapenik rol hau instala dezan, beraz, LDAPen identitateak hortik zehar iristen dira. KeycloakErabiltzaile-federazioa bere plugin propioaren bidez baino."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
