# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Three settings keys in `vars/main.yml` are silent no-ops on v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` and `security.captcha_secret`. The live `settings` table carries a single `security.captcha` object (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), so all three `UPDATE`s match zero rows and neither `ON_ERROR_STOP` nor the reaper notices. hCaptcha has therefore never been active, which also makes the `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` rationale in `templates/playwright.env.j2` describe protection that is not there. Rewrite the three keys as one object, then decide whether a captcha on the public subscription form is wanted at all."
msgstr "Hiru ezarpeneko gakoak `vars/main.yml` isilik daude ez-opsik v-an6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` eta `security.captcha_secret`. `settings` mahaiak bakar bat darama `security.captcha` objektua (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), beraz, hirurok `UPDATE`s bat dator zero errenkadarekin eta ez bata ez bestea `ON_ERROR_STOP` ezta uzta-emaileak ere. hCaptcha ez da inoiz aktiboa izan, eta horrek ere egiten du `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` Sartu `templates/playwright.env.j2` Bertan ez dagoen babesa deskribatzen du. Hiru gakoak objektu bakar gisa berridatzi, eta gero erabaki ea harpidetza publikoko inprimakian captcha bat nahi den."

