msgid "Today every Infinito.Nexus deploy runs `docker compose` against a single host with volumes on the local filesystem. If a service is rescheduled to another host (maintenance, scaling, node failure) the data is unreachable. This requirement introduces two cooperating capabilities:"
msgstr "Gaur egun Infinito.Nexus deploy run `docker compose` fitxategi-sistema lokaleko bolumenak dituen ostalari bakar baten aurka. Beste ostalari bati zerbitzu bat kentzen bazaio (mantentzea, eskalatzea, nodoen hutsegitea) Datuak ezin dira eskuratu. Baldintza honek bi ahalmen kooperatibo ditu:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Today most role specs gate their authenticated scenarios on `oidc` only, even when the role's `meta/services.yml` also declares `ldap.enabled` and a dedicated LDAP auth plugin / driver is wired in. Consequence: a deploy with `disable=oidc` (LDAP-only mode) makes every authenticated scenario `skip`, leaving the LDAP path untested. The matrix-deploy variant lists in `meta/variants.yml` typically include an LDAP-only variant exactly to exercise that branch (see e.g. [web-app-opencloud/meta/variants.yml](../../roles/web-app-opencloud/meta/variants.yml) where variant 1 sets `ldap.enabled: true` with `oidc.enabled: false`), but the corresponding spec scenario does not exist yet."
msgstr "Gaur egun, rol-espezie gehienek autentifikatutako agertokiak irekitzen dituzte. `oidc` bakarrik, nahiz eta rolak izan `meta/services.yml` adierazten du `ldap.enabled` eta LDAPeko auth plugin/gidari dedikatu bat dago konektatuta. Ondorioa: hedapenarekin `disable=oidc` (LDAP modu bakarra) Autentifikatutako agertoki bakoitza `skip`, LDAPeko bide-izena probarik gabe utziz. Matrize-deploy aldaeraren zerrendak `meta/variants.yml` normalean, sartu LDAPerako bakarrik den aldaera bat adar hori erabiltzeko. (Ikus, adibidez. [web-app-opencloud/meta/variants.yml](../../roles/web-app-opencloud/meta/variants.yml) non aldaera 1 multzoak `ldap.enabled: true` honekin: `oidc.enabled: false`), baina dagokion espektro-egoera ez da oraindik existitzen."

