# libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Upstream ``host:port``: ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; ``<entity>:<internal>`` (alias partekatua) aplikazioaren aurrealdean, edo ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` sidecar izendatuentzat (sso-proxy)A ``host_gateway`` aplikazioak nodo-lokala exekutatzen du eta bere ataka lokala argitaratzen dio ostalariari, beraz, proxy-a gainezkatua bertara iristen da. ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` ostalariaren atebidearen bidez (deitzaileak hau ezartzen du: DEPLOYMENT_MODE, Izan ere, horrelako aplikazioek konposizio-estiloko errendatzera behartzen baitute.)Barne-ataka pila bat falta da."

