# libretranslate
msgid "What a token leaves open belongs to the line it stands in: `priority` covers every remaining combination in one sweep, `whitelist` keeps the rotation and the row's position in the matrix. A pin the row cannot take aborts the matrix rather than dropping the row, because a dropped row would report a green run for a combination that never ran. Such a pin is `@swarm` on a role without its own stack, `+tor` on a variant that pins `services.tor.enabled` false, or any axis that fights the run's own `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` or `architectures` input, or `:arm64` on a role whose `meta/services.yml` declares `architectures: [amd64]`."
msgstr "Token bat irekita uzten duena bere lerroari dagokio: `priority` gainerako konbinazio guztiak miaketa batean estaltzen ditu, `whitelist` matrizean biraketa eta errenkadaren posizioa mantentzen ditu. Lerroak ezin du matrizea abortatu errenkadatik erori baino, eroritako errenkada batek lasterketa berdearen berri emango bailuke inoiz egin ez den konbinazio baterako. Halako orratza da `@swarm` rol bat bere pilarik gabe, `+tor` pintzen duen aldaki batean `services.tor.enabled` faltsua, edo lasterketaren beraren aurka borrokatzen duen edozein ardatz. `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` edo `architectures` sarrera edo `:arm64` rol batean `meta/services.yml` adierazten du `architectures: [amd64]`."

