# libretranslate
msgid "When changing the primary email domain (e.g., from `cymais.cloud` to `infinito.nexus`), it is **not enough** to simply rename mailbox directories on disk. Mailu manages domain and user records in its internal database, and Dovecot maintains index files inside each Maildir. A blind rename will lead to login failures, rejected mail, or corrupted mail indices."
msgstr "Posta elektronikoko domeinu nagusia aldatzean (Adibidez, hemendik `cymais.cloud` - `infinito.nexus`), da **ez da nahikoa** diskoko postontzi-direktorioak izenez aldatzeko. Mailu-k domeinu eta erabiltzaile erregistroak kudeatzen ditu bere datu-basean, eta Dovecot-ek indexatze-fitxategiak mantentzen ditu Maildir bakoitzean. Izen-aldatze itsu batek saio-hasierako hutsegiteak, posta ukatuak edo mezu-indize hondatuak ekarriko ditu."

# libretranslate
msgid "When commits are ready to ship, you MUST instruct the operator to run `git-sign-push` outside the sandbox. The CLI is provided by [git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), declared as a dev dependency in [pyproject.toml](pyproject.toml); install it via `make install-python-dev`."
msgstr "Betekizunak prest daudenean, operadoreari agindu behar diozu exekutatzeko. `git-sign-push` harea-kutxatik kanpo. CLIk ematen du [git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), dev mendekotasun gisa deklaratua [pyproject.toml](pyproject.toml); instalatu honen bidez `make install-python-dev`."

