# libretranslate
msgid "When the log carries the matrix-deploy round/pass markers, the result is segmented (one block of records per variant round + pass). Otherwise a single combined block is returned. Runtime rows are read from the ``ROLES RECAP`` sections only (never ``TASKS RECAP``, whose role-less task rows would double-count); a log without any recap header falls back to reading every profile-shaped line. The recap ``total`` line survives as the ``total`` row so consumers can cross-check the parsed sum. Per-host task results (``ok:``, ``changed:``, ``skipping:``, ``fatal:``, ``failed:`` under a ``TASK [role : ...]`` header) accumulate into each record's ``hosts`` field; delegation targets (``[host -> other]``) count for the source host. Raises FileNotFoundError when the log is absent (the caller turns that into a hard failure)."
msgstr "Erregistroak matrize-deplizioko markatzaileak eramaten dituenean, emaitza segmentatu egiten da (erregistro-bloke bat txanda bakoitzeko + pass-a). Bestela, bloke konbinatu bakarra itzuliko da. Runtime errenkadak irakurri egiten dira ``ROLES RECAP`` atalak bakarrik (Inoiz ez ``TASKS RECAP``, rolik gabeko ilarak zenbatuko lituzke.)Berreskuratu gabeko egunkari batek profilaren formako lerro guztiak irakurtzen ditu. Berreskuratu ``total`` lerroak bizirik irauten du, ``total`` errenkada, kontsumitzaileek analizatutako batura gurutza dezaten. Ostalariko zereginen emaitzak (``ok:``, ``changed:``, ``skipping:``, ``fatal:``, ``failed:`` azpian ``TASK [role : ...]`` goiburua) erregistro bakoitzean pilatu ``hosts`` eremua; delegazioaren helburuak (``[host -> other]``) Iturriko ostalariaren zain. FileNotFoundError igotzen du egunkaria falta denean (Deitzaileak hutsegite gogor bihurtzen du.)."

# libretranslate
msgid "When the oauth2-proxy SSO flavor is active, Snipe-IT’s native ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` is enabled via the ``Setting`` model (``login_remote_user_enabled``, ``login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME``). nginx gates ``/login`` through oauth2-proxy/Keycloak and injects the verified ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`` header, which Snipe-IT matches against ``users.username`` (the user must pre-exist and be activated — sync them via LDAP) to mint a native ``snipeit_session``. Visitors without a matching activated user silently fall through to the normal login form (no error). The password/LDAP login form stays available as a fallback (``login_common_disabled = 0``), and the in-app logout is redirected to the central OIDC end-session URL."
msgstr "Oauth2-proxy SSO zaporea aktibo dago, Snipe-IT bertakoa da. ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` gaitua dago bidez ``Setting`` modeloa (``login_remote_user_enabled``, ``login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME``)nginx ateak ``/login`` oauth bidez2-proxy/proxyKeycloak eta egiaztatua injektatzen du ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`` goiburua, Snipe-IT-ekin bat datorrena ``users.username`` (Erabiltzaileak aurre-existitu eta aktibatu egin behar ditu, LDAP bidez sinkronizatu.) natibo bat mintzeko ``snipeit_session``. Erabiltzaile aktibaturik gabeko bisitariak isilean sartzen dira saio-hasierako forma normalera (errorerik ez). Pasahitza/LDAP-en saio-hasieraren inprimakia eskuragarri dago atzeraldi gisa (``login_common_disabled = 0``)eta sarrera-irteera OIDCren erdiko saio amaierako URLra birbideratua dago."

