msgid "Whether a resolver answers on the bridge is not something the host's own ``resolv.conf`` can say - a systemd-resolved stub and a node dnsmasq both read as loopback-only, and only the second one also binds the bridge. Until that is declared rather than inferred, the bridge may be an address nothing serves, so it never goes out alone: a list that would carry it by itself gets the project's public resolver behind it. Without that the daemon has a single dead nameserver and every container and image build loses DNS."
msgstr "Zubiko ebazle batek erantzuten duen ala ez ostalariaren kontua da ``resolv.conf`` Esan daiteke: sistemaz ebatzitako lasto bat eta dnsmasq nodo bat begizta gisa irakurriak, eta bigarrena bakarrik lotzen du zubia. Hori adierazi baino lehen, zubia ezertarako balio ez duen helbide bat izan daiteke, beraz, ez da inoiz bakarrik aterako: berak eramango lukeen zerrenda batek proiektuaren ebazle publikoa ekarriko du. daemon-ak izen-zerbitzari bakar bat duela eta edukiontzi eta irudi-eraikin guztiek DNSa galtzen dutela."

