# libretranslate
msgid "With the label set, the `detect-affected-roles` job in [entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) calls [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), which runs the [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) module. The module reads the first fenced block whose YAML carries a `roles:` key (the heading text is not matched) and emits that list as the `whitelist` output, which flows into the deploy tests as precedence rung 2 above. Without the label, the diff-driven precedence applies."
msgstr "Etiketa-multzoarekin, `detect-affected-roles` lanean [apiri-aldaketa...orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) deiak [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), horrek gidatzen du [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) modulua. Moduluak lehen hesi-blokea irakurtzen du, YAMLk daramana. `roles:` gakoa (izenburuaren testua ez dator bat) eta zerrenda hori igortzen du `whitelist` irteera, lehen mailako proba gisa zabaltzen dena 2 Goian. Etiketarik gabe, lehentasuna aplikatzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "With the service enabled, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` reads the token stored for ``administrator`` under this role’s id, probes it against the running instance with a JSON-RPC ``initialize`` call, mints a replacement through ``gitlab-rails runner`` when the stored token is missing or rejected, writes the fresh token back through ``sys-token-store``, and fails the deploy when the re-probe is still rejected. The minted token is a personal access token carrying the ``mcp`` scope with a 364-day expiry. That scope is filtered out of the interactive token picker, so tokens for this endpoint are created programmatically."
msgstr "Zerbitzua gaituta dagoenean, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` irakurri gordetako tokena ``administrator`` rol honen id-aren pean, JSON-RPC batekin exekutatzen ari den instantziaren aurka egiten du. ``initialize`` deitu, ordezko bat moztu ``gitlab-rails runner`` Gordetako tokena falta denean edo ezetsita dagoenean, berriro idazten du token berria. ``sys-token-store``, eta huts egiten du deployak, berriro probea baztertua dagoenean. Metatutako tokena sarbide pertsonalaren tokena da, eramaten duena. ``mcp`` esparrua 364-Eguneko iraungipena. Esparru hori token-hautatzaile elkarreragiletik iragazita dago, beraz, amaierako puntu honen tokenak programatik sortzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "With the service enabled, `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` reads the token stored for `administrator` under this role's id, probes it against the running instance with a JSON-RPC `initialize` call, mints a replacement through `gitlab-rails runner` when the stored token is missing or rejected, writes the fresh token back through `sys-token-store`, and fails the deploy when the re-probe is still rejected. The minted token is a personal access token carrying the `mcp` scope with a 364-day expiry. That scope is filtered out of the interactive token picker, so tokens for this endpoint are created programmatically."
msgstr "Zerbitzua gaituta dagoenean, `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` irakurri gordetako tokena `administrator` rol honen id-aren pean, JSON-RPC batekin exekutatzen ari den instantziaren aurka egiten du. `initialize` deitu, ordezko bat moztu `gitlab-rails runner` Gordetako tokena falta denean edo ezetsita dagoenean, berriro idazten du token berria. `sys-token-store`, eta huts egiten du deployak, berriro probea baztertua dagoenean. Metatutako tokena sarbide pertsonalaren tokena da, eramaten duena. `mcp` esparrua 364-Eguneko iraungipena. Esparru hori token-hautatzaile elkarreragiletik iragazita dago, beraz, amaierako puntu honen tokenak programatik sortzen dira."

