# libretranslate
msgid "WordPress's canonical surface is the public blog front page. The OIDC round-trip fires on `/wp-login.php`, which the `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` addon auto-redirects to Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, see [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The journeys themselves are not dropped: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and `test-rbac-roles.js` drives the Keycloak-group-to-WordPress-role mapping over the same entry point."
msgstr "WordPressen azal kanonikoa blogaren orrialde publikoa da. OIDCko tiroak piztu dira `/wp-login.php`, zein den `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` addon auto-zuzenbideei Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, Ikusi [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml))Pertsona partekatuak gunearen erroan sartzen dira eta ez dute inoiz bide hori bisitatzen. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) beraz, `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Bidaiak ez dira bertan behera uzten: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` administratzailearen saioa hasi, saioa amaitu eta lurreratze-afirmazioa gidatzen du, eta `test-rbac-roles.js` gidatzen du Keycloak-Elkartu...WordPress-sarrera-puntu berean mapatzea."

