msgstr "ZUREAK (Zure URL laburtua) Open-source URL laburtzeko soluzio bat da, esteka laburrak erraz sortzeko, jarraitzeko eta kudeatzeko aukera ematen duena. Hedapen horrek Docker aprobetxatzen du ingurune seguru eta erraz eskalagarria eskaintzeko, zure segurtasuna bermatuz. YOURLS instantzia errendimendu eta fidagarritasun optimorako konfiguratuta dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "ZUREAK ez dute jatorrizko SSOrik; administratzaile-saioa oauth-etik moztuta dago2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` pertsona bizi da eta zubia amaitzen da."

# libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "ZUREAK ez dute jatorrizko SSOrik; administratzaile-saioa oauth-etik moztuta dago2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), goiburuaren ohoreak administratzailearen bidean bakarrik eta kideentzat bakarrik. YOURLS Administratzaile taldea. Ateak berak onartzen du RBAC talde bera ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))Horrela `biber` lehen baztertua izan da YOURLS edozer gauza errendatzea: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) adierazten du `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, eta ukapena esplizituki baieztatzen da `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` pertsona bizi da eta zubia amaitzen da."

