# libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD run sandbox-confined commands directly on the host. The sandbox bounds what they can read, write, and reach. See [sandbox.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/claude/sandbox.md)."
msgstr "Sandbox-confined komandoak exekutatu beharko zenituzke zuzenean ostalarian. Harea-kutxak muga egiten du irakurri, idatzi eta iristeko. Ikusi [sandbox.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/claude/sandbox.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD separate mechanical cleanup from behavior changes when that lowers risk."
msgstr "Garbiketa mekanikoa jokabide-aldaketetatik bereizi beharko zenuke arriskua murrizten duenean."

# libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD set `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` to the same value as `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` to disable swap inflation. Allowing swap masks OOM conditions that the real runner would hit."
msgstr "Ezarri behar duzu `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` balio berera `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` truke-inflazioa desgaitzeko. Trukatze-maskarak baimenduz, OOMek benetako korrikalariak jo egingo lituzkeen baldintzak onartzen ditu."

