# libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD use targeted manual CI jobs instead of rerunning the full pipeline if you only need one focused check."
msgstr "CI eskuzko lanak erabili beharko zenituzke hodi osoa birkargatu ordez, fokua duen kontrol bat behar baduzu."

