msgid "[ ] \"Sign in with Bluesky\" completes an AT Protocol OAuth round-trip against the platform PDS provided by [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), and an authenticated user can create a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record that is written to their PDS repo."
msgstr "[ ] \"Sinatu honekin Bluesky\" AT Protocol OAuth bat osatzen du PDS plataformaren aurka. [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), eta autentifikatutako erabiltzaile batek sor dezake `community.lexicon.calendar.event` Erregistroa bere PDS repo-an idatzita dago."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) A Flowise supervisor flow runs a cross-agent pipeline that hands a result from one agent to the other and returns a combined output; single-agent use still works without Flowise. **Blocked:** depends on the criterion above."
msgstr "[ ] (Fasea 2) A Flowise gainbegirale-fluxuak zeharkako hodi bat du, agente batetik bestera emaitza ematen duena eta irteera konbinatua ematen duena; agente bakarreko erabilerak ez du funtzionatzen. Flowise. **Blokeatuta:** Goiko irizpidearen araberakoa da."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) Hermes' and OpenClaw's MCP-server mode is enabled; Flowise connects to both as MCP clients and delegates a task to each. **Blocked:** `stdio_only`, see [Blocked on hardware and on Phase 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."
msgstr "[ ] (Fasea 2) Hermes eta OpenClawMCP zerbitzari modua gaituta dago; Fluxuak MCP bezero gisa konektatzen du eta zeregin bat delegatzen dio bakoitzari. **Blokeatuta:** `stdio_only`, Ikusi [Hardwarean eta fasean blokeatuta 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. how the worker join tokens are persisted, exact NFS export options per distro, how the per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` opt-out is plumbed, exact placement-constraint shape for the swarm-without-nfs warning path, exact openresty `upstream` resolution syntax for swarm-internal DNS) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched question round, BEFORE any file is changed. Once those questions are answered, the agent MUST NOT pause for further clarification. Additional ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the affected role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[ ] **Galderak hasieran bakarrik argitu.** Edozein galdera, zalantza edo erabaki falta (adibidez, langilea tokenekin nola elkartzen den, NFS esportatzeko aukera zehatzak distro bakoitzeko, nola per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` opt-out-a itota dago, leku-erakuslearen forma zehatza, nf-rik gabeko abisu-biderako, irekidura zehatza. `upstream` bereizmenaren sintaxia barneko DNSarentzat) Behin eta berriro igo behar da lasterketaren hasieran, galdera bakar batean, edozein fitxategi aldatu aurretik. Galdera horiek erantzun ondoren, agenteak ez du gelditu behar argibide gehiago lortzeko. Agenteak ebatzi behar ditu bere erabakirik onenak, eragina izan duen paperaren arabera erregistratuta. `README.md` edo kode-iruzkin bat, eta PR-ren berrikuspenean bakarrik berrikusia."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Every ✅ cell is wired**: for each ✅ pair (row → column), the row role declares an addon in its `meta/addons/` that integrates the column role, with `mechanism` set appropriately and (when the column role is an in-repo role) a `bridges:` entry resolving to the row role's `meta/services.yml` service for that target."
msgstr "[ ] **Denak ✅ gelaxka kableatuta dago**: bakoitzarentzat ✅ bikotea (errenkada → zutabea), errenkada-rolak gehigarri bat adierazten du bere baitan `meta/addons/` zutabearen papera integratzen duena, honekin: `mechanism` egoki ezarri eta (zutabearen papera erreposioa denean) a `bridges:` errenkada-funtzioaren sarrera ebaztea `meta/services.yml` helburu horretarako zerbitzua."

