# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ ] A sealed instance is detectable: `/v1/sys/health` returns 503 (asserted by `test-seal-status.js`) and an alert rule fires on that condition. *An `OpenBaoSealed` alert now ships with the role itself, in `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, which the `alert_rule_roles` lookup concatenates into the Prometheus rule file. The health-code contract is asserted by the spec suite and the healthy path was confirmed live (200 in both compose and swarm), but the **firing** condition was never observed — that needs an instance deliberately sealed, which the AppRole-only admin model makes awkward to arrange in a test.* **Correction from implementation:** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, so the gauge is `vault_core_unsealed`, not `openbao_core_unsealed` — and it is unusable as an alert source here: on a healthy, demonstrably unsealed node it is emitted as `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so `== 0` would fire permanently. Use the health endpoint as the primary signal, with `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` as the metric-side corroboration. The alert rule itself is still outstanding."
msgstr "[ ] Kasu itxi bat detekta daiteke: `/v1/sys/health` ematen du 503 (baieztatua `test-seal-status.js`) eta alerta-arau bat dago egoera horretan. *Anitz `OpenBaoSealed` ohartarazi orain rol bera duten ontziak, hemen `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, zein den `alert_rule_roles` bilaketak kateatu egiten ditu Prometheus arau-fitxategia. Osasun-kodearen kontratua zehaztapen-suiteak baieztatzen du eta bide osasuntsua zuzenean baieztatu da (200 konposaketa eta multzoan)baina **tiro** Baldintza ez da inoiz ikusi, instantzia bat behar du nahita zigilatua, AppRole-only admin modeloak zailtzen duena proba batean antolatzeko.* **Zuzenketa inplementaziotik:** OpenBao-k Vault-en izen-espazio metrikoari eusten dio, beraz, zabalera `vault_core_unsealed`, Ez, ez `openbao_core_unsealed` -eta ezin da erabili alerta-iturri gisa hemen: nodo osasuntsu eta argigabe batean igortzen da `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, Horrela `== 0` Betirako erreko nuen. Erabili osasun-puntua seinale nagusi gisa, honekin: `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` alde metrikoko korroborazioa bezala. Alerta-araua bera ere nabarmena da."

