# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Creating an agent optionally provisions a dedicated platform user account via the existing `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mechanism; the agent authenticates as that account (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), and deploying against an existing account instead also works. **Partly done:** the account half is implemented and linted (see [Agent identity](#agent-identity)); the MCP half is **blocked** on no deployed provider offering per-user OAuth, which is the bar [035](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md) sets before `auth_subject: user` may be declared."
msgstr "[ ] Agente bat sortzeak aukera ematen du plataformaren erabiltzaile-kontu bat lehendik dagoenaren bidez. `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mekanismoa; agentea kontu horretan autentifikatu egiten da (OIDC arbeleko saio-hasiera, MCP `auth_subject: user`), eta existitzen den kontu baten aurka ibiltzeak ere funtzionatzen du. **Zati bat eginda:** Kontuaren erdia ezarrita eta lotuta dago (Ikusi [Agentearen identitatea](#agent-identity)); MCP erdia da **blokeatuta** OAuth erabiltzaileko eskaintza hedaturik gabe, hau da, barra [035](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md) ezarri aurretik `auth_subject: user` deklaratu egin daiteke."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Kredentzialak eta URL ezkutuko osagaiak falta dira egunkarietatik, konfigurazio ez-sekretutik, API Erantzunak, ataza irteera, Playwright arrastoak eta salbuespen-testua. **Sei gainazaletatik hiru estatikoki mantentzen dira:** egunkari eta zereginen irteerak: [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), eta horrek eskatzen du `no_log` edo `mask_values` MCPren edozein zereginetan, biek sekretu eta inprimatze bat kudeatzen dute; Playwright arrastoak [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), A debekatzen duena `playwright.env.j2` errendatzea `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` sekretua edo `key_credential` URL osagaia. Ez-sekretuzko konfigurazioak oraindik existitzen ez diren errendatutako fitxategien sailkapen sekretu/ez-sekretu bat behar du; API erantzunak eta salbuespenezko testua exekuzio-faserako behaketak dira."

