# libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the Prometheus administrator RBAC group through the oauth2-proxy gate, so the `biber` persona is denied before it ever reaches a Prometheus page: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. That denial is not lost coverage — this role's own spec asserts it for every consumer, together with the admin reach and scrape-target parity checks. The `administrator` persona is blocked only when `services.sso.enabled` is false: without the co-deployed Keycloak there is no proxy in front of Prometheus, hence no login round-trip and no logout control to drive. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) Aitortzen du bakarrik Prometheus RBAC taldea oauth bidez2-proxy atea, beraz... `biber` persona ukatu egiten da inoiz iritsi aurretik Prometheus Orria: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) adierazten du `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. Ezeztapen hori ez dago estaldura galdurik. Rol horrek bere espeziak kontsumitzaile guztientzat baieztatzen du, administratzailearen irispidearekin eta administratzailearen parekotasun-kontrolekin batera. The `administrator` pertsona blokeatuta dagoenean bakarrik `services.sso.enabled` faltsua da: ez da onartzen Keycloak ez dago proxy-rik aurrean PrometheusBeraz, ez dago saio-hasierarik eta ez dago kontrolik gidatzeko. The `guest` persona eta oinarrizko helgarritasun-afirmazioak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the `web-app-lam` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list in the development inventory. The proxy denies `biber` before LAM is ever reached, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) Aitortzen du bakarrik `web-app-lam` RBAC taldea oauth-era2-proxy-a (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`)eta `biber` Rol-zerrenda hutsa dauka garapen-inbentarioan. Proxy-ak ukatu egiten du `biber` lehenago LAM Inoiz iritsi da, beraz, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) adierazten du `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."

# libretranslate
