msgstr "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) administratzaileak bakarrik haziko du Magentoadmin taula (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, kredentzialak [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` motorra oauth bidez bakarrik iristen da2-proxy-a deklaratuta [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). In the `services.sso.enabled: false` proxy-a falta den matrize-aldaerak eta `biber` ez du jatorrizko konturik. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) errendatzea `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` persona bere jatorrizko saio-hasiera mantentzen du `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` eta aldaki guztietan doa."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) creates the account with `tootctl accounts create` and never sets or captures a password, so `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — the Keycloak secret — cannot drive Mastodon's native `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` has no Mastodon account at all, since the OIDC sign-in ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The SeaweedFS companion scenario ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) drives the same admin journey and skips on the same flag."
msgstr "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) kontua sortzen du `tootctl accounts create` eta inoiz ez du pasahitzik ezarri edo harrapatu, beraz, `ADMIN_PASSWORD` - Keycloak sekretua - ezin da gidatu Mastodonbertakoa da `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` ez du Mastodon kontua, OIDCk sinatu zuenetik ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) bat sortuko lukeen bide bakarra da. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrize-aldaerak kendu egiten dira, beraz [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) errendatzea `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The SeaweedFS lagunaren agertokia ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) admin bidaia bera gidatzen du eta bandera berean saltatzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) runs after `update.php`. It includes the shared gateway consumer contract, then reads both globals back out of the running container with `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` and asserts the provider, the base URL and the model, so an unconfigured surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) korrika `update.php`. Sarbide partekatua duen kontsumo-kontratua barne hartzen du, eta gero bi globalak berriro irakurtzen ditu edukiontzitik. `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` Hornitzailea, oinarrizko URLa eta modeloa baieztatzen ditu, beraz, konfiguratu gabeko gainazal bat ezin da hedapen berde batera iritsi."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) creates a dedicated non-superuser owner (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, unusable password) plus its own workspace, and binds the endpoint to that pair."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) supererabiltzailea ez den jabea sortzen du (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, pasahitz erabilezina) bere laneko areaz gain, amaiera-puntua lotzen dio bikote horri."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) waits for the ExApp heartbeat, registers the deploy daemon and the ExApp (route `^/mcp`, verbs `POST,GET,DELETE`, access level `1`), enables the ExApp, mints an app password for the dedicated MCP account via `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, persists it through `sys-token-store` under `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, and asserts that an authenticated `initialize` call answers `200`."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) ExApp-ren taupadaren zain, deploy daemon-a eta ExApp-a erregistratzen ditu (Ibilbidea `^/mcp`, aditzak `POST,GET,DELETE`, sarbide maila `1`), ExApp-ri aukera ematen dio, MCPren kontu dedikaturako aplikazio-pasahitz bat egiten du `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, irauten du. `sys-token-store` azpian `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, Autentifikatua dela baieztatzen du `initialize` erantzun `200`."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) wires Keycloak as the only login provider this role configures, and [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) creates no Mobilizon account; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) additionally closes the database login whenever LDAP is on. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants neither persona has credentials, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) hariak Keycloak rol hau konfiguratzeko saio-hasierako hornitzaile bakarra denez, eta [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) ez Mobilizon kontua; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) LDAP piztuta dagoenean, datu-basearen saioa ixten du. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrize aldaerek ez dute kredentzialik. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) errendatzea `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona eta oinarrizko baieztapenak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) seeds only the administrator into SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` reaches the app through SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak, where `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` mints the account on first assertion. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants there is no SAML entry point and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` for the generic persona journeys (the LDAP spec still signs `biber` in from the directory). The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) administratzaileak bakarrik haziko du SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` aplikaziora iristen da SuiteCRMSAML saio-hasiera propioaren aurka KeycloakNon `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` Kontuak lehen baieztapenarekin nahasten ditu. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrize-aldaerarik ez dago SAML sarrera-punturik eta `biber` ez du jatorrizko konturik. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) errendatzea `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` pertsona generikoaren bidaietarako (LDAPeko espektroak oraindik seinaleak ditu `biber` direktorioaren barruan). The `administrator` persona bere jatorrizko saio-hasiera mantentzen du `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` eta aldaki guztietan doa."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in every matrix variant, because the shared persona helper cannot drive this role's sign-in in any of them. Three independent reasons, each sufficient on its own:"
msgstr "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) errendatzea `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` Matrize-aldaera bakoitzean, pertsona laguntzaile partekatuak ezin duelako rol hori edozeinetan erabili. Hiru arrazoi independente, bakoitza bere kabuz aski:"

