msgid "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) is an open-source, AT-Protocol-native event platform. Its defining property is that **events live on the user's account, not on the app**: an event is a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record and an RSVP is a `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` record, both stored in the user's Personal Data Server (PDS) repo. The atmo app itself is \"just a view\" (an appview/aggregator) over those records, so RSVPs and events are portable across any app on the open social web."
msgstr "[atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) Open-source bat da, AT-Protocol-native gertaera-plataforma. Bere propietate definitzailea da: **gertaerak erabiltzailearen kontura bizi dira, ez aplikazioan.**: gertaera bat da `community.lexicon.calendar.event` erregistroa eta RSVP bat dira `community.lexicon.calendar.rsvp` erregistroa, biak erabiltzailearen datu pertsonalen zerbitzarian gordeta (PDS) Erantzun. Atmo aplikazioa bera da \"ikuspegi bat besterik ez\" (appview/agregator) Erregistro horien gainean, RSVPak eta gertaerak eramangarriak dira sare sozial irekiaren aplikazio guztietan."

