msgid "[pr.sh](../../../../../scripts/github/update/open/pr.sh) reads `APP_SLUG` from the environment and resolves the App's bot user via `gh api /users/<slug>[bot]`. The resolved login and numeric user ID are written into `git config user.name` and `git config user.email` in the `<id>+<slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com` form that GitHub accepts for verified commits. When `APP_SLUG` is unset, the script falls back to the `github-actions[bot]` identity. That branch is reached only when the script is invoked outside the workflow, for example a local smoke test where the caller has set `GH_TOKEN` to something other than an App token."
msgstr "[pr.sh](../../../../../scripts/github/update/open/pr.sh) irakurri `APP_SLUG` ingurunetik eta App-en bot-aren erabiltzailea ebazten du `gh api /users/<slug>[bot]`. Ebatzitako saio-hasiera eta zenbakizko erabiltzailearen IDa idatzita daude `git config user.name` eta `git config user.email` barruan `<id>+<slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com` GitHub-ek onartutako inprimakia, egiaztatze-betebeharretarako. Noiz `APP_SLUG` ezarri gabe dago, scripta atzera doa `github-actions[bot]` Identitatea. Adar hori scriptari lan-fluxutik kanpo deitzen zaionean bakarrik iristen da, adibidez dei-egileak ezarritako ke-proba lokal bat. `GH_TOKEN` Aplikazio-tokena ez den beste zerbait."

