# libretranslate
msgid "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` is invoked inside a dedicated runner sub-container (image: `services.matrix.runner.image`, built locally from `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) so its Ansible runtime is isolated from Infinito-Nexus's. The runner mounts the Docker socket, systemd dirs, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, and the MDAD checkout from the deploy container. A `mount --make-rshared /` runs once in the deploy container before the runner starts because MDAD's systemd units bind-mount with `bind-propagation=slave`."
msgstr "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` lasterkari bati azpikontratista dedikatu baten barruan deitzen zaio (irudia: `services.matrix.runner.image`, lokalki eraikia `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) Beraz, bere exekuzio-denbora amaigabetik isolatua dago. Korrikalariak Docker socket-a muntatzen du, dir-dir sistematuak, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, eta MDAD-ren txekea, berriz, hustutako edukiontzitik. A `mount --make-rshared /` behin exekutatzen da deploy edukiontzian korrikalaria hasi baino lehen, MDADen unitateak lotu egiten direlako `bind-propagation=slave`."

