# libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n 1.100.1 is declared as an SSE client and a Streamable HTTP server, and its managed credentials and workflows are idempotently provisioned through supported public APIs. The server moved from 1.95.3's SSE-only trigger because Open WebUI 0.11.0 ships only a Streamable HTTP client and answered the SSE route with a POST that n8n refused with 404. `meta/mcp.yml` declares `direction: both` and `transport: streamable_http` at `/mcp/infinito-mcp`; `files/python/provision/mcp.py` renders the server workflow and `files/python/provision/client.py` the agent workflow, both through `/api/v1/workflows`. Credentials go through `/rest` because the public API of that tag exposes only create and delete for them, which cannot converge an existing one. Two idempotence defects were fixed here: the run reported `CHANGED` forever, because the public-API key it minted was found again on the next run and counted as a change, and that key was left standing in n8n afterwards although nothing read it. It is now minted per run, revoked before the run ends, and no longer reported."
msgstr "[x] n8n 1.100.1 SSE bezero eta HTTP zerbitzari Streamable gisa aitortzen da, eta kudeatutako kredentzialak eta lan-fluxuak API publikoen bidez ematen dira. Zerbitzaria lekuz aldatu da 1.95.3SSE-k bakarrik eragiten du, zeren Open WebUI 0.11.0 HTTP bezero korrontetsu bat besterik ez zen, eta SSEren ibilbideari erantzun zion POST batekin, n8N ukatuta 404. `meta/mcp.yml` adierazten du `direction: both` eta `transport: streamable_http` at `/mcp/infinito-mcp`; `files/python/provision/mcp.py` zerbitzariaren fluxua errendatzea eta `files/python/provision/client.py` agentearen lan-fluxua, biak `/api/v1/workflows`. Kredentzialak pasatzen dira `/rest` publikoa delako API Etiketa horren bidez sortu eta ezabatu egiten dira, eta horrek ezin du bat egin. Bi akats konpondu dira hemen: `CHANGED` Betiko, publikoak...API Hurrengo lasterketan berriro aurkitu zuten eta aldaketa gisa zenbatu zuten, eta giltza hori n-n zegoen.8Geroago, nahiz eta ezer irakurri ez. Orain errebokatu egiten da exekuzioko, errebokatua amaitu aurretik, eta ez da gehiago jakinarazi."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n client nodes use exact tool include lists; server triggers require Bearer auth, expose only connected checked-in tools, and remain disabled until operator opt-in. Each client node renders `include: selected` with the provider's own `mcp.tools.allowlist`, which the discovery snapshot now carries; the node's default is `all`, so an omitted list would hand the agent every tool an upstream happens to serve. The server trigger pins `authentication: bearerAuth` against a managed `httpBearerAuth` credential, and the surface ships `enabled: false`. \"Only connected checked-in tools\" is upstream's own mechanism: `getConnectedTools` in `@utils/helpers` collects exactly what reaches the trigger over an `ai_tool` connection, so the workflow's connection map is the allowlist. The workflow previously connected nothing at all, so the trigger served an empty tool set; it now carries one checked-in read tool, `infinito_health`, with an explicit input schema."
msgstr "[x] n8n bezero-nodoek tresna zehatzak erabiltzen dituzte; zerbitzari-abiarazleek Bearer auth behar dute, konektatutako tresna bakarrik erakutsi, eta desgaitu egiten dira operadorearen aukera arte. Bezeroen nodo bakoitza errendatzen da `include: selected` hornitzailearenarekin `mcp.tools.allowlist`, Aurkikuntzaren argazkiak orain daramana, nodoaren lehenetsia da `all`, Beraz, zerrenda ez-onartu batek emango lioke agenteari tresna guztiak ibaian gora funtziona dezan. Zerbitzariak abiarazle-makilak `authentication: bearerAuth` kudeaketa baten aurka `httpBearerAuth` Kredentziala, eta gainazaleko ontziak `enabled: false`. \"Konektatutako tresna bakarrak\" Upstream-en mekanismoa da: `getConnectedTools` barruan `@utils/helpers` abiarazlera iristen dena jasotzen du. `ai_tool` konexioa, beraz, fluxuaren konexio-mapa baimen-zerrenda da. Lan-fluxuak ez zuen ezer konektatu, beraz, abiarazleak tresna huts bat erabili zuen; orain irakurgailu-tresna bat dauka, `infinito_health`, Sarrera eskema esplizitu batekin."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n tests cover creation, update, activation, authenticated tool listing and call, wrong/missing bearer rejection, rerun idempotence, and cleanup limited to managed resources. Creation, update, activation, rerun idempotence and the cleanup boundary are unit-tested in [test_mcp.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_mcp.py) and [test_client.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_client.py), including that a converged deployment reports `OK`, that a credential or workflow outside the managed names is never touched, and that a provider which vanished loses only its own credential. The authenticated half runs at deploy time through the shared contract probe, which opens an MCP session, lists tools against the declared allowlist, calls the read tool, and separately proves that an anonymous and a wrong-bearer probe are both refused a session. It cannot be a browser test: the bearer must not reach a Playwright environment file."
msgstr "[x] n8n probak sorkuntza, eguneraketa, aktibazioa, autentifikatutako tresna-zerrenda eta dei, oker/desgaituta eramantzailearen arbuioa, idempotence birruna eta baliabide kudeatuetara mugatutako garbiketa estaltzen ditu. Kreazioa, eguneratzea, aktibazioa, idempotence birruna eta garbiketa-muga unitate-probak dira [test_mcp.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_mcp.py) eta [test_client.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_client.py), Instrukzioen txosten bateratua barne `OK`, Kudeatutako izenetatik kanpoko kredentzial edo lan fluxu bat inoiz ez dela ukitzen, eta desagertu den hornitzaile batek bere kredentziala bakarrik galtzen duela. Autentifikatutako erdia kontratu partekatuaren proben bidez exekutatzen da, MCP saio bat irekitzen duena, onartutako baimen-zerrendaren aurkako tresnak zerrendatzen dituena, irakurketa-tresna deitzen du, eta banan-banan frogatzen du proba anonimo eta oker bat saio bati uko egiten diotela. Ezin da arakatzailearen proba izan: eramaileak ez du Playwright inguruneko fitxategi batera iritsi behar."

