# libretranslate
msgid "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), from `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` in [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) belongs to GitLab's built-in `root` account, not to the Keycloak `administrator` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for `biber` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), Hemendik `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` barruan [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) da GitLabbarruan dago `root` kontua, ez kontua. Keycloak `administrator` erabiltzaile-izena pertsonarekin sinatzen duena, eta ez GitLab kontua da `biber` Inolaz ere, OmniAuthen zeinua da bat sortuko lukeen bide bakarra. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrize-aldaerak kendu egiten dira, beraz [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) errendatzea `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona eta oinarrizko baieztapenak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

