# libretranslate
msgid "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ is a frontend for emulators, game engines, and media players powered by the `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ framework. It supports multiple UI styles including `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ and `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, and provides a unified interface for retro gaming across platforms."
msgstr "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ emulatzaile, joko-motor eta multimedia-jokalarientzako aurrealde bat da. `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ markoa. Hainbat UI estilo onartzen ditu, besteak beste `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ eta `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, eta interfaze bateratua eskaintzen du plataformetan zehar retro jokorako."

# libretranslate
msgid "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ is a Node.js-based front-end application that simulates a roulette wheel in the browser."
msgstr "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ a Node.js-lehen mailako aplikazioa arakatzailean erruleta-gurpil bat simulatzen duena."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (base64 32 bytes, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) encrypts stored access keys; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` secure sessions."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (oinarria64 32 byte, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) Gordetako sarbide-gakoak enkriptatzen ditu; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` Saio seguruak."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed the first admin (no setup wizard)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` hazi lehen administratzailea (konfigurazioaren morroirik ez)."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (file at `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres uses `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (fitxategia `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres-ek erabiltzen du `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus attribute mappings (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, gehi atributuen mapaketak (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON map. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (issuer), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect path is `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore has native OIDC — no `oauth2-proxy` sidecar needed.**"
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON mapa. Hornitzailea: `display_name`, `provider_url` (jaulkitzailea), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. berbideratze-bidea da `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaforoak berezko OIDC du, ez `oauth2-proxy` sidecar behar zen.**"

# libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` sets the externally-reachable base URL; required for correct OIDC redirects behind `sys-svc-proxy`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` kanpoko URL atzigarria ezartzen du; OIDC zuzentzeko behar da `sys-svc-proxy`."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` is emptied so the container never fetches the app catalog from github.com. Set it to a self-hosted catalog when one exists."
msgstr "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` hustuta dago, edukiontziak ez du inoiz aplikazioen katalogoa eskuratzen. github.com. Jar ezazu auto-ostatutako katalogo batean existitzen denean."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` is unset — the SPA is same-origin. Needed only if a third-party client should talk to the API."
msgstr "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` Ez dago ezarrita, SPA bera da. Beste bezero batek hitz egin behar badu bakarrik. API."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` is pinned to 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` so the app's media cap stays inside `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Raising one without the other lets the volume outgrow its declared budget."
msgstr "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` lotuta dago 4 GiB sartu `vars/main.yml` beraz, aplikazioaren euskarri-kapela barruan geratuko da `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Batak bestea gabe hazteak bolumenak bere aurrekontua gainditzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ is a cryptographic network protocol for operating network services securely over an unsecured network. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ project provides the reference implementation, including ``ssh-agent`` for managing authentication keys."
msgstr "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ Sareko zerbitzuen sareko protokoloa da, sare ez-seguru batean modu seguruan erabiltzeko. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ proiektuak erreferentziaren inplementazioa eskaintzen du, besteak beste ``ssh-agent`` autentifikazio-gakoak kudeatzeko."

# libretranslate
msgid "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (string): desired state (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"
msgstr "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (katea): Nahi den egoera (`started`, `restarted`,...)"

msgid "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ is a metasearch engine. It forwards a query to other search engines and returns the merged result without an account and without a tracking profile."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, and files. It exposes an S3-compatible API, so applications store and retrieve objects with standard S3 SDKs and CLIs."
msgstr "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ blobak, objektuak eta fitxategiak gordetzeko sistema azkar banatua da. S bat erakusten du3-bateragarria APIBeraz, aplikazioek objektuak gorde eta eskuratzen dituzte S estandarrarekin.3 SDKak eta CLIak."

# libretranslate
msgid "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ is a modern web UI and API for running Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plans, and shell scripts on a schedule or on demand. This role deploys the official ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`__ container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy with central PostgreSQL, native Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, and optional LDAP login."
msgstr "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ webgune modernoa da eta API Joko-liburu ansibleak, Terraform/OpenTofu planak eta shell-eko scriptak ordutegi edo eskaera batean exekutatzeko. Funtzio honek ofiziala zabaltzen du ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>` Edukiontzia atzean Infinito.Nexus alderantzizko proxya erdikoarekin PostgreSQLbertakoa Keycloak OIDC saio-hasiera bakarrekoa eta aukerako LDAP saio-hasiera."

