# libretranslate
msgid "``--matrix`` renders the full ordered candidate list, so the matrix order IS the selection priority. Every human-facing view of that list goes through here rather than re-deriving the sort and the filter: hand-rolling ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` reads the wrong column (``compose`` is what a role can do, ``test_compose`` is what CI tests), which silently shows an order no run will ever take."
msgstr "``--matrix`` Hautagaien zerrenda osoa errendatzen du, eta matrize-ordena da hautapenaren lehentasuna. Zerrenda horren giza begirada oro hemendik igarotzen da ordena eta iragazkia berriro sortu ordez: eskuz korritzea ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` okerreko zutabea irakurtzen du (``compose`` Hori da rol batek egin dezakeena. ``test_compose`` CI probak), eta horrek isilean erakusten du ez dela inoiz beteko agindurik."

