msgid "``False`` when the covered variant pins ``services.tor.enabled`` to a literal false, ``True`` otherwise. A reactive Jinja flag counts as capable: it is the role saying \"onion when the node is dark\". Consulting the variant matters -- roles pin the gate ``true`` in variant 0 and ``false`` in the rest, so reading only the base config claims an onion for rounds that deliberately run without one."
msgstr "``False`` estalitako aldaki pinak ``services.tor.enabled`` hitzez hitz faltsua, ``True`` bestela. Jinja bandera erreaktiboak gai gisa balio du: \"tipula nodoa iluna denean\"Aldaerari buruzko aholkularitza - rolek atea gurutzatzen dute ``true`` aldagarrian 0 eta ``false`` Gainerakoan, beraz, oinarri-konfigurazioa soilik irakurriz, bat ere gabe nahita exekutatzen diren biribiletarako tipula bat eskatzen du."

# libretranslate
msgid "``GH_TOKEN`` env var"
msgstr "``GH_TOKEN`` env var"

# libretranslate
msgid "``GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD`` (```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__, from ``GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD`` in ```vars/main.yml`` <./vars/main.yml>`__) belongs to GitLab’s built-in ``root`` account, not to the Keycloak ``administrator`` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for ``biber`` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the ``services.sso.enabled: false`` matrix variants that path is removed, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "``GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD`` (```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__, from ``GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD`` in ```vars/main.yml`` <./vars/main.yml>`__) belongs to GitLab’s built-in ``root`` account, not to the Keycloak ``administrator`` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for ``biber`` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the ``services.sso.enabled: false`` matrix variants that path is removed, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona eta oinarrizko baieztapenak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

