msgid "`ansible` (default) wraps [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from `services.matrix.*` knobs, and disables MDAD's bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "`ansible` (lehenetsia) itzulbiratu [matrize-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD)MDAD exekutatzen da ~70 Goiko errekak Synapse, Element, onartutako zubi guztiak, Element Call eta Jitsi entregatzeko. Infinito.Nexus MDAD egikaritzearen arabera, MDADen inbentarioa egiten du `services.matrix.*` knobs, eta MDADen Traefik / Postgres / pakete sorta desgaitzen du Redis Beraz, Infinito zentralak pila berreskuratu zuen."

