# libretranslate
msgid "`distros` (optional; empty spreads the rows over every declared distro), `filesystem` (optional; empty spreads them over `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (optional), `priority` (optional; app ids sorted to the head of the list and cut into chunks of their own, so every priority row is deployed before the first regular one starts, and deployed in every combination it can take: each variant × each offered mode × Tor and clearnet, in one sweep), `mode` (default `auto`), `sweep`, `resume_from_chunk` (default `0`), `chunk_gate` (default `true`), `image_wait_attempts` (default `1980`), `image_wait_sleep_seconds` (default `10`), `workspace` (default `auto`)"
msgstr "`distros` (Aukerakoa; hutsik, errenkadak zabaltzen ditu adierazitako distro guztietan.), `filesystem` (Aukerakoa; hutsik zabaltzen ditu. `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (Aukerakoa), `priority` (Aukerakoa; aplikazioen id-ak zerrendako burura ordenatu eta bere zatietan ebakitzen dira, beraz, lehentasun-errenkada bakoitza lehen mailakoa hasi baino lehen zabaltzen da, eta hartzen dituen konbinazio guztietan hedatzen da: aldaki bakoitza × Tor eta klasketa bakarrean.), `mode` (lehenetsia `auto`), `sweep`, `resume_from_chunk` (lehenetsia `0`), `chunk_gate` (lehenetsia `true`), `image_wait_attempts` (lehenetsia `1980`), `image_wait_sleep_seconds` (lehenetsia `10`), `workspace` (lehenetsia `auto`)"

# libretranslate
msgid "`distros` (optional; empty spreads the rows over every declared distro), `filesystem` (optional; empty spreads them over `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (optional; `__ALL__` forces full deploy, empty triggers diff derivation, any other value is verbatim), `lifecycles`, `mode` (default `auto`), `priority` (optional; priority rows get chunks of their own, the regular chunks run after them), `offset` (default `0`; a row count or a selection token naming where the regular line resumes), `chunk_gate` (default `true`), `sweep` (optional; empty means the run number)"
msgstr "`distros` (Aukerakoa; hutsik, errenkadak zabaltzen ditu adierazitako distro guztietan.), `filesystem` (Aukerakoa; hutsik zabaltzen ditu. `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (Aukerakoa; `__ALL__` indar guztiz hedatuak, abiarazle hutsek diff derivation, beste edozein balio literala da), `lifecycles`, `mode` (lehenetsia `auto`), `priority` (hautazkoa; lehentasun-errendek beren zatiak jasotzen dituzte, zati arruntak haien atzetik korrika.), `offset` (lehenetsia `0`; errenkada-kontaketa edo hautapen-token bat, lerro erregularrak berriro hasten diren lekua izendatzeko.), `chunk_gate` (lehenetsia `true`), `sweep` (Aukerakoa; hutsa da exekuzioaren zenbakia.)"

