msgid "`skipped` counts as passed, so an empty chunk never blocks the chain. After fixing what broke a sweep, `resume_from_chunk` re-enters at that index instead of re-running the green chunks. Both are inputs on `entry-manual-steer.yml`; the other entry points take the defaults. A retrigger carries the source run's `chunk_gate` over unless `infinito administration deploy ci trigger --chunk-gate false` overrides it; the `i8ciallon` alias is `i8ciall` with that override, for sweeps that should report every chunk before anyone looks."
msgstr "`skipped` Pasatu ahala zenbatzen du, beraz, zati huts batek ez du katea ixten. Garbiketa hautsi zuena konpondu ondoren, `resume_from_chunk` indize horretan berriro sartzen da, zati berdeak berriro exekutatu ordez. Biak sarreratan daude `entry-manual-steer.yml`; Beste sarrera-puntuek lehenespenak hartzen dituzte. Arbitro batek gidatzen du iturburuko korrika. `chunk_gate` ez bada `infinito administration deploy ci trigger --chunk-gate false` gainjartzen du; `i8ciallon` aliasa da `i8ciall` gainjarri horrekin, edozeinek ikusi aurretik zati bakoitzaren berri eman beharko lukeen miaketan."

