msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd-en HTTP azalera bakarra da `ejabberd_web_admin` - `/admin` (Ikusi [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). LDAPen aurkako JID bat identifikatzen du HTTP Basic-en, beraz ez dago Keycloak Jarraitu beharreko birbideratzea eta klik egiteko saio-hasierako kontrolik ez; bezeroen autentifikazioa bera portuen gainetik doa 5222/5269 eta Playwright begiztatik kanpo geratzen da, Watch Points-en arabera. `acl.admin` JID administratzaileak bakarrik zerrendatzen ditu, beraz, web-administratzaileak beste kontu guztiak baztertzen ditu. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) beraz, `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona eta oinarrizko helgarritasun-afirmazioak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd-en ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI da Playwright-testable gainazal bakarra; XMPP bezero-saioa bera exekutatzen ari da. 5222/5269 eta baten bidez egin behar da. XMPP-Bete-bezeroa Playwright probako begiztatik kanpo."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd-en HTTP azalera bakarra da ``ejabberd_web_admin`` - ``/admin`` (Ikusi ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona eta oinarrizko helgarritasun-afirmazioak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

