# libretranslate
msgid "pgAdmin's own login id is the account e-mail `PGADMIN_DEFAULT_EMAIL` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)), not the Keycloak `administrator` username, so the `administrator` persona has no in-app credential once it is through the oauth2-proxy. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) additionally admits only the `web-app-pgadmin` administrator RBAC group to that proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list, so it is denied before pgAdmin is reached. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "pgAdmin-en saio-hasierako IDa kontuaren posta da `PGADMIN_DEFAULT_EMAIL` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml))Ez, ez da Keycloak `administrator` erabiltzaile-izena, beraz, `administrator` personak ez du aplikazioko kredentzialik oauth bidez dagoenean2-proxy. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) gainera, onartzen du soilik `web-app-pgadmin` RBACeko administratzaileak proxy horri (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`)eta `biber` Rol-zerrenda hutsa dauka, beraz, ukatu egiten da pgAdmin iritsi aurretik. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) beraz, `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` eta `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona eta oinarrizko baieztapenak baldintzarik gabe exekutatzen dira."

