# libretranslate
msgid "⚠️ **Do not paste that expression into a workflow that listens on `pull_request_target`.** There `github.ref` is the *base* branch, so `github.ref_name` is literally `main` and the rule collapses to a constant `false` — every pull request would stop cancelling its predecessor. `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` therefore declares `cancel-in-progress: true` outright."
msgstr "⚠️ **Ez itsatsi adierazpen hori entzuten den lan-fluxu batean `pull_request_target`.** Hor dago `github.ref` da *oinarria* adarra, beraz `github.ref_name` literalki `main` eta araua konstante batera erortzen da `false` -Eskari bakoitzak aurrekoa bertan behera uzteari utziko lioke. `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` beraz, `cancel-in-progress: true` Ederki."

# libretranslate
msgid "⚠️ **Forced overwrite — do not work in `main`.** When the sync runs, the current repository's `main` is **force-pushed** from the source repository's `main`. Any commit that exists only on the fork's `main` is **discarded without warning** on the next push to any covered branch. Never commit or merge work directly into `main` on a synced repository. Always work on a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, or `hotfix/**` branch; treat `main` as a read-only mirror of the source. If you must use `main` as a working branch, disable the sync first (see **To disable the sync** below)."
msgstr "⚠️ **Behartutako gainidaztea - ez du funtzionatzen `main`.** Sink. exekutatzen denean, uneko biltegia `main` da **indar-pushed** biltegiaren iturburutik `main`Sardexkan bakarrik existitzen den edozein egintza `main` da **abisurik gabe** hurrengo bultzada edozein adar estalira. Inoiz ez da lan egin edo elkartu zuzenean `main` biltegi sinkronizatu batean. Beti lanean a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, edo `hotfix/**` adarra; tratatu `main` Iturria irakurtzeko soilik den ispilu gisa. Erabili behar baduzu `main` eragiketa gisa, lehen sinkronizazioa desgaitzen du (Ikusi**Sinkronizazioa desgaitzeko** behean)."

